{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"77c7e30b-7606-41d6-8616-2c3c2d329679","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full problem space. Let me focus on Q1.1:\n\n**Q1.1**: MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程是什么？（具体到伪代码或张量计算层面，含计算图结构和数据依赖关系，侧重分析各模型推理流程中的硬件瓶颈点——如 MoE 的 expert 路由开销与 GPU memory hierarchy 的交互、DiT 的迭代去噪对计算单元利用率的影响、多模态的跨模态融合在异构计算单元上的映射、Video 的时空 attention 对访存带宽的压力）\n\n**预关键词**: MoE推理流程, MoE inference pipeline, expert routing, gating mechanism, top-k selection, DiT扩散推理, Diffusion Transformer inference, denoising loop, timestep embedding, 多模态融合推理, multimodal fusion, cross-attention, vision encoder, text encoder, Video推理, video inference, temporal attention, spatial attention, 3D convolution, 计算图依赖, computation graph, data dependency, 张量并行, 单请求延迟, single-request latency, 硬件瓶颈, hardware bottleneck\n\n**侧重**: 硬件体系结构\n\nNow let me perform semantic segmentation and search across the four directories. Let me break down the question into semantic sub-clauses:\n\n1. MoE 模型的单请求推理计算流程（伪代码/张量计算层面）\n2. DiT 模型的单请求推理计算流程\n3. 多模态模型的单请求推理计算流程\n4. Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程\n5. 计算图结构和数据依赖关系\n6. 硬件瓶颈分析（MoE expert路由开销与GPU memory hierarchy交互、DiT迭代去噪对计算单元利用率、多模态跨模态融合在异构计算单元映射、Video时空attention对访存带宽压力）\n\nLet me search across the four directories for each semantic group. I'll parallelize the searches.\n\nKey semantic groups for searching:\n- Group A: MoE inference pipeline, expert routing, gating mechanism, top-k selection\n- Group B: DiT/Diffusion Transformer inference, denoising loop, timestep embedding\n- Group C: Multimodal fusion inference, cross-attention, vision encoder, text encoder\n- Group D: Video inference, temporal attention, spatial attention, 3D convolution\n- Group E: Computation graph, data dependency, hardware bottleneck, memory hierarchy\n- Group F: Single-request latency, tensor parallelism\n\nLet me run parallel searches across the four directories. I'll batch them efficiently.","signature":"77c7e30b-7606-41d6-8616-2c3c2d329679"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23836,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1400c830-3ceb-461e-ab89-93ccaeb5973d","uuid":"a5715f47-7e9e-408f-8dea-13f96a9b504e"}
