{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_EBm28BSeS1CXtKXI9kvV1342","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Choice Routing (Expert-Choice MoE).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Choice Routing (Expert-Choice MoE)\",\"score\":4964.943554626729,\"foundWords\":[\"moe\",\"inference\",\"expert\",\"expertchoicerouter\",\"expert-choice\",\"expertschoose\",\"experts\",\"routing\",\"routing（专家选择路由）是\",\"routing（每个\",\"sparse\",\"gating\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Expert\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Routing\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"Expert-Choice\",\"offset\":26},{\"match\":\"MoE\",\"offset\":40},{\"match\":\"Expert\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"Routing（专家选择路由）是\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"MoE\",\"offset\":146},{\"match\":\"Routing（每个\",\"offset\":173},{\"match\":\"expert\",\"offset\":263},{\"match\":\"p-2 ga\",\"offset\":714},{\"match\":\"精准。\\nEx\",\"offset\":815},{\"match\":\"ice Rou\",\"offset\":829},{\"match\":\"ch `sp\",\"offset\":1795},{\"match\":\"ers/rou\",\"offset\":1809},{\"match\":\"包含 `ExpertsCh\",\"offset\":1834},{\"match\":\"提供 `ExpertChoiceRo\",\"offset\":1915},{\"match\":\"tch infer\",\"offset\":2130},{\"match\":\"-of-Exp\",\"offset\":2190},{\"match\":\"ith Ex\",\"offset\":2203},{\"match\":\"ice Rou\",\"offset\":2217}],\"excerpt\":\"## Expert Choice Routing (Expert-Choice MoE)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nExpert Choice Routing（专家选择路由）是 Zhou et al. (2022) 提出的一种 MoE 路由策略，与传统的 Token-Choice Routing（每个 token 独立选择 top-k 个专家）相反，该方法让每个**专家**独立选择 top-k 个**token**。具体流程：(1) 计算 token-to-expert affinity matrix S = Softmax(X · W…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md\",\"basename\":\"Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism\",\"score\":3989.0560538829113,\"foundWords\":[\"moe\",\"moe-based\",\"inference\",\"expert\",\"expert。固定\",\"experts\",\"routing\",\"routing）是常用折中（如mixtral-8x7b）。更细粒度的moe（如deepseek-v2）使