.md\",\"basename\":\"CLA (Cross-Layer Attention)\",\"score\":584.0403443640922,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-layer\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Layer\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":20},{\"match\":\"Cross-Layer\",\"offset\":77},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1078},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1164},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1236}],\"excerpt\":\"## CLA (Cross-Layer Attention)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Layer Attention (CLA) 是 Brandon et al. (2024) 提出的 KV cache 压缩技术：相邻的 Transformer layers 共享同一组 KV cache，而非每层独立维护。CLA 从 \\\"layer 维度\\\" 压缩 KV cache，将 KV cache 大小从 O(l) 降至 O(l/s)，其中 s 为共享步长（通常 s=2，即每 2 层共享）。与 GQA 从 \\\"head 维度\\\" 压缩互补。\\nKV…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer.md\",\"basename\":\"Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer\",\"score\":570.2755910437368,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-model\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Model\",\"offset\":35},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":47},{\"match\":\"Cross-Model\",\"offset\":129},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":141}],\"excerpt\":\"## Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nToken Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer 是 SPECPREFILL 的核心机制假设：同一模型家族中不同规模的模型（如 Llama-3.1-8B 和 405B），其对 prompt token 重要性的注意力分布具有可迁移性。因此可用小型 speculator 的注意力分数作为 proxy 估计哪些 token 对大型 base model 重要，无需对大模型做任何额外 forward p…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)\",\"score\":568.3237632729656,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":86},{\"match\":\"的 self-a\",\"offset\":1718}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCross-Modal Attention Entropy 是 MEDA 提出的用于量化多模态 LLM 每层跨模态注意力分布特性的度量指标。它通过同时计算文本→视觉（T→V）和视觉→文本（V→T）两个方向的注意力熵，捕捉该层对跨模态 token pair 的注意力集中/分散程度。公式为：\\n$$E_{CM}^l = -(E_{TV}^l + E_{VT}^l)$$\\n其中：\\n$$E_{TV}^l = \\\\frac{1}{|T|} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\",\"score\":556.7674059020705,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attend\",\"cross-attention）、idefics、evlm\",\"cross-attention（flamingo\",\"cross-attention-based\",\"cross-attention\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"cross-attention）、IDEFICS、EVLM\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":664},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":700},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention-based\",\"offset\":961},{\"match\":\"cross-attend\",\"offset\":1058},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1112},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1219},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1242},{\"match\":\"cross-attention（Flamingo\",\"offset\":1291},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1444},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1544}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n基于交叉注意力的 MLLM 架构是多模态大语言模型的三大架构范式之一（另两种为 Concatenation-based 和 Q-Former/Token Compression-based）。核心特征是视觉特征不直接进入 LLM 的文本序列，而是通过 cross-attention 层以\\\"外部记忆\\\"形式注入到 LLM 的中间表示中。代表工作：Flamingo（每层插入 cross-att…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-layer Dependency in Attention Module（注意力模块中的跨层依赖）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-layer Dependency in Attention Module（注意力模块中的跨层依赖）\",\"score\":545.7024674787457,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-layer\",\"attention\",\"attention-aware\",\"attention-wise\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-layer\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":29},{\"match\":\"Cross-layer\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":130},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":163},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":224},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":262},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":290},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":359},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":399},{\"match\":\"attentio\",\"offset\":465},{\"match\":\"attentio\",\"offset\":613},{\"match\":\"-Attentio\",\"offset\":644},{\"match\":\"通过 attention-\",\"offset\":1099},{\"match\":\"次得到 atten\",\"offset\":1363},{\"match\":\"预计算 attention-a\",\"offset\":1387},{\"match\":\"复执行 atten\",\"offset\":1468},{\"match\":\"免每轮 atten\",\"offset\":1508}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-layer Dependency in Attention Module（注意力模块中的跨层依赖）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-layer Dependency in Attention Module 指 Transformer 的 attention 模块中 Q（Query）、K（Key）、V（Value）三个投影层之间的强相互依赖关系。在 self-attention 中，Q 和 K 的矩阵乘法结果经 softmax 产生 attention map A，A 再与 V 相乘得到 attention 输出。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Head Unified Sparse Attention (CUSA) _ 跨Head统一稀疏注意力.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Head Unified Sparse Attention (CUSA) _ 跨Head统一稀疏注意力\",\"score\":544.2840338853505,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-head\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Head\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":29},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":188},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":227},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"attentio\",\"offset\":380},{\"match\":\"（cross-hea\",\"offset\":533},{\"match\":\"Attentio\",\"offset\":941},{\"match\":\"lAttentio\",\"offset\":986},{\"match\":\"lAttentio\",\"offset\":1088},{\"match\":\"parseAtte\",\"offset\":1454},{\"match\":\". 按原始 att\",\"offset\":1977},{\"match\":\"个 Full A\",\"offset\":2268},{\"match\":\"Sparse A\",\"offset\":2329},{\"match\":\"vs 每层都选，a\",\"offset\":2455},{\"match\":\"ng with Cr\",\"offset\":2884},{\"match\":\"Sparse A\",\"offset\":2910}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Head Unified Sparse Attention (CUSA) / 跨Head统一稀疏注意力\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCUSA 是 LessIsMore 论文提出的免训练稀疏注意力机制的核心组件。它解决长期困扰稀疏注意力方法的核心问题：推理（reasoning）任务中 token 重要性是全局属性，而非每个 attention head 的局部属性。CUSA 的工作流程：(1) 每个 attention head 基于精确 attention score 独立提案自己的 top-k 候选 token；(2) 通过 UnionFlatt…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)\",\"score\":519.6827526440854,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"attention\",\"attention:\",\"attention（q=decoder,\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":61},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":170},{\"match\":\"Attention:\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":278},{\"match\":\"FC 矩阵\\n\\nCross-at\",\"offset\":488},{\"match\":\"ainMoE Cross-At\",\"offset\":686},{\"match\":\"roduct At\",\"offset\":1091},{\"match\":\"×C_hid}\\n-\",\"offset\":1382},{\"match\":\"）、编码器-解码器 attention（\",\"offset\":1510},{\"match\":\"合\\n- 不同于标准 cross\",\"offset\":1645}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)\\n术语解释\\nCross-Attention 是 Transformer 架构中的一种注意力机制变体，其中 Query 来自一个模态/序列，Key 和 Value 来自另一个模态/序列，实现跨模态信息交互。在 BrainMoE 中，Cross-Attention 用于将原始 FC 矩阵（结构信息）融合到 cognition embeddings（语义信息）中。\\n术语是什么？\\n标准 Self-Attention: Q, K, V 来自同一输入。Cross-Attention: Q 来自一个源，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\",\"score\":518.4655632014076,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":55},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":165},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"of