\":500.1304627449383,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"crossattn\",\"cross-attention\",\"attention\",\"attention已可靠\",\"attention前mamba层attention\",\"attention-guided\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":48},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":184},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":348},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1021},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1225},{\"match\":\"CrossAttn\",\"offset\":1266},{\"match\":\"attention前Mamba层attention\",\"offset\":1555},{\"match\":\"attention-guided\",\"offset\":1604},{\"match\":\"attention已可靠\",\"offset\":1630},{\"match\":\"attention-guided\",\"offset\":1816}],\"excerpt\":\"## TransV (Token Information Transfer via Gated Cross-Attention) / 基于门控交叉注意力的Token信息转移\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTransV 是 TimeViper 提出的 LLM 内部视觉 token 压缩模块，通过 Gated Cross-Attention 将冗余视觉 token 的信息显式转移到指令 token 中，再丢弃原始视觉 token。核心思想：不同于传统的 token dropping（不可逆丢失信息）或 token compression into new special tokens（破坏 token 身份），TransV 先通过…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Architecture Knowledge Distillation (Transformer→SSM_Mamba).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Architecture Knowledge Distillation (Transformer→SSM_Mamba)\",\"score\":463.79807232037854,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-architecture\",\"attention\",\"attention矩阵（与t2r策略相反），直接替换让mamba学到自己的计算范式；\",\"attention矩阵\",\"attention保留\",\"attention层的q/k/v/o投影权重映射为mamba层的c/b/x/o投影，对gqa的kv\",\"attention层的q\",\"attention_mask\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Architecture\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"attention层的Q/K/V/O投影权重映射为Mamba层的C/B/X/O投影，对GQA的KV\",\"offset\":397},{\"match\":\"Attention保留\",\"offset\":796},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":865},{\"match\":\"attention_mask\",\"offset\":1399},{\"match\":\"attention矩阵（与T2R策略相反），直接替换让Mamba学到自己的计算范式；\",\"offset\":2234},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":2416},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":2434},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":2453}],\"excerpt