tch\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1705},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1895},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1941},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1964},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":2110}],\"excerpt\":\"## Attention Merging（注意力合并）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAttention Merging 是 VisiPruner (EMNLP 2025) 提出的一种训练无关的视觉 token 压缩技术：在 MLLM 推理时，将某层的所有视觉 cross-attention weights 强制合并/聚焦到单个视觉 token 上，从而在保持 attention 分布稳定性（避免 softmax 归一化崩塌）的同时，将 N_text × N_v 的 cross-attention 计算降为 N_text × 1。具体操作：…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning.md\",\"basename\":\"Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\",\"score\":214.9131158728406,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-self\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":35},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":512},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":524},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":594},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":634},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"offset\":1169},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"offset\":1211},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1230},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"offset\":1268},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1292},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1350},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1398},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1476},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1619}],\"excerpt\":\"## Intra-modality / Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nIntra-modality（模态内）和 Inter-modality（跨模态）注意力分解是将多模态 VLM 的注意力矩阵按 token 模态归属进行结构化拆分的技术。给定包含 L_t 个文本 token 和 L_v 个视觉 token 的序列，注意力矩阵 A ∈ R^{L×L} 分解为：\\n- **Intra-modality**：A^{st}（text→text）捕捉文本内语义关系；A^{sv}（visual→visual）捕捉图像内…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/TimeSFormer _ Factorized Spatiotemporal Attention (分解式时空注意力).md\",\"basename\":\"TimeSFormer _ Factorized Spatiotemporal Attention (分解式时空注意力)\",\"score\":213.44718996751357,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-frame\",\"attention\",\"attention：将\",\"attention。兼容\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":43},{\"match\":\"Attention：将\",\"offset\":262},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":311},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"lf-Attent\",\"offset\":890},{\"match\":\"ashAttent\",\"offset\":995},{\"match\":\"lf-Attent\",\"offset\":1069},{\"match\":\"ashAttent\",\"offset\":1192},{\"match\":\"# cross-fr\",\"offset\":1232},{\"match\":\"`（`attent\",\"offset\":1575},{\"match\":\"lf-attent\",\"offset\":1686},{\"match\":\"eadAttent\",\"offset\":1713},{\"match\":\"lf-attent\",\"offset\":1754},{\"match\":\"ch attention\",\"offset\":1797},{\"match\":\"ashAttent\",\"offset\":1815}],\"excerpt\":\"## TimeSFormer / Factorized Spatiotemporal Attention (分解式时空注意力)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTimeSFormer (Time-Space Transformer) 是 Facebook Research (Bertasius et al., ICML 2021) 提出的纯 Transformer 视频分类架构，核心创新是 Factorized (Divided) Spatiotemporal Attention：将 3D 联合时空注意力分解为两个独立的顺序操作——spatial self-attention（同帧内不同 patch 间）→ tempor…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Group Query Attention.md\",\"basename\":\"Group Query Attention\",\"score\":209.05326242172305,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-layer\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":83},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"ct Attent\",\"offset\":1432},{\"match\":\"**：Cross-La\",\"offset\":2789},{\"match\":\"er Attent\",\"offset\":2801}],\"excerpt\":\"## Group Query Attention\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nGroup Query Attention (GQA，分组查询注意力) 是介于标准多头注意力(MHA)和Multi-Query Attention(MQA)之间的一种注意力机制变体，由Ainslie et al.在2023年提出。其核心思想是将query head分成g组（1 < g < h），每组内的多个query head共享同一个key-value head对。相比MHA（h个KV heads，每个query head独立使用一对KV），GQA仅需g个KV heads（g <<…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Attention Recall _ 注意力召回率.md\",\"basename\":\"Attention Recall _ 注意力召回率\",\"score\":208.86297800065077,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-head\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":60},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":266},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":396},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":522},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":650},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":717},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":788},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":848},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":921},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1009},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1262},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1473},{\"match\":\"Cross-Head\",\"offset\":1672},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1698}],\"excerpt\":\"## Attention Recall / 注意力召回率\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nAttention Recall 是量化稀疏注意力质量的诊断指标，定义为稀疏注意力所选 token 子集捕获的真实注意力分布的占比。公式：$R_i = \\\\frac{\\\\sum (\\\\text{softmax}(W_i)[\\\\rho])}{\\\\sum (\\\\text{softmax}(W_i))}$，其中 $W_i = \\\\frac{Q_i K_i^T}{\\\\sqrt{d}}$ 为 head i 的 pre-softmax attention scores，ρ 为稀疏注意力选择的 token 子集…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/n-Softmax (Smoothness Recovery for Pruned Attention Distribution).md\",\"basename\":\"n-Softmax (Smoothness Recovery for Pruned Attention Distribution)\",\"score\":204.4430257981372,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"crossselfdecomposeandselect\",\"cross-self\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":45},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":433},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":461},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":870},{\"match\":\"CrossSelfDecomposeAndSelect\",\"offset\":917},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":958},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1013},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1134},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1145},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1221}],\"excerpt\":\"## n-Softmax (Smoothness Recovery for Pruned Attention Distribution)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nn-Softmax 是 CSP 提出的用于恢复 KV Cache 剪枝后注意力分布平滑性的技术。剪枝后 softmax 的分母从 Σ_{j∈I^+ ∪ I^-} e^{O_j} 变为 Σ_{j∈I^+} e^{O_j}，导致注意力分数被放大、分布变尖锐。n-Softmax 在分母中引入偏置 n：A_i = e^{O_i} / (n + Σ_{j∈I^+} e^{O_j})，相当于添加\\\"虚拟 token\\\"的贡献来模拟被剪枝 token 的归一化效应，恢复原始平滑性。论文固定 n=1。与标…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块).md\",\"basename\":\"Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块)\",\"score\":204.06302724667984,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"cross-attention\",\"attention\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"offset\":224},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":257},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":533},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":563},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":655},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":992},{\"match\":\"Attention\",\"offset\":1111},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1129},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":1276},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":1628},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1654},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1733},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1743},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1897},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":2010},{\"match\":\"attention\",\"offset\":2033}],\"excerpt\":\"## Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nHyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB) 是 mPLUG-Owl3 提出的轻量级多模态 Transformer 扩展模块。其核心创新在于：在语言模型的 Transformer block 中，将 cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与 self-attention（文本内部）**并行执行**，而非 Flamingo 的串行插入方式。HATB 仅在…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Streaming Causal Attention Masks (SCAM).md\",\"basename\":\"Streaming Causal Attention Masks (SCAM)\",\"score\":200.08717225264115,\"fo