（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）.md","basename":"Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）","score":641.6260764819863,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","attention","attention），但代价是必须在","attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":21},{"match":"Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）","offset":33},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":121},{"match":"Attention","offset":133},{"match":"attention","offset":249},{"match":"cross-modal","offset":273},{"match":"attention","offset":285},{"match":"attention","offset":360},{"match":"attention","offset":458},{"match":"attention），但代价是必须在","offset":547},{"match":"attention","offset":773},{"match":"attention","offset":1060},{"match":"attention","offset":1085}],"excerpt":"## Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nMemory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention 是 FlexMem 中从 Visual Memory Bank 检索最相关记忆的机制。原理：在 memory encoding 阶段，如果 Tq（问题文本）被包含在 MLLM 输入中，则 MLLM 的 self-attention 会自然产生 Tq→Vi 的 cross-modal attention weights。这些权重反映了模型在理解问题时关注了…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache.md","basename":"Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache","score":637.8063525350375,"foundWords":["cross","cross_ratio=0.5。在","cross-attention。然后在","cross-attention；","cross-attention","cross-self","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Self","offset":3},{"match":"Cross-Self","offset":30},{"match":"Attention","offset":41},{"match":"Cross-Self","offset":113},{"match":"attention","offset":299},{"match":"attention","offset":349},{"match":"cross-attention；","offset":394},{"match":"cross-attention。然后在","offset":445},{"match":"attention","offset":715},{"match":"attention","offset":829},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":848},{"match":"Attention","offset":1468},{"match":"cross_ratio=0.5。在","offset":1505},{"match":"Cross-Self","offset":1620}],"excerpt":"## Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) / Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nCross-Self Pruning (CSP) 是一种 training-free 的 KV Cache 剪枝方法，专为多模态视觉语言模型（VLM）设计。核心创新是将原始注意力矩阵 A ∈ [0,1]^{L×L}（L = L_t + L_v，文本+视觉 token 长度）分解为四个子区域：(a) A^{st} ∈ [0,1]^{L_t×L_t}：文本→文本 self-atte…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/CLA (Cross-Layer Attention).md","basename":"CLA (Cross-Layer Attention)","score":584.0403443640922,"foundWords":["cross","cross-layer","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Layer","offset":8},{"match":"Attention","offset":20},{"match":"Cross-Layer","offset":77},{"match":"Attention","offset":89},{"match":"attention","offset":1078},{"match":"attention","offset":1164},{"match":"attention","offset":1236}],"excerpt":"## CLA (Cross-Layer Attention)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCross-Layer Attention (CLA) 是 Brandon et al. (2024) 提出的 KV cache 压缩技术：相邻的 Transformer layers 共享同一组 KV cache，而非每层独立维护。CLA 从 \"layer 维度\" 压缩 KV cache，将 KV cache 大小从 O(l) 降至 O(l/s)，其中 s 为共享步长（通常 s=2，即每 2 层共享）。与 GQA 从 \"head 维度\" 压缩互补。\nKV…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer.md","basename":"Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer","score":570.2755910437368,"foundWords":["cross","cross-model","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Cross-Model","offset":35},{"match":"Attention","offset":47},{"match":"Cross-Model","offset":129},{"match":"Attention","offset":141}],"excerpt":"## Token Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nToken Importance Estimation via Cross-Model Attention Transfer 是 SPECPREFILL 的核心机制假设：同一模型家族中不同规模的模型（如 Llama-3.1-8B 和 405B），其对 prompt token 重要性的注意力分布具有可迁移性。因此可用小型 speculator 的注意力分数作为 proxy 估计哪些 token 对大型 base model 重要，无需对大模型做任何额外 forward p…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵).md","basename":"Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)","score":568.3237632729656,"foundWords":["cross","cross-modal","attention"],"