"offset":1754},{"match":"ch attention","offset":1797},{"match":"ashAttent","offset":1815}],"excerpt":"## TimeSFormer / Factorized Spatiotemporal Attention (分解式时空注意力)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTimeSFormer (Time-Space Transformer) 是 Facebook Research (Bertasius et al., ICML 2021) 提出的纯 Transformer 视频分类架构，核心创新是 Factorized (Divided) Spatiotemporal Attention：将 3D 联合时空注意力分解为两个独立的顺序操作——spatial self-attention（同帧内不同 patch 间）→ tempor…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Group Query Attention.md","basename":"Group Query Attention","score":209.05326242172305,"foundWords":["cross","cross-layer","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":15},{"match":"Attention","offset":83},{"match":"Attention","offset":135},{"match":"ct Attent","offset":1432},{"match":"**：Cross-La","offset":2789},{"match":"er Attent","offset":2801}],"excerpt":"## Group Query Attention\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nGroup Query Attention (GQA，分组查询注意力) 是介于标准多头注意力(MHA)和Multi-Query Attention(MQA)之间的一种注意力机制变体，由Ainslie et al.在2023年提出。其核心思想是将query head分成g组（1 < g < h），每组内的多个query head共享同一个key-value head对。相比MHA（h个KV heads，每个query head独立使用一对KV），GQA仅需g个KV heads（g <<…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Attention Recall _ 注意力召回率.md","basename":"Attention Recall _ 注意力召回率","score":208.86297800065077,"foundWords":["cross","cross-head","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":3},{"match":"Attention","offset":60},{"match":"attention","offset":266},{"match":"attention","offset":362},{"match":"attention","offset":396},{"match":"Attention","offset":522},{"match":"attention","offset":650},{"match":"attention","offset":717},{"match":"attention","offset":788},{"match":"attention","offset":848},{"match":"Attention","offset":921},{"match":"Attention","offset":1009},{"match":"Attention","offset":1262},{"match":"attention","offset":1473},{"match":"Cross-Head","offset":1672},{"match":"Attention","offset":1698}],"excerpt":"## Attention Recall / 注意力召回率\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出