-attentio","offset":532},{"match":"_cros","offset":681}],"excerpt":"## Adaptive Gating for Multimodal Attention Fusion（自适应门控多模态注意力融合）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nAdaptive Gating 是 mPLUG-Owl3 提出的基于文本语义的门控机制，用于融合 self-attention（文本内信息）和 cross-attention（视觉补充信息）的输出。与 Flamingo 的固定 learnable scale 不同，Adaptive Gating 通过文本特征自身计算门控值 `g = Sigmoid(W_gate^T · H_text)`，使得每个 token 可以根据其语义需求动态决定从视觉…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Token Importance Prediction via Attention Distillation.md","basename":"Token Importance Prediction via Attention Distillation","score":199.4894823958845,"foundWords":["cross","cross-entropy","attention","attention:"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":35},{"match":"Attention","offset":135},{"match":"attention","offset":317},{"match":"cross-entropy","offset":463},{"match":"attention","offset":823},{"match":"attention","offset":920},{"match":"attention","offset":1067},{"match":"Attention:","offset":2250},{"match":"Attention","offset":2314},{"match":"Attention","offset":2949}],"excerpt":"## Token Importance Prediction via Attention Distillation\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nToken Importance Prediction via Attention Distillation 是一种通过知识蒸馏训练轻量级预测器来估计 LLM 解码过程中每个 token 对当前 query 重要性的方法。核心思想：冻结预训练 LLM 作为 teacher，用一个极小的外部 MLP 预测器（<1% LLM 参数量）作为 student，蒸馏 teacher 每层每个 head 的 masked causal attention distribu…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/isoCost Pareto Frontier Analysis for Sparse Attention (稀疏注意力等成本Pareto前沿分析).md","basename":"isoCost Pareto Frontier Analysis for Sparse Attention (稀疏注意力等成本Pareto前沿分析)","score":194.33679662501575,"foundWords":["crossover\"","crossover","attention","attention/qkv投影/mlp/embedding"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":47},{"match":"attention/QKV投影/MLP/embedding","offset":432},{"match":"attention","offset":723},{"match":"attention","offset":1041},{"match":"Attention","offset":1069},{"match":"crossover","offset":1709},{"match":"Attention","offset":2119}],"excerpt":"## isoCost Pareto Frontier Analysis for Sparse Attention (稀疏注意力等成本Pareto前沿分析)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nisoCost Pareto Frontier Analysis 是 Sparse Frontier 论文引入的稀疏注意力评估方法论。核心思想：在相同计算成本下（prefilling 用 FLOPs、decoding 用 memory transfers），比较不同模型大小 × 稀疏度配置的 accuracy，识别 Pareto 最优配置——即不被任何其他配置同时在成本和性能上支配的配置。这种方法回答了一个实际问题：\"给定固定计算 budget，应该用大稀疏模型还是小密集…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Centered Kernel Alignment (CKA) for Attention Head Similarity.md","basename":"Centered Kernel Alignment (CKA) for Attention Head Similarity","score":187.48689305801034,"foundWords":["cross","cross-layer","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":39},{"match":"- xKV: Cros","offset":894}],"excerpt":"## Centered Kernel Alignment (CKA) for Attention Head Similarity\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nCKA 是 Kornblith et al. (NeurIPS 2019) 提出的表征相似度度量。给定两个 head 的 Key 投影子矩阵 W_i, W_j ∈ R^{d_model×d_k}，通过线性核 Gram 矩阵 G_i=W_i·W_i^T, G_j=W_j·W_j^T，centering 后计算 CKA(i,j) = HSIC(G_i_c, G_j_c)/√(HSIC(G_i_c,G_i_c)·HSIC(G_j_c,G_j_c))，其中 HSIC(A,B)=Tr(A·B…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Short Window Attention for Video Generation（视频生成短窗口注意力）.md","basename":"Short Window Attention for Video Generation（视频生成短窗口注意力）","score":186.95817560821834,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":16},{"match":"Attention","offset":117},{"match":"attention","offset":178},{"match":"Attentio","offset":595},{"match":"-attentio","offset":615},{"match":"attentio","offset":1068},{"match":"attentio","offset":1236},{"match":"attentio","offset":1249},{"match":"hAttentio","offset":1306},{"match":"-attentio","offset":1363},{"match":"，cross-attentio","offset":1377}],"excerpt":"## Short Window Attention for Video Generation（视频生成短窗口注意力）\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nShort Window Attention 是在长视频 AR 生成中将自注意力的感受野限制在固定时间窗口 W 内的注意力机制。传统 causal attention 复杂度 O(L²)（L = 总序列长度），随视频增长不可持续。利用视频生成中的时间局部性（temporal locality）——附近帧对预测下一帧更重要——将注意力限制在最近 W 个 latent frames 内，复杂度降为 O(W·L)，KV cac…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multi-Head Latent Attention (MLA _ 多头潜在注意力).md","basename":"Multi-Head Latent Attention (MLA _ 多头潜在注意力)","score":186.74533880174792,"foundWords":["cross","cross-layer","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":21},{"match":"Attention","offset":96},{"match":"attention","offset":408},{"match":"ent Atten","offset":2271},{"match":"KV: Cross-L","offset":2304},{"match":"。最终 atten","offset":3190},{"match":"后计算 atten","offset":3877},{"match":"// Atten","offset":3988},{"match":"atent Att","offset":4861}],"excerpt":"## Multi-Head Latent Attention (MLA / 多头潜在注意力)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nMulti-Head Latent Attention (MLA) 是 DeepSeek-V2/V3 引入的注意力机制，通过低秩分解将 KV cache 压缩为低维 latent vector，在保持模型质量的同时大幅降低推理时的内存和带宽开销。核心思想：将 Key 和 Value 的投影分解为两步——先将输入 x_t 通过下投影矩阵 W^{DKV} ∈ R^{r_kv × D} 映射到 r_kv 维 latent 空间，生成 c_t^{KV} = W^{DKV} x_t（仅缓存此…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Same-Layer Expert Prefetching via Pre-Attention Prediction（基于注意力前预测的同层专家预取）.md","basename":"Same-Layer Expert Prefetching via Pre-Attention Prediction（基于注意力前预测的同层专家预取）","score":141.13495757990526,"foundWords":["cross","cross-layer","attention"],"matches":[{"match":"Attention","offset":41},{"match":"attention","offset":138},{"match":"cross-layer","offset":185},{"match":"attention","offset":229},{"match":"attention","offset":335},{"match":"attention","offset":481},{"match":"Attention","offset":1175}],"excerpt":"## Same-Layer Expert Prefetching via Pre-Attention Prediction（基于注意力前预测的同层专家预取）\n术语是什么？\nSame-Layer Expert Prefetching 是 MoE 推理中在同一层内使用 pre-attention hidden state 预测该层 experts 并异步预取的技术。与 cross-layer prediction（用前一层预测下一层）不同：(1) pre-attention 信息\"更新鲜\"，temporal proximity 更高；(2) 所有层（含第一层）均可预测——无 bootstrap problem；(3) 预测 (0.15ms CPU) 与 self-attent…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Flashinfer（高性能推理Attention Kernel库）.md","basename":"Flashinfer（高性能推理Attention Kernel库）","score":115.16537125203887,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","attention",