{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_06_PccsdLL5N6FglEL4lKCl1852","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs\",\"score\":707.2603970359197,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal显著增加\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\",\"modal显著增加\",\"modal主导\",\"modal交互为主\",\"modal交互\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":87},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":280},{\"match\":\"modal交互为主\",\"offset\":399},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":409},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":459},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":644},{\"match\":\"-modal交\",\"offset\":965},{\"match\":\"纯cross-moda\",\"offset\":985},{\"match\":\"-modal主\",\"offset\":1065},{\"match\":\"cross-modal显著增\",\"offset\":1106},{\"match\":\"Cross-Moda\",\"offset\":1158},{\"match\":\"（moda\",\"offset\":1409},{\"match\":\"Cross-Moda\",\"offset\":1473},{\"match\":\"imoda\",\"offset\":1545}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Modal Information Flow in MLLMs\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Modal Information Flow（跨模态信息流）指MLLM的Transformer层中不同模态token（visual和text）之间的attention交互模式和强度。在MLLM的每一层attention计算中，QK^T attention矩阵包含四个block：visual→visual、visual→text、text→visual、text→text。Cross-modal attention s…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)\",\"score\":671.0060189208814,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":896},{\"match\":\"nt Mu\",\"offset\":1967}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Modal Attention Entropy (跨模态注意力熵)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCross-Modal Attention Entropy 是 MEDA 提出的用于量化多模态 LLM 每层跨模态注意力分布特性的度量指标。它通过同时计算文本→视觉（T→V）和视觉→文本（V→T）两个方向的注意力熵，捕捉该层对跨模态 token pair 的注意力集中/分散程度。公式为：\\n$$E_{CM}^l = -(E_{TV}^l + E_{VT}^l)$$\\n其中：\\n$$E_{TV}^l = \\\\frac{1}{|T|} \\\\sum_{i=1}^{n…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合)\",\"score\":632.7239742162944,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":81},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":220},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":550},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":611},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":1377},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1610}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers (LLM 层的跨模态融合)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCross-modal Fusion in LLM Layers 是多模态 LLM 中 visual tokens 和 text tokens 在 Transformer 层中通过 Self-Attention 进行信息交互的过程。AIM 通过消融实验发现：LLM 的不同层对 cross-modal fusion 的需求差异显著——早期层依赖 visual tokens 建立视觉-文本对齐（跨模态融合阶段），后期层主要进行 text-onl…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)\",\"score\":621.7893994059725,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":29},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":61},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":170},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":278},{\"match\":\"FC 矩阵\\n\\nCross-at\",\"offset\":488},{\"match\":\"ainMoE Cross-At\",\"offset\":686},{\"match\":\"合\\n- 不同于标准 cross\",\"offset\":1645}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention for Multi-Modal Fusion (交叉注意力多模态融合)\\n术语解释\\nCross-Attention 是 Transformer 架构中的一种注意力机制变体，其中 Query 来自一个模态/序列，Key 和 Value 来自另一个模态/序列，实现跨模态信息交互。在 BrainMoE 中，Cross-Attention 用于将原始 FC 矩阵（结构信息）融合到 cognition embeddings（语义信息）中。\\n术语是什么？\\n标准 Self-Attention: Q, K, V 来自同一输入。Cross-Attention: Q 来自一个源，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）.md\",\"basename\":\"Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）\",\"score\":621.6408104829399,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross/self-attention；\",\"crossattn\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-attn\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":538},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":1098},{\"match\":\"Cross-attention\",\"offset\":1269},{\"match\":\"CrossAttn\",\"offset\":1356},{\"match\":\"cross-attn\",\"offset\":1379},{\"match\":\"Cross-attention\",\"offset\":1735},{\"match\":\"CrossAttn\",\"offset\":1853},{\"match\":\"CrossAttn\",\"offset\":2254},{\"match\":\"cross-attn\",\"offset\":2277},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":2417},{\"match\":\"cross/self-attention；\",\"offset\":3052},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":3324},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":3364}],\"excerpt\":\"## Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型三阶段跨模态交互）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nVisiPruner (EMNLP 2025) 通过系统消融实验揭示的 MLLM 内部跨模态信息处理的三阶段规律。该框架将 MLLM 的 32 层 transformer 按功能分为三个阶段：(1) **Shallow Layers（浅层，layer 1-8）— Task Recognition**：视觉和文本 token 在浅层独立演化，无有意义的跨模态融合。文本 token 的 hidden stat…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）.md\",\"basename\":\"Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）\",\"score\":614.6112849683404,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":21},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":121},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":1345}],\"excerpt\":\"## Memory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention（基于跨模态注意力的记忆召回）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMemory Recall via Cross-Modal Attention 是 FlexMem 中从 Visual Memory Bank 检索最相关记忆的机制。原理：在 memory encoding 阶段，如果 Tq（问题文本）被包含在 MLLM 输入中，则 MLLM 的 self-attention 会自然产生 Tq→Vi 的 cross-modal attention weights。这些权重反映了模型在理解问题时关注了…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Softmax Temperature Calibration for Cross-Modal Similarity（跨模态相似度的Softmax温度校准）.md\",\"basename\":\"Softmax Temperature Calibration for Cross-Modal Similarity（跨模态相似度的Softmax温度校准）\",\"score\":603.9279846981974,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modal\",\"offset\":39},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":696},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":1371},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":1974},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2046}],\"excerpt\":\"## Softmax Temperature Calibration for Cross-Modal Similarity（跨模态相似度的Softmax温度校准）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSoftmax Temperature Calibration 是 MMTok 中用于对齐 text-vision 和 vision-vision 相似度矩阵分布的技术。由于 T-V 相似度（基于投影后对齐 LLM embedding 的 vision tokens 与 text tokens 的内积）和 V-V 相似度（基于投影前的原始 vision tokens 的内积）具有不同的量纲和分布形状，直接相加会导致一个覆…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-modal Attention (Text-to-Image Attention for VLM Pruning).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-modal Attention (Text-to-Image Attention for VLM Pruning)\",\"score\":587.3935157909445,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-modal\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":403},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":632},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":1069},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":1361},{\"match\":\"Cross-modal\",\"offset\":1586},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":1709},{\"match\":\"cross-modal\",\"offset\":1920}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-modal Attention (Text-to-Image Attention for VLM Pruning)\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-modal Attention在VLM中指text tokens与image tokens之间的attention交互。在Vision-Language Model的Transformer attention层中，QK^T SoftMax矩阵包含四个block：image-to-image (M×M)、image-to-text、text-to-image (T×M)、text-to-text。Text-to-…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐).md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)\",\"score\":551.0429265497801,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-modality\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":82},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1401}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Modality Alignment (跨模态对齐)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Modality Alignment（跨模态对齐）是多模态大模型训练的第一阶段（Alignment Stage），目标是将不同模态（图像、视频、音频、语音等）的编码器输出映射到统一的 LLM 语言表示空间，使 LLM 能\\\"理解\\\"非文本模态的输入。该阶段仅训练模态连接器（Connector），冻结编码器和 LLM，通过最小化生成文本的交叉熵损失来学习模态-语言映射。\\nUni-MoE 的跨模态对齐阶段针对每种模态独立执行：(1)…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) _ Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache\",\"score\":481.19197543574296,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_ratio=0.5。在\",\"cross-attention。然后在\",\"cross-attention；\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-self\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"cross-attention；\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"cross-attention。然后在\",\"offset\":445},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":471},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":526},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":848},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.5。在\",\"offset\":1505},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1620}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Self Pruning (CSP) / Cross-Self Attention Decomposition for VLM KV Cache\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nCross-Self Pruning (CSP) 是一种 training-free 的 KV Cache 剪枝方法，专为多模态视觉语言模型（VLM）设计。核心创新是将原始注意力矩阵 A ∈ [0,1]^{L×L}（L = L_t + L_v，文本+视觉 token 长度）分解为四个子区域：(a) A^{st} ∈ [0,1]^{L_t×L_t}：文本→文本 self-atte…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\",\"score\":425.93704681296447,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attend\",\"cross-attention）、idefics、evlm\",\"cross-attention（flamingo\",\"cross-attention-based\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"cross-attention）、IDEFICS、EVLM\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention-based\",\"offset\":961},{\"match\":\"cross-attend\",\"offset\":1058},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1219},{\"match\":\"cross-attention（Flamingo\",\"offset\":1291},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1544},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1740}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture（基于交叉注意力的多模态大语言模型架构）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n基于交叉注意力的 MLLM 架构是多模态大语言模型的三大架构范式之一（另两种为 Concatenation-based 和 Q-Former/Token Compression-based）。核心特征是视觉特征不直接进入 LLM 的文本序列，而是通过 cross-attention 层以\\\"外部记忆\\\"形式注入到 LLM 的中间表示中。代表工作：Flamingo（每层插入 cross-att…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal\",\"score\":405.6934258149761,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-scan\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":46},{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":97},{\"match\":\"Cross-Scan\",\"offset\":227},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1221}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) in Mamba-2 Multimodal\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCross-Scan Mechanism (CSM) 是MVSS模块中的另一种2D扫描策略，将视觉patch特征沿四个对角线方向展开为1D序列并分别送入Mamba-2层处理。四个方向包括：左上→右下、右下→左上、右上→左下、左下→右上。CSM借鉴VMamba的Cross-Scan Module设计思想——对角线方向扫描可以捕获传统行列扫描难以建模的斜向空间关系（如物体的对角线边界、纹理等）。与BSM（2个方向…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture.md\",\"basename\":\"Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\",\"score\":390.0518068515204,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modality-\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":55},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":225},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":264},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":587},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":679},{\"match\":\"cross\",\"offset\":724},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":803},{\"match\":\"cross-attentio\",\"offset\":1070},{\"match\":\"cross-attentio\",\"offset\":1113},{\"match\":\"Modality\",\"offset\":1286}],\"excerpt\":\"## Cross-Attention (CroAttn) LMM Architecture\\n术语是什么？\\nCross-Attention LMM 是多模态大模型的第二种主流架构，在 LLM backbone 中插入专用 cross-attention layers 处理 image tokens。大部分层保持原有 self-attention（仅处理 text tokens），少数层（如 Llama3.2-11B 中 4/40 层）被替换为 cross-attention layers——text tokens 通过 cross-attention attend to image tokens，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modal Cache（模态缓存）.md\",\"basename\":\"Modal Cache（模态缓存）\",\"score\":382.24018598518325,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\",\"modality-specific\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"modality-specific\",\"offset\":90},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":193},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":310},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":444},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":491},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":932},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":983},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":1505},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2040},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2152},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2199},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":2261},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2333},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2805},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":2925},{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":3005},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":3059}],\"excerpt\":\"## Modal Cache（模态缓存）\\n术语是什么？\\nModal Cache 是 EEVEE 提出的面向多模态模型 serving 的模块级中间结果缓存机制，用于存储和复用 modality-specific modules 的推理输出以消除跨请求重复计算。与传统 LLM serving 中仅用于加速 autoregressive decoding 的 KV Cache 不同，Modal Cache 缓存的是跨请求可共享的模块输出——主要是 visual encoder 产生的 visual tokens 或对应的 KV pairs，使后续引用同一图像/视频/音频的请求可直接复用而无需重跑 e…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）.md\",\"basename\":\"MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）\",\"score\":261.9967532617536,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Modal\",\"offset\":16},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":1073}],\"excerpt\":\"## MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer)（多模态扩散Transformer）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMMDiT 是 SD3 (Stable Diffusion 3) 提出的多模态 DiT 架构变体。核心设计：文本和视频两种模态共享 self-attention 层进行跨模态交互，但使用各自独立的全连接层和 FFN，以处理两种模态特征在数值尺度和语义空间上的差异。这种\\\"共享注意力 + 独立 FFN/FC\\\"的设计使模型既能实现文本-视频对齐，又能保持各自模态的特征表达能力。EasyAnimate 中文本特征经 RM…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning.md\",\"basename\":\"Intra-modality _ Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\",\"score\":176.7073308610557,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-self\",\"modal\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":26},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":120},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":141},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"modality\",\"offset\":350},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":524},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.5\",\"offset\":1169},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.9\",\"offset\":1211},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1230},{\"match\":\"cross_ratio=0.0\",\"offset\":1268},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":1350},{\"match\":\"modal\",\"offset\":1470},{\"match\":\"Cross-Self\",\"offset\":1619}],\"excerpt\":\"## Intra-modality / Inter-modality Attention Decomposition in VLM KV Cache Pruning\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nIntra-modality（模态内）和 Inter-modality（跨模态）注意力分解是将多模态 VLM 的注意力矩阵按 token 模态归属进行结构化拆分的技术。给定包含 L_t 个文本 token 和 L_v 个视觉 token 的序列，注意力矩阵 A ∈ R^{L×L} 分解为：\\n- **Intra-modality**：A^{st}（text→text）捕捉文本内语义关系；…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Grounded-DINO.md\",\"basename\":\"Grounded-DINO\",\"score\":66.68110331935193,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention→ffn。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。grounding\",\"cross-attention→ffn\",\"cross-attention→text\",\"cross-attention）；\",\"cross-attention\",\"cross-modality\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross-attention）；\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"Cross-Modality\",\"offset\":366},{\"match\":\"cross-attention→text\",\"offset\":414},{\"match\":\"cross-attention→FFN。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。Grounding\",\"offset\":435}],\"excerpt\":\"…**：(1) Feature Enhancer阶段做deep early fusion（deformable self-attention + image-to-text/text-to-image cross-attention）；(2) Language-Guided Query Selection阶段选择与文本最相关的top-Nq图像特征作为decoder queries；(3) Cross-Modality Decoder阶段每层做self-attention→image cross-attention→text cross-attention→FFN。支持任意文本类别名作为输入，输出检测bbox和对应类别标签。Grounding DINO 1.5 Pro使用ViT-L backbone在20M+ grounding images上训练达到SOTA零样本检测性能。\\n从算法pipe…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块).md\",\"basename\":\"Hyper Attention Transformer Block (HATB，超注意力Transformer块)\",\"score\":56.377809132755274,\"foundWords\":[\"cross\",\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"cross-attention\",\"modal\",\"modality-specific，权重初始化自\",\"modality-specific\",\"modality\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"cross-attention（文本查询→视觉特征）与\",\"offset\":224},{\"match\":\"Modality-Specific\",\"offset\":434},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":533},{\"match\":\"cross-attention\",\"offset\":655},{\"match\":\"modality-specific，权重初始化自\",\"offset\":1355},{\"match\":\"Cross-Attention\",\"offset\":1628},{\