l","offset":1519}],"excerpt":"…理2D视觉patch序列。MVSS探索两种2D扫描机制：(1) Bidirectional-Scan Mechanism (BSM)——沿前后两个方向扫描patch序列，捕获互补的上下文信息；(2) Cross-Scan Mechanism (CSM)——沿四个对角线方向扫描，捕获更丰富的2D空间关系。MVSS的核心insight是将2D视觉数据通过有结构的scan pattern转化为类似1D序列的输入，使Mamba-2的因果SSM能够有效处理非因果的视觉信息。\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\n```\n// BS机制：前后向扫描\nV_img_patches = flatten(image_patches_2d)  // ∈ R^{729×D}, 27×27 grid → 1D\nV_f…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Influence-based Token Pruning（基于影响力的Token剪枝 _ Value-aware Token Selection）.md","basename":"Influence-based Token Pruning（基于影响力的Token剪枝 _ Value-aware Token Selection）","score":28.749979757400297,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention","cross-modal","modal"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-attention","offset":2281},{"match":"cross","offset":2397},{"match":"Cross-Modal","offset":2759},{"match":"modal","offset":2799}],"excerpt":"…，对 attention weights 做 per-token masking 后重算 output。关键实现细节：(1) 仅需评估最后一个文本 token（idx=-1）对各视觉 token 的 cross-attention 影响——因为解码从该 token 开始，其 attention output 直接决定首个生成 token；(2) 在 attention weights 层面 mask（设 W'_{i→j}=0 across all heads），而非直接删除 token（后者会改变序列长度和 positional encoding）；(3) 评估在单层内完成——不需要 propagate 到后续层（与 leave-one-out 方法相比大幅节省计算）。该方法在 multiple MLLM architectures（LLaVA-v1.5 7B/13B, InternVL2…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Query-based Vision Token Compression（基于可学习Query的Vision Token压缩）.md","basename":"Query-based Vision Token Compression（基于可学习Query的Vision Token压缩）","score":28.01503350274044,"foundWords":["cross","cross-attention:","cross-attention","modality"],"matches":[{"match":"cross-attention","offset":190},{"match":"modality","offset":324},{"match":"cross-attention","offset":513},{"match":"Cross-attention","offset":981},{"match":"Cross-attentio","offset":1356},{"match":"，cross-attentio","offset":1698}],"excerpt":"Query-based Vision Token Compression 是 LMM 中一种通过可学习 query 向量与 vision token 进行 cross-attention 来压缩视觉信息的技术。LLaVA-Mini (Zhang et al., 2025) 将其推向极致——将 CLIP ViT-