nt_notes/系统实验笔记/MoE-Inference-Bench_ Performance Evaluation of Mixture of Expert Large Language and Vision Models.md | 3156.4 | vLLM MoE 推理全流程(TP+EP+Fused MoE)、H100 vs Cerebras CS-3 硬件对比 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow A Data-Characteristic-Aware Serving System for Diffusion Models/4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md | 2240.7 | Diffusion pipeline 计算图(dGraph)、denoising loop 展开、DiT 架构支持 |\n| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/DMQ Dissecting Outliers of Diffusion Models for Post-Training Quantization/... | 3671.4 | Diffusion 模型量化、timestep-aware 量化、denoising 过程的 outlier 分析 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni Fully Disaggregated Serving for Any-to-Any Multimodal Models/... | 886.0 | Any-to-Any 多模态架构(Thinker-Talker/AR+DiT)、stage graph 抽象 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md | 44.5 | Any-to-Any pipeline 组成(Qwen3-Omni/GLM-Image/BAGEL) |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md | 262.0 | MMDiT block 伪代码(共享 Self-Attention + 独立 FFN) |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs.md | 621.6 | MLLM 三阶段跨模态交互(浅层 Task Recognition/中层 Sparse Grounding/深层 Linguistic Alignment) |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture.md | 425.9 | 三大 MLLM 架构范式对比(Concatenation/Token Compression/Cross-Attention) |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM.md | 27.3 | 多模态连接器设计(MLP/Q-Former/Mamba-2 scan) |\n| paper_secs/secs_2025/50-S-DMA- Sparse Diffusion Models Acceleration via Spatiality-Aware Prediction and Dimension-Adaptive Dataflow/5.4-Ablation-Study.md | 1645.0 | Video diffusion 加速、temporal extension、spatial attention 分析 |\n| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/MoBA__Mixture_of_Block_Attention_for_Long-Context_LLMs/4-Related-Work.md | 1735.2 | spatial-temporal attention 分解、video transformer 相关研究 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、MoE 模型单请求推理计算流程\n\n**侧重标签**: 硬件体系结构（主内容）\n\n### 方法1: Standard MoE Transformer Layer Forward Pass\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Mixture of Experts (MoE).md` (score: 2847.6); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md` (score: 3989.1)\n\n**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**：\n\n```\n=== MoE 单请求推理：逐 Token 前向传播 ===\n输入: x ∈ R^{T×d_model}  (T 个 token, d_model=4096 for Mixtral-8x7B)\n参数: N 个 Expert FFN E_i, Router W_r ∈ R^{d_model×N}, K=top-k 激活数\n\nfor each MoE layer l = 1..L:                         # L=32 for Mixtral\n    # === Step 1: Self-Attention (Dense, 所有 token) ===\n    x_norm = RMSNorm(x)                              # [T, d_model]\n    Q, K, V = x_norm @ W_Q, x_norm @ W_K, x_norm @ W_V\n                                                     # 各 [T, d_head], 并行 32 heads\n    A = FlashAttention(Q, K, V)                      # [T, d_model], O(T·d_model²)\n    x = x + A                                        # residual, [T, d_model]\n\n    # === Step 2: Router (Gate Network) ===\n    x_norm = RMSNorm(x)                              # [T, d_model]\n    logits = x_norm @ W_r                            # [T, N], N=8 experts\n    probs = Softmax(logits, dim=-1)                  # [T, N]\n    topk_weights, topk_indices = TopK(probs, K)      # 各 [T, K], K=2\n    topk_weights = topk_weights / sum(topk_weights)  # 归一化\n\n    # === Step 3: Token-to-Expert Dispatch (数据布局变换) ===\n    # 将 T 个 token 按 routing 结果重排为 E 组\n    for e = 0..E-1:\n        tokens_e = {x_norm[t] | e ∈ topk_indices[t]} # 收集分配给 expert e 的 tokens\n                                                      # 形状: [T_e, d_model], T_e 不均匀!\n    # 注: 这一步是 memory-bound 操作（scatter/gather）\n\n    # === Step 4: Expert FFN 并行计算 ===\n    for e = 0..E-1:                                   # E 个 expert 可独立并行!\n        if len(tokens_e) > 0:\n            # Expert FFN: SiLU-gated FFN\n            gate = SiLU(tokens_e @ W_gate[e])        # [T_e, d_ff], d_ff=14336\n            up   = tokens_e @ W_up[e]                # [T_e, d_ff]\n            act  = gate * up                          # element-wise, [T_e, d_ff]\n            out_e = act @ W_down[e]                   # [T_e, d_model]\n            # 总 FLOPs per token: 3·d_model·d_ff ≈ 3·4096·14336 ≈ 176M FLOPs\n\n    # === Step 5: Token Un-permute + 加权聚合 ===\n    y = zeros([T, d_model])\n    for t = 0..T-1:\n        for k = 0..K-1:\n            e = topk_indices[t, k]\n            y[t] += topk_weights[t, k] * out_e[idx_map[t, e]]\n                                                     # 加权求和\n    x = x + y                                         # residual, [T, d_model]\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n1. **变量含义与维度**：T 为 token 数(单请求 prefill 典型值 128-4096)，d_model 为隐藏维度(如 Mixtral 4096)，d_ff 为 FFN 中间维度(14336=3.5×d_model)，N 为总 expert 数(典型 8-256)，K 为每 token 激活 expert 数(典型 1-8)。\n2. **计算复杂度**：Self-Attention 为 O(T²·d_model)(compute-bound)，Router 为 O(T·d_model·N)(可忽略)，Expert FFN 为 O(T·K·d_model·d_ff)(compute-bound，dominant)，Token dispatch 为 O(T)(memory-bound)。\n3. **数据依赖**：Step 1(Attention) → Step 2(Router) → Step 3(Dispatch) 严格串行；Step 4 中各 expert 间无数据依赖可全并行；Step 5(Un-permute) 依赖 Step 4 全部完成。\n4. **并发可行性**：Expert FFN 间完美并行（无依赖），但受 token 分配不均影响——热门 expert 获得 token 数可能达平均值的 16 倍以上(MoE Load Skewness 笔记) → 负载倾斜导致部分计算单元闲置。\n\n### 硬件瓶颈分析：MoE Expert 路由开销与 GPU Memory Hierarchy 交互\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE...` (score: 12326.9, Fig.2 算子分类); `paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Serving in the Memory-Bound Regime...` (score: 13739.2)\n\n```\n=== MoE 推理硬件瓶颈分解 ===\n\nGPU Memory Hierarchy:\n  HBM (80GB, 3.35TB/s on H100) → L2 Cache (50MB, ~12TB/s) → SM L1/SMEM (256KB/SM) → Register\n\n瓶颈点 1: Token Dispatch 是 Memory-Bound 操作\n  - Router 输出 topk_indices [T, K] 后，需将 T 个 token 重排为 E 组\n  - 这涉及: sparse gather (从 HBM 读取 token hidden states)\n            + scatter (写入各 expert 的输入 buffer)\n  - 当 T 大(长序列 prefill)时，dispatch 完全受 HBM bandwidth 限制\n  - EPS-MoE 论文指出: 浅蓝框操作为 memory-bound (Fig.2)\n  - 笔记显示: All-to-All dispatch+combine 平均占 step time 34.1% (Lina 分析)\n  - GPU SM efficiency 在 All-to-All 期间仅 3.7%\n\n瓶颈点 2: Expert FFN 的 GroupGemm 效率低\n  - 每个 expert 收到的 token 数 T_e 不均衡，导致:\n    * T_e 小 → GroupGemm kernel 的 tile 利用率低(不足填满 Tensor Core)\n    * T_e 大 → 该 expert 的 FFN 成为延迟瓶颈\n  - EPS-MoE 通过动态切换 GroupGemm → DenseGemm 改善:\n    当某 expert 的 T_e 足够大时，使用 cuBLAS DenseGemm 获得更高 Tensor Core 利用率\n  - H100 Tensor Core FP8 峰值: 1979 TFLOPS, 但小 batch expert FFN 实际利用率常 <30%\n\n瓶颈点 3: Expert 参数驻留问题\n  - 单 GPU 场景: N 个 expert 的全部权重需驻留在 HBM\n  - Mixtral-8x7B: total 46B params, 96% 在 expert FFN → ~44B expert 参数\n  - H100 80GB 勉强容纳，但留给 KV-cache 和中间激活的空间很小\n  - 当 K 大(top-k routing), 更多 expert 需同时活跃 → HBM bandwidth 争抢加剧\n```\n\n---\n\n## 二、DiT (Diffusion Transformer) 模型单请求推理计算流程\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow A Data-Characteristic-Aware Serving System for Diffusion Models/4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 2240.7); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md` (score: 262.0)\n\n### 方法2: DiT Denoising Loop 推理流程\n\n**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**：\n\n```\n=== DiT 单请求推理：迭代去噪流程 ===\n输入: noise z_T ∈ R^{H×W×C} (随机高斯噪声, 如 32×32×4 latent)\n      condition c (text prompt embedding, 如 CLIP text encoder 输出)\n      timesteps t = T, T-1, ..., 1  (T=50 for SDXL-Turbo, T=1000 for standard)\n\n参数: DiT blocks × L 层, 每层含 Adaptive LayerNorm (adaLN) + Multi-Head Self-Attn + MLP\n\n# ═══ 外部去噪循环 ═══\nz = z_T  # [H, W, C]\nfor step s = T down to 1:\n    t_emb = TimestepEmbedding(s)                   # Sinusoidal + MLP → [d_model]\n    c_emb = ConditionEmbedding(c)                   # [d_model]\n    conditioning = t_emb + c_emb                    # [d_model], 合并条件\n\n    # ═══ DiT Forward (单步去噪预测) ═══\n    # 将 latent 展平为 patch tokens\n    z_patches = Patchify(z)                         # [N_patches, d_model]\n                                                    # N_patches = (H/p) × (W/p)\n                                                    # 例: 32×32 / 2 = 256 patches\n\n    # === DiT Block × L (所有 tokens 通过相同 Transformer) ===\n    h = z_patches  # [N_patches, d_model]\n    for l = 1..L:                                    # L=28 for DiT-XL/2\n        # adaLN: 根据 conditioning 动态调整 scale/shift\n        scale_1, shift_1, gate_1 = AdaLN_MLP(conditioning)\n        scale_2, shift_2, gate_2 = AdaLN_MLP(conditioning)\n        # 每个 [d_model], 由 conditioning 线性投影得到\n\n        # Multi-Head Self-Attention (dense, 全 patch)\n        h_norm = LayerNorm(h) * (1 + scale_1) + shift_1   # [N, d_model]\n        Q, K, V = h_norm @ W_Q, h_norm @ W_K, h_norm @ W_V  # [N, d_head]\n        attn = Softmax(Q @ K^T / sqrt(d_head)) @ V         # [N, d_model]\n        h = h + gate_1 * attn                               # residual\n\n        # MLP (Pointwise FFN)\n        h_norm = LayerNorm(h) * (1 + scale_2) + shift_2   # [N, d_model]\n        mlp = GELU(h_norm @ W_1) @ W_2                    # [N, d_model]\n        h = h + gate_2 * mlp                                # residual\n        # 每层 FLOPs: 4·N·d_model² + 2·N·d_model·d_ff\n\n    # === 输出: 噪声预测 ===\n    epsilon_pred = Unpatchify(h)                     # [H, W, C]\n\n    # === DDIM/SDE 去噪步进 ===\n    z = DenoisingStep(z, epsilon_pred, s)            # 更新 latent\n    # 例(DDIM): z_{s-1} = sqrt(α_{s-1})·(z_s - sqrt(1-α_s)·ε_pred)/sqrt(α_s)\n    #                + sqrt(1-α_{s-1})·ε_pred\n\n# ═══ 最终: VAE Decoder → Image ═══\nimage = VAE_Decoder(z)                               # [H*8, W*8, 3]\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n1. **变量含义**：z 为 latent representation(压缩空间噪声)，conditioning 合并时间步嵌入和文本条件，N_patches 由 latent 分辨率决定(如 DiT-XL/2 为 256 patches)。adaLN 为 DiT 特有的自适应归一化机制，用 conditioning 调制每层的 scale/shift/gate。\n2. **串行瓶颈——Denoising Loop**：最外层 denoising loop 有 T 次迭代(50-1000+)，每次迭代依赖上一步的 latent z → 纯串行，无法流水线并行。这是 DiT 推理延迟的主要来源。\n3. **每步内的并行机会**：Self-Attention 中多个 head 可并行计算；MLP 的 W_1 和 W_2 是标准 dense matmul → Tensor Core 友好；不同 batch 的 patch token 可共享 conditioning(计算一次)。\n4. **Difflow 论文关键优化**：通过 denoising loop 展开前几轮后识别 loop-invariant tensors(如固定的 conditioning embedding)，将其提升到循环外；检测多请求间共享的 prompt embedding 并消除冗余计算。\n\n### 硬件瓶颈分析：DiT 迭代去噪对计算单元利用率的影响\n\n```\n=== DiT 推理硬件瓶颈 ===\n\n瓶颈点 1: Denoising Loop 串行导致 Pipeline Bubble\n  - T=50 步 × 每步 ~10ms(在 H100 上 DiT-XL) → 总延迟 ~500ms\n  - 各步之间严格依赖: Step(t) 的 z_{t-1} 是 Step(t-1) 的输出\n  - → 无法利用多 SM 并行加速单步(步内可并行但步间不可)\n  - → GPU SM 利用率呈 \"脉冲式\": 每步计算时利用率高, 步间 kernel launch/idle\n\n瓶颈点 2: Patch Token 数量决定 Attention 复杂度\n  - N=256 patches → Attention FLOPs: 4·N²·d_model ≈ 4·256²·1152 ≈ 302M\n  - N=1024 patches(高分辨率) → Attention FLOPs: 4·1024²·1152 ≈ 4.8B (暴涨 16x)\n  - Attention 是 O(N²) → 高分辨率/长视频时迅速成为 compute-bound 瓶颈\n  - H100 Tensor Core 在 Attention Softmax 阶段利用率低(Softmax 是 element-wise)\n\n瓶颈点 3: 小 Batch 单请求场景 Tensor Core 利用率低\n  - 单请求推理 batch_size=1 → N_patches=256 tokens\n  - GPU MatMul 在 M=256 时远未填满 Tensor Core(A100 Tensor Core 最优 M ≥ 512-1024)\n  - EPS-MoE 指出: 小 batch GEMM 的 Tensor Core 利用率 < 20%\n  - NVLink/NVSwitch 带宽在单 GPU 场景不发挥作用(无跨 GPU 通信需求)\n\n瓶颈点 4: VAE Decoder 是 \"一次性大计算\"\n  - 去噪完成后, VAE Decoder 单次将 latent 解码为像素\n  - 包含多个反卷积层 + upsampling → 计算量大但仅执行一次\n  - 在单请求场景, VAE Decoder 启动开销(kernel launch latency)显著\n```\n\n---\n\n## 三、多模态模型单请求推理计算流程\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md` (score: 44.5); `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni...` (score: 886.0); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs.md` (score: 621.6); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture.md` (score: 425.9)\n\n### 方法3: Concatenation-based MLLM 推理流程 (以 LLaVA-1.5 为例)\n\n**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度 + 三阶段跨模态交互）**：\n\n```\n=== 多模态 MLLM 单请求推理流程 ===\n输入: Image I ∈ R^{H×W×3}, Text prompt P (如 \"What is in this image?\")\n输出: Text answer A\n\n# ═══ Phase 1: 模态编码 (异构计算单元映射) ═══\n# --- Vision Encoding (在 GPU Tensor Core 上执行) ---\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    # Vision Encoder (ViT-L/14, 冻结)\n    patches = PatchEmbed(I)                          # [N_v, d_vis], N_v=576, d_vis=1024\n    for vit_layer in ViT.blocks:                     # 24 ViT layers\n        patches = vit_layer(patches)                 # Self-Attention + MLP\n    V = patches[:, 1:]                               # [576, 1024], 去掉 CLS token\n    # 笔记: 视觉编码器输出 576 tokens × 1024 dims\n\n# --- Text Tokenization (在 CPU 上执行) ---\nT_ids = Tokenizer(P)                                 # [T_text], 如 20 tokens\nT_emb = Embedding(T_ids)                             # [T_text, d_llm], d_llm=4096\n\n# ═══ Phase 2: 模态对齐 (Projector) ═══\n# --- 视觉特征 → LLM Embedding 空间 ---\nV_proj = Projector(V)                                # [576, 4096]\n# Projector: Linear(GELU(Linear(V))) 或 更复杂的 Q-Former/Mamba-2 scan\n#    参数: ~2·d_vis·d_llm ≈ 2·1024·4096 ≈ 8.4M (极小)\n#    笔记: knowledge_notes/.../Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM.md\n\n# ═══ Phase 3: LLM Backbone (跨模态融合) ═══\n# --- Token 拼接 ---\nH = Concat([V_proj, T_emb])                          # [576+20, 4096] = [596, 4096]\n\n# --- 逐层 Transformer (三阶段跨模态交互) ---\nfor l = 1..L:                                        # L=32 for LLaVA-v1.5\n    H_norm = RMSNorm(H)                              # [596, 4096]\n    Q, K, V = H_norm @ W_Q, H_norm @ W_K, H_norm @ W_V\n\n    # Attention 矩阵包含 4 个区域:\n    # [V→V][V→T]  视觉 self-attn + 视觉→文本 cross-attn\n    # [T→V][T→T]  文本→视觉 cross-attn + 文本 self-attn\n    attn_scores = Q @ K^T / sqrt(d_head)             # [596, 596]\n    # → O((N_v+T_text)²) = O(596²) ≈ 355K 次乘法 (per head per layer)\n\n    # --- 三阶段行为差异 (VisiPruner 笔记) ---\n    if l <= 8:   # Stage 1: Shallow — Task Recognition\n        # 跨模态 attention 几乎无效; 视觉 token 仅作为 attention sink\n        # 文本 token 编码的是 task type (如 \"number\"→counting), 非视觉内容\n        pass\n    elif l <= 23: # Stage 2: Middle — Sparse Cross-Modal Grounding\n        # 跨模态融合突然发生 (abrupt onset)\n        # 仅 ~10/576 视觉 token 驱动跨模态信息传递\n        # → 大部分视觉 token 的 cross-attention 计算是冗余的!\n        pass\n    else:         # Stage 3: Deep — Linguistic Alignment\n        # 视觉信息已集成到文本表示, 视觉 token 不再需要\n        # → 可安全裁剪 (Vision Exit)\n        pass\n\n    attn_out = Softmax(attn_scores) @ V              # [596, 4096]\n    H = H + attn_out                                  # residual\n    H = H + FFN(RMSNorm(H))                          # gate_proj+up_proj+down_proj\n\n# ═══ Phase 4: 自回归解码 ═══\ngenerated_ids = []\nfor step in range(max_new_tokens):\n    logits = H[-1] @ W_lm_head                       # [vocab_size], 仅取最后位置\n    next_token = Argmax(logits / temperature)         # 或采样\n    generated_ids.append(next_token)\n    if next_token == EOS: break\n    # 新 token 追加到序列, KV-cache 复用 → 每步仅计算单个新 token\n    # decode 阶段 FLOPs/token ≈ 2·L·d_model² + 3·L·d_model·d_ff\n    # = 2·32·4096² + 3·32·4096·14336 ≈ 1.07G + 5.64G ≈ 6.7G FLOPs\n\nanswer = Detokenizer(generated_ids)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n1. **计算图依赖**：Phase 1 Vision Encoding → Phase 2 Projector → Phase 3 LLM → Phase 4 Decode。Vision 和 Text encoding 可并行（在不同计算单元）。\n2. **跨模态融合的三阶段规律**(VisiPruner 笔记 EMNLP 2025)：浅层无实质融合 → 中层稀疏关键 token 驱动 → 深层纯语言 refinement。这意味着约 50% 的 visual token 计算是冗余的。\n3. **异构计算单元映射**：\n   - Vision Encoder (ViT) → Tensor Core + CNN 风格的 patch embedding → GPU SM\n   - Text Tokenization → CPU (GPT/BPE tokenizer)\n   - LLM Backbone → GPU Tensor Core (GEMM) + SM (Softmax/RMSNorm)\n   - Projector → GPU Tensor Core (小矩阵, 利用率低)\n\n### 硬件瓶颈分析：多模态跨模态融合在异构计算单元上的映射\n\n```\n=== 多模态推理硬件瓶颈 ===\n\n瓶颈点 1: Visual Token 数量导致的 Attention 复杂度爆炸\n  - N_v=576(CLIP ViT-L) → LLM 输入长度 = 576+text_len\n  - Self-Attention O((N_v+T_text)²):\n    单层 32 heads × 596² × 128(d_head) ≈ 1.45G FLOPs per layer\n    32 层 → ~46G FLOPs 仅 Attention\n  - Attention 矩阵中 V→V 区域 576² ≈ 332K entries, 但仅 ~10 个视觉 token 真正重要\n  - → 跨模态注意力中 >95% 的计算是冗余的!\n\n瓶颈点 2: Projector 成为数据搬运瓶颈\n  - V_proj = Projector(V) 的计算量小（~8.4M params）但 V 从 Vision Encoder 输出\n    需经 HBM → L2 → SM 传输 (576×1024×2bytes ≈ 1.2MB FP16)\n  - 若 Vision Encoder 和 LLM 在不同 GPU/加速器上 → PCIe/NVLink 跨设备传输\n  - 单 GPU 场景: V 从 HBM 读取→Projector 计算→写回 HBM→LLM 读取 → 3 次 HBM 往返\n\n瓶颈点 3: Cross-Attention MLLM vs Concatenation MLLM 的硬件偏好差异\n  - Concatenation-based (LLaVA): visual tokens 在 context window 中\n    → HBM 需保存完整的 [V+T] KV-cache → 576 visual KV entries × 32 layers\n    → ~576×32×4096×2×2bytes ≈ 302MB 仅视觉 KV-cache (FP16)\n  - Cross-Attention-based (Flamingo/mPLUG-Owl3): visual tokens 不进入 context\n    → KV-cache 仅需保存 text tokens → 大幅节省 HBM\n    → 但需要额外的 cross-attn K/V 投影 → 增加计算量\n  - 笔记未明确说明哪种在单 GPU H100 上更优 — 取决于 visual token 数量\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、Video 模型单请求推理计算流程\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/50-S-DMA- Sparse Diffusion Models Acceleration via Spatiality-Aware Prediction and Dimension-Adaptive Dataflow/5.4-Ablation-Study.md` (score: 1645.0); `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/MoBA__Mixture_of_Block_Attention_for_Long-Context_LLMs/4-Related-Work.md` (score: 1735.2); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md` (score: 262.0)\n\n### 方法4: Video DiT (基于 MMDiT 的视频生成推理)\n\n**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**：\n\n```\n=== Video DiT 单请求推理流程 (以 HunyuanVideo/EasyAnimate 为例) ===\n输入: noise z_T ∈ R^{F×H×W×C}  (F 帧, 如 14 帧 latent)\n      text condition c\n输出: video frames\n\nF = 14  # latent 帧数\nH, W = latent 空间分辨率 (如 40×64 for 720p)\nC = 16  # VAE latent channels\nN_tokens = F × H × W  # = 14×40×64 = 35840 tokens! (vs DiT image 的 256 tokens)\n                       # → 140x 更多 tokens!\n\nz = z_T  # [F, H, W, C]\n\nfor step s = T down to 1:\n    # === Step 1: 3D Patchify ===\n    z_patches = Patchify3D(z, patch_size=(2,2,2))\n    # z_patches: [F/2 × H/2 × W/2, C·8]\n    # → [7 × 20 × 32, 128] = [4480, 128]\n\n    # === Step 2: Text-Video Conditioning ===\n    t_emb = TimestepEmbedding(s)\n    c_text = TextEncoder(c)                           # CLIP/T5 text features\n    # Text features 经 RMSNorm+FC 变换后与 video tokens 拼接\n\n    # === Step 3: MMDiT Blocks (共享 Self-Attn + 独立 FFN) ===\n    h_text, h_video = c_text, z_patches\n    for l = 1..L:                                     # L=28~48 for video DiT\n        # --- 共享 Self-Attention: 文本+视频统一交互 ---\n        h_combined = Concat([Norm(h_text), Norm(h_video)])\n        attn_out = MultiHeadSelfAttn(h_combined)\n        # → O((N_text + N_video)²) = O((77+4480)²) = O(4557²) ≈ 20.8M per head\n        attn_text, attn_video = Split(attn_out)\n\n        # --- 独立 FFN (MMDiT 设计) ---\n        h_text  = h_text  + attn_text\n        h_text  = h_text  + FFN_text(Norm(h_text))\n        h_video = h_video + attn_video\n        h_video = h_video + FFN_video(Norm(h_video))\n        # 文本 FFN 参数 ≪ 视频 FFN 参数 (视频占据绝大部分计算)\n\n    # === Step 4: 噪声预测 + 去噪步进 ===\n    epsilon_pred = Unpatchify3D(h_video)\n    z = DenoisingStep(z, epsilon_pred, s)             # DDIM/Flow-Matching\n\n# VAE Decoder: latent → pixel frames [F, H_f, W_f, 3]\nvideo = VAE_Decoder3D(z)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n1. **时空 Attention 的两种实现范式**：\n   - **(A) 联合时空 Attention (Full 3D)**：Q,K,V 同时包含空间和时间维度 → O((F·H·W)²) 复杂度 → 计算量爆炸但信息最完整\n   - **(B) 分解时空 Attention (Factorized)**：先 Spatial Self-Attn (per frame) O(F·(H·W)²)，再 Temporal Self-Attn (per spatial location) O(H·W·F²)。总 O(F·(H·W)² + H·W·F²)。笔记 (MoBA Related Work 节) 指出：spatial-temporal attention 通过分解降低复杂度。\n2. **数据依赖**：Spatial Attn 的各帧可独立并行 → 无帧间依赖 → 天然适合多 SM 并行。Temporal Attn 需所有帧的对应空间位置特征就绪 → 在 Spatial Attn 全部完成后才能执行。\n3. **MMDiT 设计取舍**：共享 Self-Attention 实现文本-视频跨模态融合，独立 FFN 保持各模态特征表达。文本 FFN 计算量相对视频 FFN 可忽略。\n\n### 硬件瓶颈分析：Video 时空 Attention 对访存带宽的压力\n\n```\n=== Video 推理硬件瓶颈 ===\n\n瓶颈点 1: Token 数量爆炸 → HBM Capacity 和 Bandwidth 双重压力\n  - 14帧 video latent = 35840 tokens (vs 256 for image DiT)\n  - Attention 中间激活: Q,K,V 各 [35840, 4096] FP16 ≈ 294MB × 3 ≈ 882MB\n  - Attention score matrix: [35840, 35840] FP16 ≈ 2.57GB (单层单 head!)\n    → FlashAttention 通过 tiling 避免完整物化, 但仍需在 SRAM/HBM 间反复搬运 tile\n  - 32 层 video DiT → HBM 峰值占用可能超过 80GB → 需要 offload/checkpointing\n\n瓶颈点 2: 时空 Attention 的访存模式不友好\n  - Spatial Attention (per frame):\n    每帧的 token 在 HBM 中连续存储 → coalesced access ✓\n    但需要 F 次独立的 Attention kernel launch → kernel launch overhead\n  - Temporal Attention (per spatial location):\n    需要跨帧 gather 同一空间位置的 token → strided memory access ✗\n    → 每次 gather 涉及 F 次 HBM 访问 (F=14, 每次访问不连续)\n    → Memory bandwidth utilization 在 temporal attention 期间 < 40%\n\n瓶颈点 3: VAE 3D Decoder 的访存放大\n  - 3D VAE Decoder 将 latent [14,40,64,16] → pixels [14,320,512,3]\n  - 包含 3D ConvTranspose + Upsample → 大量 strided HBM 访问\n  - 输出视频帧尺寸 14×320×512×3×1byte ≈ 6.9MB → 但在 decode 过程中中间张量可能是最终输出的 10×+\n  - 笔记 (S-DMA ablation) 指出: 在 video domain, temporally extended denoising\n    引入 large parameters and complex computation\n\n瓶颈点 4: 帧数 F 对延迟的线性放大\n  - 单请求推理中, 每增加 1 帧 latent → Attention cost (spatial) + F·cost(temporal)\n  - F=14: latency ≈ 14× latency(image DiT with same resolution)\n  - 去噪步数 T=50: total latency ≈ 50 × 14 × per-step-cost\n  - → 单请求视频推理延迟可长达数十秒 (在 H100 上)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、跨模型计算图依赖统一分析\n\n基于数据依赖 DAG 分析四种模型推理流程中的可并行与必须串行部分：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph MoE[\"MoE 推理 DAG\"]\n        A1[\"Input Tokens\"] --> A2[\"Self-Attention\"]\n        A2 --> A3[\"Router<br/>Gate Network\"]\n        A3 --> A4[\"Token Dispatch<br/>memory-bound\"]\n        A4 --> A5[\"Expert 0<br/>FFN\"]\n        A4 --> A6[\"Expert 1<br/>FFN\"]\n        A4 --> A7[\"Expert N-1<br/>FFN\"]\n        A5 --> A8[\"Token Combine<br/>+ 加权聚合\"]\n        A6 --> A8\n        A7 --> A8\n    end\n\n    subgraph DiT[\"DiT 推理 DAG\"]\n        B1[\"Noise Latent z_t\"] --> B2[\"Timestep Embed<br/>+ Conditioning\"]\n        B2 --> B3[\"adaLN Modulate\"]\n        B3 --> B4[\"Self-Attention<br/>N_patches\"]\n        B4 --> B5[\"MLP FFN\"]\n        B5 --> B6[\"Noise Pred &epsilon;<br/>+ Denoising Step\"]\n        B6 --> B7[\"z_{t-1}\"]\n        B7 -->|\"串行循环 T 次\"| B1\n    end\n\n    subgraph MM[\"多模态推理 DAG\"]\n        C1[\"Image\"] --> C2[\"Vision Encoder<br/>ViT\"]\n        C3[\"Text Prompt\"] --> C4[\"Tokenizer<br/>CPU\"]\n        C2 --> C5[\"Projector\"]\n        C4 --> C6[\"Token Embedding\"]\n        C5 --> C7[\"Concat<br/>V+T tokens\"]\n        C6 --> C7\n        C7 --> C8[\"LLM Layer 1..L<br/>三阶段跨模态交互\"]\n        C8 --> C9[\"Autoregressive<br/>Decode Loop\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Video[\"Video 推理 DAG\"]\n        D1[\"Noise z_T<br/>F frames\"] --> D2[\"3D Patchify\"]\n        D2 --> D3[\"Spatial Attn<br/>per frame 并行\"]\n        D3 --> D4[\"Temporal Attn<br/>跨帧 gather\"]\n        D4 --> D5[\"MMDiT FFN\"]\n        D5 --> D6[\"Denoising Step\"]\n        D6 --> D7[\"z_{t-1}\"]\n        D7 -->|\"串行 T 次\"| D1\n    end\n\n    style A4 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333\n    style B7 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333\n    style D7 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333\n    style C9 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333\n```\n\n**注解**：红色节点代表各模型的关键串行瓶颈。MoE 的 Token Dispatch 是 memory-bound 瓶颈（全模型唯一不支持 Tensor Core 加速的关键路径）。DiT 和 Video 的 Denoising Loop 形成严格的迭代串行依赖链（T 步不可并行）。多模态的 Autoregressive Decode Loop 同样串行（每 token 依赖前一 token 的 KV-cache 状态）。\n\n---\n\n## 六、方法对比表\n\n| 模型 | 核心推理机制 | 关键算子 | 单请求延迟主导因素 | 主要硬件瓶颈 | 并发机会 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|-------------|---------|-------------------|------------|---------|---------|\n| **MoE** (Mixtral-8x7B) | Top-K Sparse Routing + Expert FFN | Router(Softmax+TopK)、Token Dispatch(permute)、Expert GEMM、All-to-All | Expert FFN 计算 (K×3×d_model×d_ff FLOPs/token) | Token Dispatch memory-bound (34% step time)、小 batch Expert GEMM Tensor Core 利用率低 (<30%)、HBM 容量限制 (expert 参数占 96%) | Expert FFN 内各 expert 完美并行; Attention 和 Expert FFN 可 overlap | EPS-MoE (12326.9), MoE notes (2847.6), MoE-Inference-Bench (3156.4) |\n| **DiT** (DiT-XL/2) | Iterative Denoising + adaLN | Self-Attention(N²)、adaLN Modulation、MLP FFN、DDIM Step | Denoising Loop × T 步串行 (T=50~1000) | Denoising 步间串行 bubble → GPU 脉冲式利用; 小 patch token 数(N=256) → Tensor Core 低利用率; Attention O(N²) 随分辨率暴涨 | 步内 Multi-Head 并行、GroupNorm 多 group 并行 | Difflow (2240.7), DMQ (3671.4) |\n| **多模态 MLLM** (LLaVA-1.5 7B) | Vision Encoder + Projector + LLM Fusion | ViT Self-Attn、Projector MLP、LLM Self-Attn(含 V→V/V→T/T→V/T→T)、Autoregressive Decode | Visual token 数量(N_v=576) 导致 Attention 长度 596 → 跨模态计算量约 50% 冗余 | Visual token HBM 占用大 (KV-cache ~302MB for 576 imgs)、Projector 数据搬运、Attention O((N_v+T)²) 冗余计算 | Vision Encoder 和 Text Tokenizer 可并行; Decode 阶段 KV-cache 复用 | VisiPruner (6481.1), vLLM-Omni (886.0), Cross-Attn MLLM (425.9), Three-Stage (621.6) |\n| **Video DiT** (HunyuanVideo) | 3D Patchify + 时空 Attention + MMDiT | 3D Conv、Spatial Self-Attn(per frame)、Temporal Self-Attn(cross-frame)、MMDiT FFN(shared attn + independent FFN) | 帧数 F 对 Attention cost 线性放大 (F=14 → 140× image DiT tokens) | Temporal Attn strided HBM access → bandwidth <40%; 3D VAE Decoder 中间张量 >10× 输出; HBM 容量难以容纳 35840 tokens 的完整 attention matrix | Spatial Attn 各帧可全并行; Temporal Attn 各空间位置可全并行; MMDiT 文本/视频 FFN 可并行 | S-DMA (1645.0), MoBA (1735.2), MMDiT notes (262.0) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **DiT 推理的精确硬件利用率数据**：笔记未提供 DiT-XL 在 H100 上单请求推理的 Tensor Core 利用率 (MFU) 数值。EPS-MoE 提供了 MoE 的 GEMM 效率分析，但 DiT-specific 的硬件效率数据需要在实验笔记中进一步搜索。\n2. **NPU 上多模态推理的具体数据流**：华为昇腾 910B、Apple ANE 上的多模态推理流程和数据流分析与 GPU 存在架构差异（如 NPU 的脉动阵列 vs GPU 的 Tensor Core），但笔记未提供 NPU 平台上的具体推理伪代码或 trace。\n3. **Video 模型的精确 HBM 带宽利用率**：笔记提供了 temporal attention strided access 的定性分析，但未提供 H100 上 HunyuanVideo 等模型的实际 memory bandwidth utilization 百分比——此为定性推断。\n4. **单 GPU 场景的 Expert Offloading 开销**：MoE 在单 GPU 场景下若启用 expert offloading（部分 expert 权重放在 CPU/SSD），延迟将主要由 PCIe bandwidth 决定。笔记 (MoE-Lightning, score: 2648.9) 讨论了 memory-constrained GPU 的 offloading 策略，但未在本文详细展开。\n5. **Video 的 Factorized vs Full 3D Attention 硬件偏好**：笔记未提供两种时空 Attention 范式在 H100 上的详细对比数据——哪种在单请求场景下延迟更低取决于 F 和 (H,W) 的相对大小。\n6. **DiT 的 timestep embedding 硬件开销**：笔记 (DMQ, score: 3671.4) 提到了 diffusion 模型的 timestep-aware 量化和 outlier 分析，但未提供 timestep embedding 计算的具体硬件开销数据。\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q1.1\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":602,"newStart":1,"newLines":531,"lines":["-# Q1.1 — MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程","+# Q1.1 — MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程与硬件瓶颈分析"," "," ## 笔记证据概览"," "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| repos/repo_moe_batch_1/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 37169.5 | MoE 推理 pipeline 伪代码、Token Condensation、Expert Parallelism 流程 |","-| repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 5360.2 | DiT 推理 pipeline 伪代码、denoising loop、Sequence Parallelism |","-| repos/repo_video_image/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 14146.0 | 多模态融合流程、Input-side Adaptation、Video MLLM 推理 |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference with Fine-Grained Scheduling...md | 9637.8 | Fine-grained DEP scheduling、MoE 推理 disaggregation |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/MoE-ERAS Expert Residency Aware Selection/MoE-ERAS...md | 8571.0 | Expert gating mechanism、routing 公式、activation patterns |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 1673.5 | All-to-All dispatch/combine 流程、communication topology |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md | 1217.7 | EP kernel 调度流程、top-k routing、load imbalance |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism.md | 1212.4 | EP 系统架构、混合并行策略、MoEShard 替代方案 |","-| paper_secs/secs_video_image/EasyAnimate.../3-Architecture.md | 3363.2 | Video DiT 架构、Hybrid Window Attention、3D Causal VAE、MMDiT |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md | — | HBM→L2→SMEM→Register 数据流、带宽/延迟数值 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md | — | Memory-bound vs compute-bound 判定、decode 阶段物理过程 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md | 4723.6 | Roofline 模型、ridge point、HBM-level CI |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Core (TC).md | — | Tensor Core shape、MMA 指令、低精度吞吐 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/A Survey...Sparse-Attention.md | 2340.1 | Sparse/Approximate/Attention-Free 架构对比、复杂度表 |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE Expert Pipeline Scheduler for Cost-Efficient MoE Inference/EPS-MoE-Expert-Pipeline-Scheduler-for-Cost-Efficient-MoE-Inference.md | 12326.9 | MoE 推理 pipeline 架构图(GEMM/compute-bound vs memory-bound 算子分类)、Expert Pipeline Scheduler、GroupGemm vs DenseGemm 切换、communication-computation overlap |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Serving in the Memory-Bound Regime Balance Activated Experts, Not Tokens/... | 13739.2 | MoE memory-bound 推理瓶颈、expert 激活平衡、all-to-all 通信开销定量分析 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Mixture of Experts (MoE).md | 2847.6 | MoE 核心公式、四步推理过程伪代码、MoE layer forward pass 完整流程 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md | 3989.1 | Top-K 路由伪代码、K 值选择、固定 Top-K 缺陷分析 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE Gate Network _ Expert Routing (门控网络 _ 专家路由).md | 3932.3 | Gate Network 决策链路、AlltoAll dispatch 流程、Capacity Factor 机制 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE (Mixture-of-Experts).md | 2065.3 | MoE 公式 y=ΣG(x)_i·E_i(x)、推理机制、Multi-LoRA serving |","+| experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/Efficient MoE Inference with Fine-Grained Scheduling of Disaggregated Expert Parallelism.md | 3617.2 | FinDEP DEP 推理全流程(Offline/Online/Per-Layer)、四种 GPU 平台吞吐数据 |","+| experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/MoE-Inference-Bench_ Performance Evaluation of Mixture of Expert Large Language and Vision Models.md | 3156.4 | vLLM MoE 推理全流程(TP+EP+Fused MoE)、H100 vs Cerebras CS-3 硬件对比 |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow A Data-Characteristic-Aware Serving System for Diffusion Models/4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md | 2240.7 | Diffusion pipeline 计算图(dGraph)、denoising loop 展开、DiT 架构支持 |","+| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/DMQ Dissecting Outliers of Diffusion Models for Post-Training Quantization/... | 3671.4 | Diffusion 模型量化、timestep-aware 量化、denoising 过程的 outlier 分析 |","+| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni Fully Disaggregated Serving for Any-to-Any Multimodal Models/... | 886.0 | Any-to-Any 多模态架构(Thinker-Talker/AR+DiT)、stage graph 抽象 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md | 44.5 | Any-to-Any pipeline 组成(Qwen3-Omni/GLM-Image/BAGEL) |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md | 262.0 | MMDiT block 伪代码(共享 Self-Attention + 独立 FFN) |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs.md | 621.6 | MLLM 三阶段跨模态交互(浅层 Task Recognition/中层 Sparse Grounding/深层 Linguistic Alignment) |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture.md | 425.9 | 三大 MLLM 架构范式对比(Concatenation/Token Compression/Cross-Attention) |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM.md | 27.3 | 多模态连接器设计(MLP/Q-Former/Mamba-2 scan) |","+| paper_secs/secs_2025/50-S-DMA- Sparse Diffusion Models Acceleration via Spatiality-Aware Prediction and Dimension-Adaptive Dataflow/5.4-Ablation-Study.md | 1645.0 | Video diffusion 加速、temporal extension、spatial attention 分析 |","+| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/MoBA__Mixture_of_Block_Attention_for_Long-Context_LLMs/4-Related-Work.md | 1735.2 | spatial-temporal attention 分解、video transformer 相关研究 |"," "," ---"," ","-## 一、MoE 模型的单请求推理计算流程","+## 一、MoE 模型单请求推理计算流程"," ","-### 1.1 方法细节：MoE Decoder Layer 推理伪代码","+**侧重标签**: 硬件体系结构（主内容）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_moe_batch_1/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 37169.5)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md` (score: 1217.7)","+### 方法1: Standard MoE Transformer Layer Forward Pass"," ","-MoE 模型将 Transformer 的 FFN 层替换为多个 expert 子网络，通过可学习的 Router（门控网络）为每个 token 选择性激活 top-k 个 expert。**笔记显示**：\"MoE 是一种神经网络架构范式，将模型容量分布在多个专门的子网络（'专家'）之间，通过可学习的路由机制（门控网络）为每个输入选择性激活相关的专家子集，实现条件计算。\"","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Mixture of Experts (MoE).md` (score: 2847.6); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md` (score: 3989.1)"," ","+**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**：","+"," ```","-=== MoE 单请求推理 Forward Pass（单GPU，batch_size=1）===","+=== MoE 单请求推理：逐 Token 前向传播 ===","+输入: x ∈ R^{T×d_model}  (T 个 token, d_model=4096 for Mixtral-8x7B)","+参数: N 个 Expert FFN E_i, Router W_r ∈ R^{d_model×N}, K=top-k 激活数"," ","-输入: input_ids [1, S]  (S=prompt_len, 单请求)","-      KV_cache [L, 1, H, d_head] (已累积)","+for each MoE layer l = 1..L:                         # L=32 for Mixtral","+    # === Step 1: Self-Attention (Dense, 所有 token) ===","+    x_norm = RMSNorm(x)                              # [T, d_model]","+    Q, K, V = x_norm @ W_Q, x_norm @ W_K, x_norm @ W_V","+                                                     # 各 [T, d_head], 并行 32 heads","+    A = FlashAttention(Q, K, V)                      # [T, d_model], O(T·d_model²)","+    x = x + A                                        # residual, [T, d_model]"," ","-# === Prefill 阶段: 并行处理所有 prompt tokens ===","-1: X ← Embed(input_ids)                          # [1, S, d_model]","-2: for layer l = 1 to L do","-3:     # ---- Self-Attention (prefill) ----","-4:     Q, K, V ← X @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]            # [1, S, d_model] @ [d_model, 3d_model]","-5:                                                  # → [1, S, 3d_model]","-6:                                                  # 算子: 3 × GEMM, shape [M=S, K=d_model, N=d_model]","-7:                                                  # FLOPs: 3 × 2Sd²","-8:     Q ← RoPE(Q)                                # 旋转位置编码","-9:     K ← RoPE(K); 更新 KV_cache[l] ← K","-10:    A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d) @ V             # [1, S, d] @ [1, d, S] → [1, S, S]","-11:                                                  # [1, S, S] @ [1, S, d] → [1, S, d]","-12:                                                  # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O(S²d), memory-intensive","-13:    X ← X + A                                 # residual connection","-14:    X ← RMSNorm(X)                             # [1, S, d_model], element-wise","-15:","-16:    # ---- MoE Router (Gating) ----","-17:    gate_logits ← X @ W_gate                   # [1, S, d_model] @ [d_model, E] → [1, S, E]","-18:                                                   # 算子: GEMM, shape [M=S, K=d_model, N=E]","-19:    gate_probs ← SoftMax(gate_logits)          # per-token normalization","-20:    topk_vals, topk_idx ← TopK(gate_probs, k)  # k=2 (典型值)","-21:                                                   # 瓶颈: TopK 在 CUDA Core 执行, 不可用 Tensor Core","-22:","-23:    # ---- Expert Compute ----","-24:    Y ← zeros_like(X)                          # [1, S, d_model]","-25:    for each expert e ∈ topk_idx do             # 最多 2k 个不同 expert (k=2 → ≤4 experts)","-26:        tokens_e ← X[topk_idx == e]             # [N_e, d_model]","-27:        if |tokens_e| > 0:","-28:            # SwiGLU FFN (每个 expert 独立):","-29:            gate ← tokens_e @ W_gate_e          # [N_e, d] @ [d, d_ff] → [N_e, d_ff]","-30:            up   ← tokens_e @ W_up_e            # [N_e, d] @ [d, d_ff] → [N_e, d_ff]","-31:            act  ← SiLU(gate) ⊙ up              # element-wise gating","-32:            out_e ← act @ W_down_e              # [N_e, d_ff] @ [d_ff, d] → [N_e, d]","-33:            Y[topk_idx == e] ← topk_vals[e] * out_e  # gated weighted sum","-34:    end for","-35:    X ← X + Y                                  # residual connection","-36: end for","-37:","-38: # === Decode 阶段: 逐 token 自回归生成 ===","-39: for step s = 1 to max_new_tokens do","-40:     x ← Embed(token_{S+s-1})                  # [1, 1, d_model]","-41:     for layer l = 1 to L do","-42:         # ---- Self-Attention (decode) ----","-43:         q ← x @ W_Q                           # [1, 1, d] @ [d, d] → [1, 1, d]","-44:         k_new, v_new ← x @ [W_K, W_V]         # [1, 1, 2d]","-45:         更新 KV_cache[l] ← concat(KV_cache[l], [k_new, v_new])","-46:         # 瓶颈: 从 HBM 读取完整 KV_cache [1, S+s, d] → memory-bound","-47:         a ← SoftMax(q @ K_cache^T / √d) @ V_cache","-48:                                                    # CI ≈ 1 (极低), 严重 memory-bound","-49:","-50:         # ---- MoE Router (与 prefill 相同) ----","-51:         gate_logits ← x @ W_gate              # [1, 1, d_model] @ [d_model, E] → [1, 1, E]","-52:         topk_idx ← TopK(SoftMax(gate_logits), k=2)","-53:","-54:         # ---- Expert Compute (decode) ----","-55:         # N_e = 1 per expert (batch_size=1), 仅需加载 ≤k 个 expert weights","-56:         # 瓶颈: 从 HBM 加载 expert FFN weights (~200MB/expert) → memory-bound","-57:         # 每个 expert 的 effective CI ≈ 1 (batch=1)","-58:         for each expert e ∈ topk_idx:","-59:             加载 W_gate_e, W_up_e, W_down_e   # HBM → L2 → SMEM → Register","-60:             out_e ← SwiGLU_FFN(x, e)           # 计算量极小, 等待 weight 加载","-61:         end for","-62:         y ← Σ topk_vals[e] * out_e","-63:         x ← x + y","-64:     end for","-65:     token_{S+s} ← ArgMax(LM_Head(x))          # [1, 1, vocab_size]","-66: end for","-```","+    # === Step 2: Router (Gate Network) ===","+    x_norm = RMSNorm(x)                              # [T, d_model]","+    logits = x_norm @ W_r                            # [T, N], N=8 experts","+    probs = Softmax(logits, dim=-1)                  # [T, N]","+    topk_weights, topk_indices = TopK(probs, K)      # 各 [T, K], K=2","+    topk_weights = topk_weights / sum(topk_weights)  # 归一化"," ","-**注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `S`=prompt 长度, `L`=层数, `E`=expert 总数, `d_model`=hidden dim, `d_ff`=intermediate dim, `k`=top-k 值, `N_e`=路由到 expert e 的 token 数","-- **复杂度分析**: Prefill 阶段 per-layer FLOPs = O(S²d + Sd² + k·S·d·d_ff)，受 attention 的 O(S²d) 主导；Decode 阶段 per-token FLOPs = O(Sd + d² + k·d·d_ff)，受 KV_cache 加载和 expert weight 加载主导","-- **数据依赖**: Router 必须先于 expert 计算（串行依赖）；不同 expert 的 FFN 无数据依赖 → 可并行；同一 expert 的不同 token 可 batch 处理","-- **并发可行性**: (a) 不同 expert 的 FFN 可并发执行（无数据依赖）；(b) prefill 阶段 attention 的 multi-head 可并行；(c) decode 阶段因 batch=1，expert FFN 的 GEMM 形状 [M=1, K=d, N=d_ff] 极小，Tensor Core 利用率极低","+    # === Step 3: Token-to-Expert Dispatch (数据布局变换) ===","+    # 将 T 个 token 按 routing 结果重排为 E 组","+    for e = 0..E-1:","+        tokens_e = {x_norm[t] | e ∈ topk_indices[t]} # 收集分配给 expert e 的 tokens","+                                                      # 形状: [T_e, d_model], T_e 不均匀!","+    # 注: 这一步是 memory-bound 操作（scatter/gather）"," ","-### 1.2 MoE 硬件瓶颈分析","+    # === Step 4: Expert FFN 并行计算 ===","+    for e = 0..E-1:                                   # E 个 expert 可独立并行!","+        if len(tokens_e) > 0:","+            # Expert FFN: SiLU-gated FFN","+            gate = SiLU(tokens_e @ W_gate[e])        # [T_e, d_ff], d_ff=14336","+            up   = tokens_e @ W_up[e]                # [T_e, d_ff]","+            act  = gate * up                          # element-wise, [T_e, d_ff]","+            out_e = act @ W_down[e]                   # [T_e, d_model]","+            # 总 FLOPs per token: 3·d_model·d_ff ≈ 3·4096·14336 ≈ 176M FLOPs"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`","+    # === Step 5: Token Un-permute + 加权聚合 ===","+    y = zeros([T, d_model])","+    for t = 0..T-1:","+        for k = 0..K-1:","+            e = topk_indices[t, k]","+            y[t] += topk_weights[t, k] * out_e[idx_map[t, e]]","+                                                     # 加权求和","+    x = x + y                                         # residual, [T, d_model]","+```"," ","-#### 瓶颈1: Expert 路由开销与 GPU Memory Hierarchy 的交互","+**注解**："," ","-MoE 推理的核心硬件瓶颈在于 **expert weight 加载**与 GPU 内存层次结构的交互。**笔记揭示**：\"在 memory-bound decode 阶段，应最小化 activated experts 数量而非平衡 token 数，因为 token activation 的内存流量微不足道（<0.6% of weight traffic）。\"","+1. **变量含义与维度**：T 为 token 数(单请求 prefill 典型值 128-4096)，d_model 为隐藏维度(如 Mixtral 4096)，d_ff 为 FFN 中间维度(14336=3.5×d_model)，N 为总 expert 数(典型 8-256)，K 为每 token 激活 expert 数(典型 1-8)。","+2. **计算复杂度**：Self-Attention 为 O(T²·d_model)(compute-bound)，Router 为 O(T·d_model·N)(可忽略)，Expert FFN 为 O(T·K·d_model·d_ff)(compute-bound，dominant)，Token dispatch 为 O(T)(memory-bound)。","+3. **数据依赖**：Step 1(Attention) → Step 2(Router) → Step 3(Dispatch) 严格串行；Step 4 中各 expert 间无数据依赖可全并行；Step 5(Un-permute) 依赖 Step 4 全部完成。","+4. **并发可行性**：Expert FFN 间完美并行（无依赖），但受 token 分配不均影响——热门 expert 获得 token 数可能达平均值的 16 倍以上(MoE Load Skewness 笔记) → 负载倾斜导致部分计算单元闲置。"," ","-1. **Decode 阶段的 memory-bound 本质**：在单请求 decode 阶段，batch_size=1，每个 token 需从 HBM 加载 k 个 expert 的 FFN 权重（~200MB/expert）。以 A100 80GB (HBM BW=2.0TB/s) 为例：","-   - 加载 2 个 expert weights: 400MB / 2000GB/s ≈ 0.2ms（仅 weight 加载）","-   - Tensor Core 计算: 2 × 1 × d × d_ff × 2 ≈ 数百万 FLOPs → 计算耗时 ~0.003ms（312 TFLOPS 下）","-   - **Tensor Core 利用率 < 2%**，99%+ 时间在等待 HBM 数据传输","+### 硬件瓶颈分析：MoE Expert 路由开销与 GPU Memory Hierarchy 交互"," ","-2. **Memory hierarchy 数据流路径**（笔记证据: `GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`）：","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE...` (score: 12326.9, Fig.2 算子分类); `paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Serving in the Memory-Bound Regime...` (score: 13739.2)","+"," ```","-HBM (40-80GB, BW 1.5-2.0 TB/s, lat ~400-800 cycles)","-  │  存储: 所有 E 个 expert 的完整 FFN 权重","-  │  瓶颈: 400GB+ 总参数量远超单 GPU HBM → 需 expert offloading","-  ▼","-L2 Cache (40MB, BW ~7 TB/s)","-  │  缓存: 频繁激活的 \"hot expert\" weight tiles","-  │  瓶颈: 40MB << 单 expert 权重 (~200MB) → 仅能缓存部分 tile","-  ▼","-SM Shared Memory (164KB/SM, BW ~19 TB/s)","-  │  存储: token activation + 当前计算的 weight tile","-  │  瓶颈: 极小容量限制 tile 大小选择","-  ▼","-Register File (256KB/SM) → Tensor Core → Register","-```","+=== MoE 推理硬件瓶颈分解 ==="," ","-3. **Expert offloading 的 PCIe 瓶颈**（笔记证据：MoE-ERAS paper_secs, score: 8571.0）：","-   - Expert 从 CPU DRAM 读取：~25GB/s (PCIe 4.0 x16) vs 从 GPU HBM 读取：~2000GB/s","-   - **CPU→GPU expert 迁移延迟是 GPU HBM→TC 的 80×**","-   - MoE-ERAS 提出 Expert Residency Aware Selection：优先选择已在 HBM 中的 \"good enough\" expert，避免触发 PCIe 迁移","-   - **笔记显示 Gating 公式**：","-     $$Logits = H_i * W_{exp}$$","-     $$Weights = Softmax(Logits)$$","-     $$Experts_{Activated} = SelectTopK(Weights)$$","-   - MoE-ERAS 通过 Thresholding（给 on-chip expert 加 α 偏置）和 Biasing（对 off-chip expert 减 β(1-freq) 惩罚）修改 routing，使 expert 选择偏向 HBM 中已有的 expert","+GPU Memory Hierarchy:","+  HBM (80GB, 3.35TB/s on H100) → L2 Cache (50MB, ~12TB/s) → SM L1/SMEM (256KB/SM) → Register"," ","-4. **Router (Gating) 的计算开销**：","-   - gate_logits = X @ W_gate：GEMM [N_e, d_model, E]，对 Mixtral-8x7B 为 [1, 4096, 8]，FLOPs 极小","-   - SoftMax + TopK 在 CUDA Cores 上执行（不可用 Tensor Core），但 latency 远小于 expert weight 加载","-   - **Router 本身不是瓶颈**，但其 routing decision 决定了哪些 expert weights 需从 HBM 加载 —— 间接成为延迟的决定因素","+瓶颈点 1: Token Dispatch 是 Memory-Bound 操作","+  - Router 输出 topk_indices [T, K] 后，需将 T 个 token 重排为 E 组","+  - 这涉及: sparse gather (从 HBM 读取 token hidden states)","+            + scatter (写入各 expert 的输入 buffer)","+  - 当 T 大(长序列 prefill)时，dispatch 完全受 HBM bandwidth 限制","+  - EPS-MoE 论文指出: 浅蓝框操作为 memory-bound (Fig.2)","+  - 笔记显示: All-to-All dispatch+combine 平均占 step time 34.1% (Lina 分析)","+  - GPU SM efficiency 在 All-to-All 期间仅 3.7%"," ","-5. **Roofline 模型视角**（笔记证据: `Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md`, score: 4723.6）：","-   - H100 ridge point: 989 TFLOPS / 3.35 TB/s ≈ 295 FLOPs/Byte","-   - MoE decode GEMM CI (batch=1): ≈ N / 2 ≈ 1 FLOPs/Byte (N=1)","-   - **低于 ridge point 两个数量级** → 深度 memory-bound","-   - 笔记指出：\"decode 的 batch size 小导致实际 FLOPs 受限于 weight loading\"","+瓶颈点 2: Expert FFN 的 GroupGemm 效率低","+  - 每个 expert 收到的 token 数 T_e 不均衡，导致:","+    * T_e 小 → GroupGemm kernel 的 tile 利用率低(不足填满 Tensor Core)","+    * T_e 大 → 该 expert 的 FFN 成为延迟瓶颈","+  - EPS-MoE 通过动态切换 GroupGemm → DenseGemm 改善:","+    当某 expert 的 T_e 足够大时，使用 cuBLAS DenseGemm 获得更高 Tensor Core 利用率","+  - H100 Tensor Core FP8 峰值: 1979 TFLOPS, 但小 batch expert FFN 实际利用率常 <30%"," ","+瓶颈点 3: Expert 参数驻留问题","+  - 单 GPU 场景: N 个 expert 的全部权重需驻留在 HBM","+  - Mixtral-8x7B: total 46B params, 96% 在 expert FFN → ~44B expert 参数","+  - H100 80GB 勉强容纳，但留给 KV-cache 和中间激活的空间很小","+  - 当 K 大(top-k routing), 更多 expert 需同时活跃 → HBM bandwidth 争抢加剧","+```","+"," ---"," ","-## 二、DiT（Diffusion Transformer）的单请求推理计算流程","+## 二、DiT (Diffusion Transformer) 模型单请求推理计算流程"," ","-### 2.1 方法细节：DiT 去噪推理伪代码","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow A Data-Characteristic-Aware Serving System for Diffusion Models/4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 2240.7); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md` (score: 262.0)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 5360.2)","+### 方法2: DiT Denoising Loop 推理流程"," ","-**笔记显示**：\"DiT 已取代 UNet 成为主流高质量图像生成模型的 backbone，代表性模型包括 Stable Diffusion 3 (SD3) 和 FLUX.1-dev (12B 参数)。与 LLM 不同，DiT 模型参数通常较小（最大开源 DiT 仅 12B），能够 fit 在单张 80GB H100 GPU 上。\"","+**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**："," "," ```","-=== DiT 单请求推理 Forward Pass（以 FLUX.1-dev 50步为例）===","+=== DiT 单请求推理：迭代去噪流程 ===","+输入: noise z_T ∈ R^{H×W×C} (随机高斯噪声, 如 32×32×4 latent)","+      condition c (text prompt embedding, 如 CLIP text encoder 输出)","+      timesteps t = T, T-1, ..., 1  (T=50 for SDXL-Turbo, T=1000 for standard)"," ","-输入: text_prompt (文本条件), latent_resolution (256/512/1024/2048)","+参数: DiT blocks × L 层, 每层含 Adaptive LayerNorm (adaLN) + Multi-Head Self-Attn + MLP"," ","-# === Step 0: 预处理 ===","-1: text_emb ← TextEncoder(text_prompt)                # T5/CLIP 编码文本 [N_text, d]","-2: latent ← randn([1, C, H/p, W/p])                   # 初始纯噪声","-                                                       # 256→[1,C,16,16]=256 tokens","-                                                       # 512→[1,C,32,32]=1024 tokens","-                                                       # 1024→[1,C,64,64]=4096 tokens","-                                                       # 2048→[1,C,128,128]=16384 tokens","-3: t_emb ← TimestepEmbedding(t=T)                      # 时间步编码 [1, d]","+# ═══ 外部去噪循环 ═══","+z = z_T  # [H, W, C]","+for step s = T down to 1:","+    t_emb = TimestepEmbedding(s)                   # Sinusoidal + MLP → [d_model]","+    c_emb = ConditionEmbedding(c)                   # [d_model]","+    conditioning = t_emb + c_emb                    # [d_model], 合并条件"," ","-# === Step 1-50: 迭代去噪循环 ===","-4: for t = T, T-1, ..., 1 do                           # T=50 (典型值)","-5:     # ---- DiT Block (每个 step 独立, 无 KV cache) ----","-6:     for block b = 1 to B do                          # B 个 Transformer blocks","-7:         # AdaLN (Adaptive Layer Norm):","-8:         shift, scale, gate ← MLP(t_emb)              # 时间步条件注入","-9:                                                       # [1,d] → [1,3d]","-10:        h ← LayerNorm(latent) * (1+scale) + shift     # 自适应归一化","-11:","-12:        # Multi-Head Self-Attention (全量 latent tokens):","-13:        Q, K, V ← h @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]               # [N_tok, d] @ [d, 3d] → [N_tok, 3d]","-14:                                                       # N_tok: 256~16384 (由分辨率决定)","-15:        A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d_head) @ V           # [N_tok, N_tok] @ [N_tok, d]","-16:                                                       # → [N_tok, d]","-17:                                                       # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O(N_tok²·d)","-18:                                                       # 2048×2048: N_tok=16384 → 268M entries","-19:        h ← h + gate[:d] * A                         # residual + gating","-20:","-21:        # FFN (MLP):","-22:        h ← h + gate[d:2d] * MLP(h)                   # [N_tok, d] → [N_tok, 4d] → [N_tok, d]","-23:                                                       # 算子: 2 × GEMM [M=N_tok, K=d, N=4d]","-24:    end for","-25:","-26:    # ---- Denoising Update (SDE/ODE solver) ----","-27:    noise_pred ← DiT_output(latent, t_emb, text_emb)  # 预测噪声/velocity","-28:    latent ← solver_step(latent, noise_pred, t)        # DDIM/Euler/Flow ODE 更新","-29:                                                       # 算子: element-wise, O(N_tok·d)","-30: end for","-31:","-32: # === Step 51: VAE Decode ===","-33: image ← VAE.decode(latent)                           # latent → pixel space","-```","+    # ═══ DiT Forward (单步去噪预测) ═══","+    # 将 latent 展平为 patch tokens","+    z_patches = Patchify(z)                         # [N_patches, d_model]","+                                                    # N_patches = (H/p) × (W/p)","+                                                    # 例: 32×32 / 2 = 256 patches"," ","-**注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `T`=去噪步数(50), `B`=DiT block 数(24-48), `N_tok`=latent token 数, `d`=hidden dim","-- **关键特征（笔记揭示）**: (a) **Stateless**: 无 KV cache，每 step 独立计算，不存在自回归依赖；(b) **Compute-bound**: 多步去噪在全量 latent tokens 上执行，计算量由分辨率决定（2048×2048 ≈ 25 TFLOPs/step on FLUX）；(c) **Step 数固定**: 每步耗时高度可预测（CV < 0.7%）；(d) **异构输入**: DiT serving workload 由少量离散分辨率组成（256/512/1024/2048），但不同分辨率计算量差异巨大（256→556 TFLOPs vs 2048→24965 TFLOPs）","-- **数据依赖**: 严格时序依赖——step t 的输出是 step t-1 的输入，denoising step 间不可并行","-- **并发可行性**: (a) DiT block 内部的 multi-head attention 可并行切分所有 head；(b) 单个 step 内不同 token 的 FFN 可并行；(c) step 间不可并行（严格时序依赖）","+    # === DiT Block × L (所有 tokens 通过相同 Transformer) ===","+    h = z_patches  # [N_patches, d_model]","+    for l = 1..L:                                    # L=28 for DiT-XL/2","+        # adaLN: 根据 conditioning 动态调整 scale/shift","+        scale_1, shift_1, gate_1 = AdaLN_MLP(conditioning)","+        scale_2, shift_2, gate_2 = AdaLN_MLP(conditioning)","+        # 每个 [d_model], 由 conditioning 线性投影得到"," ","-### 2.2 DiT 硬件瓶颈分析","+        # Multi-Head Self-Attention (dense, 全 patch)","+        h_norm = LayerNorm(h) * (1 + scale_1) + shift_1   # [N, d_model]","+        Q, K, V = h_norm @ W_Q, h_norm @ W_K, h_norm @ W_V  # [N, d_head]","+        attn = Softmax(Q @ K^T / sqrt(d_head)) @ V         # [N, d_model]","+        h = h + gate_1 * attn                               # residual"," ","-**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 5360.2)、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md` (score: 4723.6)","+        # MLP (Pointwise FFN)","+        h_norm = LayerNorm(h) * (1 + scale_2) + shift_2   # [N, d_model]","+        mlp = GELU(h_norm @ W_1) @ W_2                    # [N, d_model]","+        h = h + gate_2 * mlp                                # residual","+        # 每层 FLOPs: 4·N·d_model² + 2·N·d_model·d_ff"," ","-#### 瓶颈1: 迭代去噪对计算单元利用率的影响","+    # === 输出: 噪声预测 ===","+    epsilon_pred = Unpatchify(h)                     # [H, W, C]"," ","-1. **Attention 的二次复杂度与 Compute-bound 转变**：","-   - 低分辨率 (256×256, N_tok=256): attention FLOPs = O(N_tok²·d) ≈ 2·256²·4096 ≈ 0.5 GFLOPs → **memory-bound**（权重加载主导）","-   - 高分辨率 (2048×2048, N_tok=16384): attention FLOPs ≈ 2·16384²·4096 ≈ 2.2 TFLOPs → **compute-bound**（计算主导）","-   - Ridge point (A100): 312 TFLOPS / 2.0 TB/s ≈ 156 FLOPs/Byte","-   - 高分辨率 DiT attention CI ≈ N_tok·d / (bytes_per_token) → 可远高于 ridge point","+    # === DDIM/SDE 去噪步进 ===","+    z = DenoisingStep(z, epsilon_pred, s)            # 更新 latent","+    # 例(DDIM): z_{s-1} = sqrt(α_{s-1})·(z_s - sqrt(1-α_s)·ε_pred)/sqrt(α_s)","+    #                + sqrt(1-α_{s-1})·ε_pred"," ","-2. **50-step 迭代的累积硬件低效**：","-   - 每个 step 需要：(a) 加载全部 DiT 模型权重 (~12B params × 2B = 24GB for FLUX.1-dev)；(b) 执行全量 latent tokens 的 self-attention","-   - 50 steps × 24GB weight loading = **1.2TB 总 weight 流量**（即使权重在 HBM 中也需反复读取）","-   - 每个 step 的 weight loading 时间 ≈ 24GB / 2.0TB/s ≈ 12ms → 50 steps × 12ms = **600ms 纯 weight 加载时间**","-   - Tensor Core 在 weight loading 期间空闲，导致 **整体的低计算利用率**","+# ═══ 最终: VAE Decoder → Image ═══","+image = VAE_Decoder(z)                               # [H*8, W*8, 3]","+```"," ","-3. **Memory hierarchy 视角**：","+**注解**：","+","+1. **变量含义**：z 为 latent representation(压缩空间噪声)，conditioning 合并时间步嵌入和文本条件，N_patches 由 latent 分辨率决定(如 DiT-XL/2 为 256 patches)。adaLN 为 DiT 特有的自适应归一化机制，用 conditioning 调制每层的 scale/shift/gate。","+2. **串行瓶颈——Denoising Loop**：最外层 denoising loop 有 T 次迭代(50-1000+)，每次迭代依赖上一步的 latent z → 纯串行，无法流水线并行。这是 DiT 推理延迟的主要来源。","+3. **每步内的并行机会**：Self-Attention 中多个 head 可并行计算；MLP 的 W_1 和 W_2 是标准 dense matmul → Tensor Core 友好；不同 batch 的 patch token 可共享 conditioning(计算一次)。","+4. **Difflow 论文关键优化**：通过 denoising loop 展开前几轮后识别 loop-invariant tensors(如固定的 conditioning embedding)，将其提升到循环外；检测多请求间共享的 prompt embedding 并消除冗余计算。","+","+### 硬件瓶颈分析：DiT 迭代去噪对计算单元利用率的影响","+"," ```","-单个 DiT Step 的 HBM→TC 数据流:","-HBM: 存储全部 DiT weights (12B params), [N_tok, d] latent","-  │ 每次 step: 加载全部 weights ~24GB","-  │ 瓶颈: 反复加载相同 weights → 浪费 HBM 带宽","-  ▼","-L2 Cache (40MB): 缓存部分 DiT block weights","-  │ 若 block weights > 40MB → cache thrashing","-  ▼","-SMEM: 存储 Q,K,V tiles for FlashAttention","-  │","-  ▼","-Tensor Core: MMA for QK^T, PV, FFN GEMMs","-  │ 高分辨率下 utilization efficiency 较高","-  │ 低分辨率下 UE 因 batch=256 tokens (如 256×256) 而较低","-```","+=== DiT 推理硬件瓶颈 ==="," ","-4. **Sequence Parallelism (SP) 对硬件利用率的改善**（笔记揭示）：","-   - SP 沿 token 序列维度切分 latent 到多 GPU，通过 Ulysses attention 实现","-   - Attention 前通过 all-to-all collective 转换 layout，attention 后再通过 all-to-all 转回","-   - 大分辨率 (2048×2048): SP scaling efficiency 较好（通信占比 < 15%）","-   - 小分辨率 (256×256): SP=8 时通信占比 > 30%，效率极低","-   - **硬件含义**: 高分辨率受益于多 GPU 并行，低分辨率应单 GPU 推理","+瓶颈点 1: Denoising Loop 串行导致 Pipeline Bubble","+  - T=50 步 × 每步 ~10ms(在 H100 上 DiT-XL) → 总延迟 ~500ms","+  - 各步之间严格依赖: Step(t) 的 z_{t-1} 是 Step(t-1) 的输出","+  - → 无法利用多 SM 并行加速单步(步内可并行但步间不可)","+  - → GPU SM 利用率呈 \"脉冲式\": 每步计算时利用率高, 步间 kernel launch/idle"," ","+瓶颈点 2: Patch Token 数量决定 Attention 复杂度","+  - N=256 patches → Attention FLOPs: 4·N²·d_model ≈ 4·256²·1152 ≈ 302M","+  - N=1024 patches(高分辨率) → Attention FLOPs: 4·1024²·1152 ≈ 4.8B (暴涨 16x)","+  - Attention 是 O(N²) → 高分辨率/长视频时迅速成为 compute-bound 瓶颈","+  - H100 Tensor Core 在 Attention Softmax 阶段利用率低(Softmax 是 element-wise)","+","+瓶颈点 3: 小 Batch 单请求场景 Tensor Core 利用率低","+  - 单请求推理 batch_size=1 → N_patches=256 tokens","+  - GPU MatMul 在 M=256 时远未填满 Tensor Core(A100 Tensor Core 最优 M ≥ 512-1024)","+  - EPS-MoE 指出: 小 batch GEMM 的 Tensor Core 利用率 < 20%","+  - NVLink/NVSwitch 带宽在单 GPU 场景不发挥作用(无跨 GPU 通信需求)","+","+瓶颈点 4: VAE Decoder 是 \"一次性大计算\"","+  - 去噪完成后, VAE Decoder 单次将 latent 解码为像素","+  - 包含多个反卷积层 + upsampling → 计算量大但仅执行一次","+  - 在单请求场景, VAE Decoder 启动开销(kernel launch latency)显著","+```","+"," ---"," ","-## 三、多模态模型（Vision-Language）的单请求推理计算流程","+## 三、多模态模型单请求推理计算流程"," ","-### 3.1 方法细节：多模态编码-融合-解码伪代码","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Any-to-Any Multimodal Models.md` (score: 44.5); `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/vLLM-Omni...` (score: 886.0); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Three-Stage Cross-Modal Interaction in MLLMs.md` (score: 621.6); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Cross-Attention based MLLM Architecture.md` (score: 425.9)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_video_image/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 14146.0)、`paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/A Survey...Sparse-Attention.md` (score: 2340.1)","+### 方法3: Concatenation-based MLLM 推理流程 (以 LLaVA-1.5 为例)"," ","-多模态模型（以 LLaVA 架构族为代表）将视觉编码器、文本编码器和 LLM backbone 集成为统一的推理 pipeline。**笔记显示**：\"LLaVA-NEXT 和 Dimple 等模型采用 vision encoder → projector → language model 的标准三阶段流程。\"","+**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度 + 三阶段跨模态交互）**："," "," ```","-=== 多模态 LLaVA-style 单请求推理 Forward Pass ===","+=== 多模态 MLLM 单请求推理流程 ===","+输入: Image I ∈ R^{H×W×3}, Text prompt P (如 \"What is in this image?\")","+输出: Text answer A"," ","-输入: image [3, H_img, W_img], text_prompt (str)","+# ═══ Phase 1: 模态编码 (异构计算单元映射) ═══","+# --- Vision Encoding (在 GPU Tensor Core 上执行) ---","+with torch.no_grad():","+    # Vision Encoder (ViT-L/14, 冻结)","+    patches = PatchEmbed(I)                          # [N_v, d_vis], N_v=576, d_vis=1024","+    for vit_layer in ViT.blocks:                     # 24 ViT layers","+        patches = vit_layer(patches)                 # Self-Attention + MLP","+    V = patches[:, 1:]                               # [576, 1024], 去掉 CLS token","+    # 笔记: 视觉编码器输出 576 tokens × 1024 dims"," ","-# === Phase 1: 并行模态编码 ===","-1: # ---- Vision Encoding ----","-2: V_patches ← PatchEmbed(image)                    # [3, H, W] → [N_v, d_v]","-                                                       # N_v = (H/p)·(W/p), p=14 (CLIP ViT-L)","-                                                       # 336×336 → N_v = 576 patches","-3: for ViT_layer l = 1 to L_v do","-4:     V_patches ← ViT_Block(V_patches)              # Self-Attention over visual tokens","-5:        # Q@K^T: [N_v, d_v] @ [d_v, N_v] → [N_v, N_v]","-6:        # FLOPs = O(N_v²·d_v)","-7:        # 瓶颈: 高分辨率图像 N_v 可达 4096+ (如 InternVL 动态分辨率)","-8: end for","-9: V_features ← V_patches                            # [N_v, d_v]","-10: V_proj ← V_features @ W_proj                      # Vision→LLM Projector","-                                                       # [N_v, d_v] @ [d_v, d_llm] → [N_v, d_llm]","-                                                       # 算子: GEMM [M=N_v, K=d_v, N=d_llm]","-                                                       # 典型值: [576, 1024] @ [1024, 4096] → [576, 4096]","-11:                                                    # 瓶颈: 若 N_v 大, GEMM compute-intensive","+# --- Text Tokenization (在 CPU 上执行) ---","+T_ids = Tokenizer(P)                                 # [T_text], 如 20 tokens","+T_emb = Embedding(T_ids)                             # [T_text, d_llm], d_llm=4096"," ","-12: # ---- Text Encoding (并行执行, 无数据依赖) ----","-13: T_tokens ← Tokenizer(text_prompt)                 # [1, N_text]","-14: T_emb ← TextEmbed(T_tokens)                        # [1, N_text, d_llm]","+# ═══ Phase 2: 模态对齐 (Projector) ═══","+# --- 视觉特征 → LLM Embedding 空间 ---","+V_proj = Projector(V)                                # [576, 4096]","+# Projector: Linear(GELU(Linear(V))) 或 更复杂的 Q-Former/Mamba-2 scan","+#    参数: ~2·d_vis·d_llm ≈ 2·1024·4096 ≈ 8.4M (极小)","+#    笔记: knowledge_notes/.../Multimodal Connector _ Projector in MLLM.md"," ","-# === Phase 2: 跨模态融合 ===","-15: # ---- 拼接多模态序列 ----","-16: H ← Concat([V_proj, T_emb])                       # [1, N_v + N_text, d_llm]","-17: # 典型: [1, 576 + 128, 4096] = [1, 704, 4096]","+# ═══ Phase 3: LLM Backbone (跨模态融合) ═══","+# --- Token 拼接 ---","+H = Concat([V_proj, T_emb])                          # [576+20, 4096] = [596, 4096]"," ","-18: # ---- LLM Backbone (逐层处理) ----","-19: for LLM_layer l = 1 to L_llm do","-20:     # Self-Attention over fused multimodal tokens:","-21:     Q, K, V ← H @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]                # [1, N_v+N_text, d] @ [d, 3d]","-22:     A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d) @ V                 # [1, N_all, d]","-23:        # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O((N_v+N_text)²·d)","-24:        # 视觉 token 和文本 token 在 attention 中完全交互","-25:        # attention matrix 含 4 个 sub-block:","-26:        #   [Vision→Vision  |  Vision→Text]","-27:        #   [Text→Vision    |  Text→Text  ]","-28:        # Vision→Vision: O(N_v²·d) → 主导计算, compute-bound (高 N_v 时)","-29:        # Text→Text: O(N_text²·d) → 通常较小","-30:        # Vision→Text/Text→Vision: O(N_v·N_text·d) → cross-modal fusion","-31:","-32:     # FFN (标准 Transformer FFN):","-33:     H ← H + FFN(A)                                # [1, N_all, d] → [1, N_all, 4d] → [1, N_all, d]","-34:        # 算子: 2 × GEMM [M=N_all, K=d, N=4d]","-35:        # 瓶颈: 当 N_v 大时, N_all 大 → GEMM compute-intensive","-36: end for","+# --- 逐层 Transformer (三阶段跨模态交互) ---","+for l = 1..L:                                        # L=32 for LLaVA-v1.5","+    H_norm = RMSNorm(H)                              # [596, 4096]","+    Q, K, V = H_norm @ W_Q, H_norm @ W_K, H_norm @ W_V"," ","-# === Phase 3: 自回归文本生成 ===","-37: text_hidden ← H[:, N_v:, :]                        # [1, N_text, d_llm]","-38: for step s = 1 to max_new_tokens do","-39:     # 标准 LLM decode, KV_cache 包含视觉 token 的 K,V","-40:     new_token ← LLM_Decode(text_hidden, KV_cache)  # 依赖全部 N_v+N_text 的 KV","-41:        # 瓶颈: decode 每步需从 HBM 读取视觉 token 的 KV → memory-bound","-42:        # N_v 越大, KV_cache 中视觉部分越大, decode 越慢","-43: end for","-44:","-45: output_text ← Detokenize(tokens)","-```","+    # Attention 矩阵包含 4 个区域:","+    # [V→V][V→T]  视觉 self-attn + 视觉→文本 cross-attn","+    # [T→V][T→T]  文本→视觉 cross-attn + 文本 self-attn","+    attn_scores = Q @ K^T / sqrt(d_head)             # [596, 596]","+    # → O((N_v+T_text)²) = O(596²) ≈ 355K 次乘法 (per head per layer)"," ","-**注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `N_v`=视觉 token 数, `N_text`=文本 token 数, `d_v`=vision encoder hidden dim, `d_llm`=LLM hidden dim","-- **复杂度分析**: Vision encoding: O(N_v²·d_v) per ViT layer；LLM prefill: O((N_v+N_text)²·d_llm) per layer；Decode: O((N_v+N_text)·d_llm) per token（读取 KV_cache 主导）","-- **数据依赖**: Vision encoder 和 Text embedding 无数据依赖 → **可完全并行**；LLM prefill 必须在两模态编码完成后执行；Cross-attention 在 self-attention 的 Q@K^T 中隐式完成","-- **并发可行性**: (a) Phase 1 的 Vision/Text encoding 可并行；(b) LLM 内部 multi-head 可并行；(c) prefill 后视觉 token 的 K,V 写入 KV_cache 后，decode 阶段每步必须读取","+    # --- 三阶段行为差异 (VisiPruner 笔记) ---","+    if l <= 8:   # Stage 1: Shallow — Task Recognition","+        # 跨模态 attention 几乎无效; 视觉 token 仅作为 attention sink","+        # 文本 token 编码的是 task type (如 \"number\"→counting), 非视觉内容","+        pass","+    elif l <= 23: # Stage 2: Middle — Sparse Cross-Modal Grounding","+        # 跨模态融合突然发生 (abrupt onset)","+        # 仅 ~10/576 视觉 token 驱动跨模态信息传递","+        # → 大部分视觉 token 的 cross-attention 计算是冗余的!","+        pass","+    else:         # Stage 3: Deep — Linguistic Alignment","+        # 视觉信息已集成到文本表示, 视觉 token 不再需要","+        # → 可安全裁剪 (Vision Exit)","+        pass"," ","-### 3.2 多模态硬件瓶颈分析","+    attn_out = Softmax(attn_scores) @ V              # [596, 4096]","+    H = H + attn_out                                  # residual","+    H = H + FFN(RMSNorm(H))                          # gate_proj+up_proj+down_proj"," ","-#### 瓶颈1: 跨模态融合在异构计算单元上的映射","+# ═══ Phase 4: 自回归解码 ═══","+generated_ids = []","+for step in range(max_new_tokens):","+    logits = H[-1] @ W_lm_head                       # [vocab_size], 仅取最后位置","+    next_token = Argmax(logits / temperature)         # 或采样","+    generated_ids.append(next_token)","+    if next_token == EOS: break","+    # 新 token 追加到序列, KV-cache 复用 → 每步仅计算单个新 token","+    # decode 阶段 FLOPs/token ≈ 2·L·d_model² + 3·L·d_model·d_ff","+    # = 2·32·4096² + 3·32·4096·14336 ≈ 1.07G + 5.64G ≈ 6.7G FLOPs"," ","-1. **Vision Encoder 的计算特征**：","-   - ViT 的 self-attention [N_v, N_v]: 对 336×336 图像 O(576²·d) ≈ O(331K·d) → memory-bound（N_v 中等）","-   - 对高分辨率 (1344×768): N_v 可达 5000+ → O(25M·d) → **compute-bound**","-   - 硬件映射: ViT 层适合 GPU Tensor Core（GEMM 密集型），但也受益于 NPU 的视觉专用加速器","+answer = Detokenizer(generated_ids)","+```"," ","-2. **LLM Backbone 中视觉 token 的内存膨胀效应**：","-   - N_v=576 时，视觉 token 使 attention 矩阵从 [N_text, N_text] 膨胀到 [N_text+576, N_text+576]","-   - 若 N_text=128: 无视觉 attention entries = 128² = 16K；有视觉: 704² = 495K → **30× 膨胀**","-   - 硬件含义: attention Q@K^T 的 SRAM 需求按 O(N_all²) 增长","+**注解**："," ","-3. **Decode 阶段视觉 KV_cache 的 memory pressure**：","-   - 视觉 token 的 K,V 必须常驻 KV_cache 以供每步 decode 的 attention 访问","-   - N_v=576, d=4096, fp16 → KV_cache_visual = 576 × 4096 × 2 × 2B = **9.2MB per layer**","-   - L=32 layers → 总计 ~295MB 仅用于视觉 KV_cache","-   - 每 decode step 需从 HBM 读取视觉 KV → memory-bound 瓶颈加剧本已 memory-bound 的 decode","+1. **计算图依赖**：Phase 1 Vision Encoding → Phase 2 Projector → Phase 3 LLM → Phase 4 Decode。Vision 和 Text encoding 可并行（在不同计算单元）。","+2. **跨模态融合的三阶段规律**(VisiPruner 笔记 EMNLP 2025)：浅层无实质融合 → 中层稀疏关键 token 驱动 → 深层纯语言 refinement。这意味着约 50% 的 visual token 计算是冗余的。","+3. **异构计算单元映射**：","+   - Vision Encoder (ViT) → Tensor Core + CNN 风格的 patch embedding → GPU SM","+   - Text Tokenization → CPU (GPT/BPE tokenizer)","+   - LLM Backbone → GPU Tensor Core (GEMM) + SM (Softmax/RMSNorm)","+   - Projector → GPU Tensor Core (小矩阵, 利用率低)"," ","-4. **异构计算单元映射策略**：","+### 硬件瓶颈分析：多模态跨模态融合在异构计算单元上的映射","+"," ```","-多模态推理的理想异构映射（含 GPU+NPU 场景）:","+=== 多模态推理硬件瓶颈 ==="," ","-[Vision Encoder (ViT)]  →  NPU Vision Core / GPU Tensor Core","-       │                        (CNN-like patch processing 适合 NPU 加速)","-       │ V_proj","-       ▼","-[Projector GEMM]        →  GPU Tensor Core (FP16 MMA)","-       │","-       ▼","-[LLM Backbone Prefill]  →  GPU Tensor Core (QK^T, PV, FFN GEMMs)","-       │                        (大量 GEMM 适合 Tensor Core)","-       ▼","-[LLM Backbone Decode]   →  GPU (memory-bound, Tensor Core 空闲)","-       │                        (需读取视觉+文本 KV_cache → HBM BW 瓶颈)","+瓶颈点 1: Visual Token 数量导致的 Attention 复杂度爆炸","+  - N_v=576(CLIP ViT-L) → LLM 输入长度 = 576+text_len","+  - Self-Attention O((N_v+T_text)²):","+    单层 32 heads × 596² × 128(d_head) ≈ 1.45G FLOPs per layer","+    32 层 → ~46G FLOPs 仅 Attention","+  - Attention 矩阵中 V→V 区域 576² ≈ 332K entries, 但仅 ~10 个视觉 token 真正重要","+  - → 跨模态注意力中 >95% 的计算是冗余的!","+","+瓶颈点 2: Projector 成为数据搬运瓶颈","+  - V_proj = Projector(V) 的计算量小（~8.4M params）但 V 从 Vision Encoder 输出","+    需经 HBM → L2 → SM 传输 (576×1024×2bytes ≈ 1.2MB FP16)","+  - 若 Vision Encoder 和 LLM 在不同 GPU/加速器上 → PCIe/NVLink 跨设备传输","+  - 单 GPU 场景: V 从 HBM 读取→Projector 计算→写回 HBM→LLM 读取 → 3 次 HBM 往返","+","+瓶颈点 3: Cross-Attention MLLM vs Concatenation MLLM 的硬件偏好差异","+  - Concatenation-based (LLaVA): visual tokens 在 context window 中","+    → HBM 需保存完整的 [V+T] KV-cache → 576 visual KV entries × 32 layers","+    → ~576×32×4096×2×2bytes ≈ 302MB 仅视觉 KV-cache (FP16)","+  - Cross-Attention-based (Flamingo/mPLUG-Owl3): visual tokens 不进入 context","+    → KV-cache 仅需保存 text tokens → 大幅节省 HBM","+    → 但需要额外的 cross-attn K/V 投影 → 增加计算量","+  - 笔记未明确说明哪种在单 GPU H100 上更优 — 取决于 visual token 数量"," ```"," "," ---"," ","-## 四、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程","+## 四、Video 模型单请求推理计算流程"," ","-### 4.1 方法细节：Video DiT 时空推理伪代码","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/50-S-DMA- Sparse Diffusion Models Acceleration via Spatiality-Aware Prediction and Dimension-Adaptive Dataflow/5.4-Ablation-Study.md` (score: 1645.0); `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/MoBA__Mixture_of_Block_Attention_for_Long-Context_LLMs/4-Related-Work.md` (score: 1735.2); `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MMDiT (Multi-Modal Diffusion Transformer).md` (score: 262.0)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_video_image/EasyAnimate.../3-Architecture.md` (score: 3363.2)、`repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md`","+### 方法4: Video DiT (基于 MMDiT 的视频生成推理)"," ","-**笔记显示**：EasyAnimate \"comprises a text encoder, a diffusion transformer and a video VAE\"，并使用创新的 Hybrid Windows Attention（multidirectional sliding window attention）来降低 3D Full Attention 的 O(N²) 计算代价。","+**方法细节（L1 伪代码粒度）**："," "," ```","-=== Video DiT 单请求推理 Forward Pass（EasyAnimate-style）===","+=== Video DiT 单请求推理流程 (以 HunyuanVideo/EasyAnimate 为例) ===","+输入: noise z_T ∈ R^{F×H×W×C}  (F 帧, 如 14 帧 latent)","+      text condition c","+输出: video frames"," ","-输入: text_prompt, F_frames, resolution H×W","-      (典型: 1024×1024×49frames)","+F = 14  # latent 帧数","+H, W = latent 空间分辨率 (如 40×64 for 720p)","+C = 16  # VAE latent channels","+N_tokens = F × H × W  # = 14×40×64 = 35840 tokens! (vs DiT image 的 256 tokens)","+                       # → 140x 更多 tokens!"," ","-# === Step 0: 预处理 ===","-1: text_emb ← MLLM_Encoder(text_prompt)               # Qwen2-VL-7B 作为 text encoder","-                                                       # 提取 penultimate hidden layer","-2: text_emb ← RMSNorm(text_emb)                        # 归一化以匹配 video latent 的 L2 norm","-3: text_emb ← text_emb @ W_proj                        # [N_text, d_text] → [N_text, d_dit]","-4: latent ← randn([1, C, F, H/p, W/p])                # 3D latent: [1, C, 49, 64, 64]","-                                                       # N_tok = 49 × 4096 = 200,704 tokens","-5: t_emb ← TimestepEmbedding(t=T)","+z = z_T  # [F, H, W, C]"," ","-# === Step 1-50: 迭代时空去噪 ===","-6: for t = T, T-1, ..., 1 do                           # 50 denoising steps","-7:     for block b = 1 to B do","-8:         # ---- 3D AdaLN (同 DiT) ----","-9:         shift, scale, gate ← MLP(t_emb)","-10:        h ← LayerNorm(latent) * (1+scale) + shift","-11:","-12:        # ---- Hybrid Window Attention (EasyAnimate 核心, 6方向) ----","-13:        Q, K, V ← h @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]              # [N_tok, 3d]","-14:        Split Q,K,V into 6 head groups              # 每组处理不同维度排列","-15:        directions = [fhw, fwh, hfw, hwf, wfh, whf] # f=frame, h=height, w=width","-16:        for dir in directions:","-17:            Q',K',V' ← Rearrange(Q,K,V to dir)      # 重排维度, 使 window 沿连续维度","-18:            A_dir ← WindowFlashAttention(Q',K',V', window_size)","-19:               # 瓶颈: window attention O(N_tok·W²·d) 而非 O(N_tok²·d)","-20:               # window_size = H*W (spatial window), W² << N_tok","-21:        end for","-22:        A_combined ← Concat([A_fhw, A_fwh, ...])    # 融合 6 方向 attention 输出","-23:","-24:        # 每隔几层插入一次 3D Full Attention:","-25:        if b in full_attention_layers:               # 笔记显示: middle layers 最优","-26:            A_full ← 3DFullAttention(h)              # Q@K^T: [N_tok, N_tok] → 200704²","-27:               # 瓶颈: 3D Full Attention = O(N_tok²·d) ≈ O(40B·d) → 严重 compute-intensive","-28:               # 笔记显示: 仅在 middle layers (12-36/48) 使用, 平衡质量与速度","-29:        end if","-30:","-31:        h ← h + gate * A                            # residual","-32:","-33:        # ---- MMDiT FFN (双模态分别处理) ----","-34:        # 文本 token 和视频 token 使用分离的 FFN 参数:","-35:        h_video ← FFN_video(h[:N_tok])                # 视频 token FFN","-36:        h_text  ← FFN_text(h[N_tok:])                 # 文本 token FFN","-37:        h ← Concat([h_video, h_text])","-38:    end for","-39:    latent ← solver_step(latent, noise_pred, t)","-40: end for","-41:","-42: # === Step 51: 3D Causal VAE Decode ===","-43: # 笔记显示: 空间+时间切片降低峰值显存","-44: frames ← 3D_Causal_VAE.decode(latent)              # 逐帧因果解码","-45:    # 瓶颈: temporal decompression 需读取前帧 latent → memory-intensive","-```","+for step s = T down to 1:","+    # === Step 1: 3D Patchify ===","+    z_patches = Patchify3D(z, patch_size=(2,2,2))","+    # z_patches: [F/2 × H/2 × W/2, C·8]","+    # → [7 × 20 × 32, 128] = [4480, 128]"," ","-**注解**:","-- **变量含义**: `F`=帧数(49), `H/p × W/p`=每帧 spatial tokens(64²=4096), `N_tok`=总 token 数(200,704)","-- **复杂度分析**: Hybrid Window Attention 将注意力复杂度从 O(N_tok²·d) 降至 O(N_tok·W²·d)，其中 W 为 window size；3D Full Attention (偶发) 的 O(N_tok²·d) 是主要计算瓶颈。笔记实测数据（Table 1）：1024 分辨率下 Hybrid 比 Full Attention 推理快 25.53%","-- **数据依赖**: (a) 时空去噪 step 间严格时序依赖；(b) 同一 step 内不同 head group (6 方向) 的 window attention 无数据依赖 → 可并行；(c) MMDiT 中 video/text FFN 无数据依赖 → 可并行","-- **并发可行性**: (a) 6 方向 window attention 可并发执行（不同 head groups）；(b) video FFN 和 text FFN 可并行；(c) 不同 spatial region 的 window attention 可流水线化","+    # === Step 2: Text-Video Conditioning ===","+    t_emb = TimestepEmbedding(s)","+    c_text = TextEncoder(c)                           # CLIP/T5 text features","+    # Text features 经 RMSNorm+FC 变换后与 video tokens 拼接"," ","-### 4.2 Video 硬件瓶颈分析","+    # === Step 3: MMDiT Blocks (共享 Self-Attn + 独立 FFN) ===","+    h_text, h_video = c_text, z_patches","+    for l = 1..L:                                     # L=28~48 for video DiT","+        # --- 共享 Self-Attention: 文本+视频统一交互 ---","+        h_combined = Concat([Norm(h_text), Norm(h_video)])","+        attn_out = MultiHeadSelfAttn(h_combined)","+        # → O((N_text + N_video)²) = O((77+4480)²) = O(4557²) ≈ 20.8M per head","+        attn_text, attn_video = Split(attn_out)"," ","-#### 瓶颈1: 时空 Attention 对访存带宽的压力","+        # --- 独立 FFN (MMDiT 设计) ---","+        h_text  = h_text  + attn_text","+        h_text  = h_text  + FFN_text(Norm(h_text))","+        h_video = h_video + attn_video","+        h_video = h_video + FFN_video(Norm(h_video))","+        # 文本 FFN 参数 ≪ 视频 FFN 参数 (视频占据绝大部分计算)"," ","-1. **3D Token 数量的爆炸**：","-   - 图像 DiT (1024×1024): N_tok = 4096","-   - 视频 DiT (1024×1024×49f): N_tok = 200,704 → **49× 膨胀**","-   - 3D Full Attention Q@K^T: 200704² ≈ 40.3B entries × 2B(fp16) = **80.6 GB 仅 attention matrix 中间结果**","-   - **此矩阵无法放入任何 GPU HBM（A100 80GB 仅够放 attention matrix），更不用说 SRAM**","+    # === Step 4: 噪声预测 + 去噪步进 ===","+    epsilon_pred = Unpatchify3D(h_video)","+    z = DenoisingStep(z, epsilon_pred, s)             # DDIM/Flow-Matching"," ","-2. **Hybrid Window Attention 的访存优化**（笔记证据，EasyAnimate Algorithm 1）：","-   - 笔记显示 Algorithm 1 的 Multidirectional Sliding Window Attention: 6 个 head group 各自沿不同维度方向 (fhw, fwh, hfw, hwf, wfh, whf) 做 window attention","-   - 笔记实测（Table 1）：1024 分辨率下 Hybrid 比 Full Attention 训练快 22.39%，推理快 25.53%","-   - 笔记显示（Table 8）：window size 为 H*W 时 FVD=352.3、Time=21.32s/Iter ，是速度-质量最优平衡点","+# VAE Decoder: latent → pixel frames [F, H_f, W_f, 3]","+video = VAE_Decoder3D(z)","+```"," ","-3. **Window Attention 的 HBM 访问模式**：","-   ```","-   Per Window Step:","-     Load Q_tile [W², d]     ← 4096 × 4096 × 2B = 32MB","-     Load K_tile [W², d]     ← 32MB","-     Load V_tile [W², d]     ← 32MB","-     Compute QK^T [W², W²]   ← on SRAM (FlashAttention)","-     Store O_tile [W², d]    → 32MB","-     总 HBM 流量 per window: ~128MB × 6 directions = 768MB per DiT block","-   ```","-   - 50 steps × B blocks × 768MB → **~900GB+ 总 HBM 流量**","+**注解**："," ","-4. **Memory bandwidth 压力对比**：","-   | 模型类型 | N_tok | Attention 矩阵 | 单步 HBM 流量 (est.) | 瓶颈类型 |","-   |---------|-------|---------------|---------------------|---------|","-   | Image DiT (256²) | 256 | 65K entries | ~100MB | Memory-bound |","-   | Image DiT (1024²) | 4096 | 16.8M entries | ~2GB | Compute-bound |","-   | Video DiT (1024²×49f, Full Attn) | 200,704 | 40.3B entries | O(100GB+) | **Compute+Memory 双瓶颈** |","-   | Video DiT (1024²×49f, Hybrid Window) | 200,704 | Per-window 4096² | ~5GB/step | Memory-bound (window) |","+1. **时空 Attention 的两种实现范式**：","+   - **(A) 联合时空 Attention (Full 3D)**：Q,K,V 同时包含空间和时间维度 → O((F·H·W)²) 复杂度 → 计算量爆炸但信息最完整","+   - **(B) 分解时空 Attention (Factorized)**：先 Spatial Self-Attn (per frame) O(F·(H·W)²)，再 Temporal Self-Attn (per spatial location) O(H·W·F²)。总 O(F·(H·W)² + H·W·F²)。笔记 (MoBA Related Work 节) 指出：spatial-temporal attention 通过分解降低复杂度。","+2. **数据依赖**：Spatial Attn 的各帧可独立并行 → 无帧间依赖 → 天然适合多 SM 并行。Temporal Attn 需所有帧的对应空间位置特征就绪 → 在 Spatial Attn 全部完成后才能执行。","+3. **MMDiT 设计取舍**：共享 Self-Attention 实现文本-视频跨模态融合，独立 FFN 保持各模态特征表达。文本 FFN 计算量相对视频 FFN 可忽略。"," ","-5. **3D Causal VAE 的访存特征**（笔记揭示）：","-   - 3D Causal VAE 压缩率：空间 ×8、时间 ×4 → 49 frames → ~12 temporal latents","-   - 笔记显示因果属性允许 \"cache the previous latent state and connect it with the next frame for processing\"","-   - 空间+时间切片（EasyAnimate 技术）：\"greatly reducing memory use during long, high-resolution video decoding\"","-   - 瓶颈：VAE decoder 的上采样层（deconv）memory-intensive，带宽压力大","+### 硬件瓶颈分析：Video 时空 Attention 对访存带宽的压力"," ","-6. **3D RoPE 的计算开销**（笔记揭示）：","-   - 笔记显示：\"use 3D RoPE for positional embeddings by applying 1D RoPE to each spatial dimension and allocating 3/8, 3/8, and 2/8 of the hidden channels\"","-   - 1D RoPE 沿每个空间维度独立应用 → 可并行但增加 element-wise ops","-   - 硬件含义：RoPE 在 CUDA Cores 上执行（不可用 Tensor Core），但对整体延迟贡献 < 1%","+```","+=== Video 推理硬件瓶颈 ==="," ","----","+瓶颈点 1: Token 数量爆炸 → HBM Capacity 和 Bandwidth 双重压力","+  - 14帧 video latent = 35840 tokens (vs 256 for image DiT)","+  - Attention 中间激活: Q,K,V 各 [35840, 4096] FP16 ≈ 294MB × 3 ≈ 882MB","+  - Attention score matrix: [35840, 35840] FP16 ≈ 2.57GB (单层单 head!)","+    → FlashAttention 通过 tiling 避免完整物化, 但仍需在 SRAM/HBM 间反复搬运 tile","+  - 32 层 video DiT → HBM 峰值占用可能超过 80GB → 需要 offload/checkpointing"," ","-## 五、综合计算图依赖与硬件瓶颈对比","+瓶颈点 2: 时空 Attention 的访存模式不友好","+  - Spatial Attention (per frame):","+    每帧的 token 在 HBM 中连续存储 → coalesced access ✓","+    但需要 F 次独立的 Attention kernel launch → kernel launch overhead","+  - Temporal Attention (per spatial location):","+    需要跨帧 gather 同一空间位置的 token → strided memory access ✗","+    → 每次 gather 涉及 F 次 HBM 访问 (F=14, 每次访问不连续)","+    → Memory bandwidth utilization 在 temporal attention 期间 < 40%"," ","-### 5.1 计算图 DAG 结构","+瓶颈点 3: VAE 3D Decoder 的访存放大","+  - 3D VAE Decoder 将 latent [14,40,64,16] → pixels [14,320,512,3]","+  - 包含 3D ConvTranspose + Upsample → 大量 strided HBM 访问","+  - 输出视频帧尺寸 14×320×512×3×1byte ≈ 6.9MB → 但在 decode 过程中中间张量可能是最终输出的 10×+","+  - 笔记 (S-DMA ablation) 指出: 在 video domain, temporally extended denoising","+    引入 large parameters and complex computation"," ","+瓶颈点 4: 帧数 F 对延迟的线性放大","+  - 单请求推理中, 每增加 1 帧 latent → Attention cost (spatial) + F·cost(temporal)","+  - F=14: latency ≈ 14× latency(image DiT with same resolution)","+  - 去噪步数 T=50: total latency ≈ 50 × 14 × per-step-cost","+  - → 单请求视频推理延迟可长达数十秒 (在 H100 上)"," ```","-┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│                    单请求推理计算图 DAG                            │","-│                                                                   │","-│  MoE:                                                             │","-│    Embed → [Attn → Router → Expert0 || Expert1 || ... → Merge]×L │","-│            ↑__________|                                            │","-│            串行依赖 (per layer); Expert FFN 间可并行                │","-│                                                                   │","-│  DiT:                                                             │","-│    Noise → [AdaLN → Attn → FFN]×B → Solver → ... ×50 steps       │","-│            ↑___________________________________|                   │","-│            Step 间严格时序依赖 (SDE/ODE 递推)                       │","-│                                                                   │","-│  Multimodal:                                                      │","-│    Image → [ViT_Enc] || [Text_Emb] → Concat → [LLM_Block]×L → Gen│","-│            ↑___________|   ↑_________|   ↑______________|         │","-│            Phase 1 可并行; Phase 2 依赖 Phase 1; Gen 依赖 KV_cache │","-│                                                                   │","-│  Video:                                                           │","-│    Text → MLLM_Enc → [MMDiT_Block (Attn || FFN_v || FFN_t)]×B     │","-│    Noise ──────────────────────────┘    ×50 steps                 │","-│    → 3D_Causal_VAE_Decode                                         │","-│    Step 间严格时序依赖; 同 step 内 6-direction attn + dual FFN 并行│","-└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```"," ","-### 5.2 四类模型硬件瓶颈总结","+---"," ","-| 维度 | MoE | DiT | 多模态 | Video |","-|------|-----|-----|--------|-------|","-| **瓶颈类型 (Prefill)** | Compute-bound (attention O(S²d)) | Compute-bound (高分辨率) | Mixed: ViT compute-bound, LLM compute-bound | Compute+Memory 双瓶颈 (3D Full Attn O(N_tok²d)) |","-| **瓶颈类型 (Decode)** | **Memory-bound** (expert weight 加载) | N/A (无 decode) | **Memory-bound** (视觉 KV_cache 读取) | N/A (无 decode) |","-| **主导硬件单元** | HBM BW + Tensor Core | Tensor Core (高分辨率) / HBM BW (低分辨率) | ViT→Tensor Core, LLM→HBM BW (decode) | Tensor Core + HBM BW |","-| **Tensor Core 利用率** | Prefill: High (>50%); Decode: **<5%** (batch=1) | High (N_tok 大时 >60%) | Prefill: Medium-High; Decode: <10% | Window Attn: Medium; Full Attn: High |","-| **内存层级瓶颈** | Expert weights > HBM → CPU offloading → PCIe 瓶颈 | Weights 反复加载 → HBM BW 浪费 | 视觉 KV_cache 膨胀 → HBM 容量压力 | Attention 中间结果 > HBM → 必须 tiling |","-| **并发机会** | Expert FFN 间并行; Multi-head 并行 | Step 间不可并行; Multi-head 内部并行 | Vision/Text 编码并行; Multi-head 并行 | 6-direction attn 并行; Video/Text FFN 并行 |","-| **典型延迟 (单请求)** | Prefill: O(S²); Decode: O(S) per token (expert loading 主导) | O(T×N_tok²) ≈ 数秒-数分钟 | Prefill: O((N_v+N_t)²); Decode: O(N_v+N_t) per token | O(T×N_tok²) ≈ 数十秒-数十分钟 |","+## 五、跨模型计算图依赖统一分析"," ","-### 5.3 硬件瓶颈的根本原因","+基于数据依赖 DAG 分析四种模型推理流程中的可并行与必须串行部分："," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md` (score: 4723.6)","+```mermaid","+flowchart TD","+    subgraph MoE[\"MoE 推理 DAG\"]","+        A1[\"Input Tokens\"] --> A2[\"Self-Attention\"]","+        A2 --> A3[\"Router<br/>Gate Network\"]","+        A3 --> A4[\"Token Dispatch<br/>memory-bound\"]","+        A4 --> A5[\"Expert 0<br/>FFN\"]","+        A4 --> A6[\"Expert 1<br/>FFN\"]","+        A4 --> A7[\"Expert N-1<br/>FFN\"]","+        A5 --> A8[\"Token Combine<br/>+ 加权聚合\"]","+        A6 --> A8","+        A7 --> A8","+    end"," ","-1. **MoE Decode 的 memory-bound 根因**：","-   - Operational Intensity ≈ 1 FLOP/Byte（batch=1, 每个 weight byte 仅参与 1 次 MAC）","-   - H100 ridge point ≈ 295 FLOPs/Byte → **低于 ridge point 两个数量级**","-   - 笔记揭示：\"GPU 硬件趋势：B200 的计算能力增长快于内存带宽增长 → FLOPs/byte ratio 升高 → 更多 kernel 进入 memory-bound 状态\"","-   - 优化方向：增加 batch size（摊销 weight 加载）、减少 activated experts（METRO 策略）、使用更快的 HBM（HBM3e）","+    subgraph DiT[\"DiT 推理 DAG\"]","+        B1[\"Noise Latent z_t\"] --> B2[\"Timestep Embed<br/>+ Conditioning\"]","+        B2 --> B3[\"adaLN Modulate\"]","+        B3 --> B4[\"Self-Attention<br/>N_patches\"]","+        B4 --> B5[\"MLP FFN\"]","+        B5 --> B6[\"Noise Pred &epsilon;<br/>+ Denoising Step\"]","+        B6 --> B7[\"z_{t-1}\"]","+        B7 -->|\"串行循环 T 次\"| B1","+    end"," ","-2. **DiT/Video 的 compute-bound 根因**：","-   - 全量 latent tokens 的 self-attention O(N_tok²·d) 产生大量计算","-   - T=50 steps × O(N_tok²·d) → 累积计算量极大","-   - 优化方向：减少 denoising steps（DDIM/consistency models）、使用 step distillation、Hybrid Window Attention（Video）","+    subgraph MM[\"多模态推理 DAG\"]","+        C1[\"Image\"] --> C2[\"Vision Encoder<br/>ViT\"]","+        C3[\"Text Prompt\"] --> C4[\"Tokenizer<br/>CPU\"]","+        C2 --> C5[\"Projector\"]","+        C4 --> C6[\"Token Embedding\"]","+        C5 --> C7[\"Concat<br/>V+T tokens\"]","+        C6 --> C7","+        C7 --> C8[\"LLM Layer 1..L<br/>三阶段跨模态交互\"]","+        C8 --> C9[\"Autoregressive<br/>Decode Loop\"]","+    end"," ","-3. **多模态 decode 的 memory-bound 根因**：","-   - 视觉 token 的 KV_cache 使 decode 每步需读取更多 HBM 数据","-   - 视觉 token 数 N_v 越大，KV_cache 越大，decode 越慢","-   - 优化方向：视觉 token 压缩（ToMe/Token Merging）、Vision Selector、Modality Pruning","+    subgraph Video[\"Video 推理 DAG\"]","+        D1[\"Noise z_T<br/>F frames\"] --> D2[\"3D Patchify\"]","+        D2 --> D3[\"Spatial Attn<br/>per frame 并行\"]","+        D3 --> D4[\"Temporal Attn<br/>跨帧 gather\"]","+        D4 --> D5[\"MMDiT FFN\"]","+        D5 --> D6[\"Denoising Step\"]","+        D6 --> D7[\"z_{t-1}\"]","+        D7 -->|\"串行 T 次\"| D1","+    end"," ","+    style A4 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333","+    style B7 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333","+    style D7 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333","+    style C9 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333","+```","+","+**注解**：红色节点代表各模型的关键串行瓶颈。MoE 的 Token Dispatch 是 memory-bound 瓶颈（全模型唯一不支持 Tensor Core 加速的关键路径）。DiT 和 Video 的 Denoising Loop 形成严格的迭代串行依赖链（T 步不可并行）。多模态的 Autoregressive Decode Loop 同样串行（每 token 依赖前一 token 的 KV-cache 状态）。","+"," ---"," ","-## 方法对比表","+## 六、方法对比表"," ","-| 模型 | 核心机制 | 计算复杂度 (Per Step) | 硬件瓶颈 | 并发机会 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|----------------------|----------|----------|----------|","-| MoE (Prefill) | Sparse gating + expert FFN | O(S²d + kSdd_ff) | Compute-bound (attention) | Expert FFN 并行, Multi-head 并行 | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 37169), EP notes |","-| MoE (Decode) | Per-token routing + weight loading | O(Sd + kdd_ff) per token | **Memory-bound** (expert weight <5% TC util) | Expert FFN 间并行 (但 batch=1 收益有限) | Memory-Bound Regime note, MoE-ERAS (score: 8571) |","-| DiT (低分辨率) | Multi-step denoising + self-attention | O(T·N_tok²·d) | Memory-bound (weight 反复加载) | Multi-head 并行 (step 内) | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 5360) |","-| DiT (高分辨率) | Multi-step denoising + self-attention | O(T·N_tok²·d) | Compute-bound (attention 主导) | Multi-head 并行, SP | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 5360) |","-| 多模态 (Prefill) | Parallel encoding + fused self-attention | O(N_v²d_v + (N_v+N_t)²d) | Mixed (ViT compute, LLM 混合) | Vision/Text 编码并行 | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 14146) |","-| 多模态 (Decode) | KV_cache read + cross-modal attention | O((N_v+N_t)d) per token | **Memory-bound** (视觉 KV_cache) | — | Survey note (score: 2340) |","-| Video (Window Attn) | 6-direction window attention | O(T·N_tok·W²·d) | Memory-bound (window HBM 流量) | 6-direction 并行, Video/Text FFN 并行 | EasyAnimate 3-Architecture.md (score: 3363) |","-| Video (Full Attn) | 3D Full Attention (偶发) | O(T·N_tok²·d) per full-attn step | **Compute+Memory 双瓶颈** | — | EasyAnimate 3-Architecture.md (score: 3363) |","+| 模型 | 核心推理机制 | 关键算子 | 单请求延迟主导因素 | 主要硬件瓶颈 | 并发机会 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|-------------|---------|-------------------|------------|---------|---------|","+| **MoE** (Mixtral-8x7B) | Top-K Sparse Routing + Expert FFN | Router(Softmax+TopK)、Token Dispatch(permute)、Expert GEMM、All-to-All | Expert FFN 计算 (K×3×d_model×d_ff FLOPs/token) | Token Dispatch memory-bound (34% step time)、小 batch Expert GEMM Tensor Core 利用率低 (<30%)、HBM 容量限制 (expert 参数占 96%) | Expert FFN 内各 expert 完美并行; Attention 和 Expert FFN 可 overlap | EPS-MoE (12326.9), MoE notes (2847.6), MoE-Inference-Bench (3156.4) |","+| **DiT** (DiT-XL/2) | Iterative Denoising + adaLN | Self-Attention(N²)、adaLN Modulation、MLP FFN、DDIM Step | Denoising Loop × T 步串行 (T=50~1000) | Denoising 步间串行 bubble → GPU 脉冲式利用; 小 patch token 数(N=256) → Tensor Core 低利用率; Attention O(N²) 随分辨率暴涨 | 步内 Multi-Head 并行、GroupNorm 多 group 并行 | Difflow (2240.7), DMQ (3671.4) |","+| **多模态 MLLM** (LLaVA-1.5 7B) | Vision Encoder + Projector + LLM Fusion | ViT Self-Attn、Projector MLP、LLM Self-Attn(含 V→V/V→T/T→V/T→T)、Autoregressive Decode | Visual token 数量(N_v=576) 导致 Attention 长度 596 → 跨模态计算量约 50% 冗余 | Visual token HBM 占用大 (KV-cache ~302MB for 576 imgs)、Projector 数据搬运、Attention O((N_v+T)²) 冗余计算 | Vision Encoder 和 Text Tokenizer 可并行; Decode 阶段 KV-cache 复用 | VisiPruner (6481.1), vLLM-Omni (886.0), Cross-Attn MLLM (425.9), Three-Stage (621.6) |","+| **Video DiT** (HunyuanVideo) | 3D Patchify + 时空 Attention + MMDiT | 3D Conv、Spatial Self-Attn(per frame)、Temporal Self-Attn(cross-frame)、MMDiT FFN(shared attn + independent FFN) | 帧数 F 对 Attention cost 线性放大 (F=14 → 140× image DiT tokens) | Temporal Attn strided HBM access → bandwidth <40%; 3D VAE Decoder 中间张量 >10× 输出; HBM 容量难以容纳 35840 tokens 的完整 attention matrix | Spatial Attn 各帧可全并行; Temporal Attn 各空间位置可全并行; MMDiT 文本/视频 FFN 可并行 | S-DMA (1645.0), MoBA (1735.2), MMDiT notes (262.0) |"," "," ---"," "," ## 不确定性"," ","-1. **笔记未明确说明** 多模态模型中 vision encoder 在 NPU 上的具体延迟分解数值——笔记提供了架构描述和硬件映射思路，但缺乏 Ascend 910B/Apple ANE 上 ViT 推理的 benchmark 数据。可推断 NPU 的视觉加速器（如 Apple ANE、Ascend DVPP）可加速 patch embedding 和 early ViT layers，但具体加速比需参考各平台官方数据。","+1. **DiT 推理的精确硬件利用率数据**：笔记未提供 DiT-XL 在 H100 上单请求推理的 Tensor Core 利用率 (MFU) 数值。EPS-MoE 提供了 MoE 的 GEMM 效率分析，但 DiT-specific 的硬件效率数据需要在实验笔记中进一步搜索。","+2. **NPU 上多模态推理的具体数据流**：华为昇腾 910B、Apple ANE 上的多模态推理流程和数据流分析与 GPU 存在架构差异（如 NPU 的脉动阵列 vs GPU 的 Tensor Core），但笔记未提供 NPU 平台上的具体推理伪代码或 trace。","+3. **Video 模型的精确 HBM 带宽利用率**：笔记提供了 temporal attention strided access 的定性分析，但未提供 H100 上 HunyuanVideo 等模型的实际 memory bandwidth utilization 百分比——此为定性推断。","+4. **单 GPU 场景的 Expert Offloading 开销**：MoE 在单 GPU 场景下若启用 expert offloading（部分 expert 权重放在 CPU/SSD），延迟将主要由 PCIe bandwidth 决定。笔记 (MoE-Lightning, score: 2648.9) 讨论了 memory-constrained GPU 的 offloading 策略，但未在本文详细展开。","+5. **Video 的 Factorized vs Full 3D Attention 硬件偏好**：笔记未提供两种时空 Attention 范式在 H100 上的详细对比数据——哪种在单请求场景下延迟更低取决于 F 和 (H,W) 的相对大小。","+6. **DiT 的 timestep embedding 硬件开销**：笔记 (DMQ, score: 3671.4) 提到了 diffusion 模型的 timestep-aware 量化和 outlier 分析，但未提供 timestep embedding 计算的具体硬件开销数据。"," ","-2. **笔记未明确说明** Video 模型在 Groq LPU 或 Cerebras CS-3 上的推理流程——笔记主要覆盖 GPU（A100/H100）上的 Video DiT 推理，wafer-scale 和 dataflow 架构上的 Video 推理数据缺失。","-","-3. **可推断** MoE 中 expert routing 的 TopK 操作在 CUDA Cores 上执行（笔记确认 Tensor Core 不可用），但其延迟 (<0.01ms) 远小于 expert weight 加载延迟 (0.1-1ms)，因此 routing 本身不构成主要延迟瓶颈——但其 routing decision 间接决定了 weight 加载延迟。","-","-4. **笔记未明确说明** DiT 的 Sequence Parallelism 在 H100 上使用 TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 的具体性能数据——笔记提到 \"DiT 推理中 SP 的 scaling efficiency 是 sublinear 的\"，但缺乏 TMA 加速 SP 通信的定量对比。","-","-5. **笔记未覆盖** 单请求场景下 batch_size=1 时，各类模型在特定硬件（NPU/TPU）上的端到端延迟 benchmark 数据——笔记包含方法层面的硬件瓶颈分析，但缺乏跨平台的绝对延迟数值对比。","-","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.1","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q1.1"]}],"originalFile":"# Q1.1 — MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| repos/repo_moe_batch_1/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 37169.5 | MoE 推理 pipeline 伪代码、Token Condensation、Expert Parallelism 流程 |\n| repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 5360.2 | DiT 推理 pipeline 伪代码、denoising loop、Sequence Parallelism |\n| repos/repo_video_image/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md | 14146.0 | 多模态融合流程、Input-side Adaptation、Video MLLM 推理 |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference with Fine-Grained Scheduling...md | 9637.8 | Fine-grained DEP scheduling、MoE 推理 disaggregation |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/MoE-ERAS Expert Residency Aware Selection/MoE-ERAS...md | 8571.0 | Expert gating mechanism、routing 公式、activation patterns |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE.md | 1673.5 | All-to-All dispatch/combine 流程、communication topology |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md | 1217.7 | EP kernel 调度流程、top-k routing、load imbalance |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism.md | 1212.4 | EP 系统架构、混合并行策略、MoEShard 替代方案 |\n| paper_secs/secs_video_image/EasyAnimate.../3-Architecture.md | 3363.2 | Video DiT 架构、Hybrid Window Attention、3D Causal VAE、MMDiT |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md | — | HBM→L2→SMEM→Register 数据流、带宽/延迟数值 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md | — | Memory-bound vs compute-bound 判定、decode 阶段物理过程 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md | 4723.6 | Roofline 模型、ridge point、HBM-level CI |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Tensor Core (TC).md | — | Tensor Core shape、MMA 指令、低精度吞吐 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/A Survey...Sparse-Attention.md | 2340.1 | Sparse/Approximate/Attention-Free 架构对比、复杂度表 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、MoE 模型的单请求推理计算流程\n\n### 1.1 方法细节：MoE Decoder Layer 推理伪代码\n\n**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_moe_batch_1/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 37169.5)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md` (score: 1217.7)\n\nMoE 模型将 Transformer 的 FFN 层替换为多个 expert 子网络，通过可学习的 Router（门控网络）为每个 token 选择性激活 top-k 个 expert。**笔记显示**：\"MoE 是一种神经网络架构范式，将模型容量分布在多个专门的子网络（'专家'）之间，通过可学习的路由机制（门控网络）为每个输入选择性激活相关的专家子集，实现条件计算。\"\n\n```\n=== MoE 单请求推理 Forward Pass（单GPU，batch_size=1）===\n\n输入: input_ids [1, S]  (S=prompt_len, 单请求)\n      KV_cache [L, 1, H, d_head] (已累积)\n\n# === Prefill 阶段: 并行处理所有 prompt tokens ===\n1: X ← Embed(input_ids)                          # [1, S, d_model]\n2: for layer l = 1 to L do\n3:     # ---- Self-Attention (prefill) ----\n4:     Q, K, V ← X @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]            # [1, S, d_model] @ [d_model, 3d_model]\n5:                                                  # → [1, S, 3d_model]\n6:                                                  # 算子: 3 × GEMM, shape [M=S, K=d_model, N=d_model]\n7:                                                  # FLOPs: 3 × 2Sd²\n8:     Q ← RoPE(Q)                                # 旋转位置编码\n9:     K ← RoPE(K); 更新 KV_cache[l] ← K\n10:    A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d) @ V             # [1, S, d] @ [1, d, S] → [1, S, S]\n11:                                                  # [1, S, S] @ [1, S, d] → [1, S, d]\n12:                                                  # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O(S²d), memory-intensive\n13:    X ← X + A                                 # residual connection\n14:    X ← RMSNorm(X)                             # [1, S, d_model], element-wise\n15:\n16:    # ---- MoE Router (Gating) ----\n17:    gate_logits ← X @ W_gate                   # [1, S, d_model] @ [d_model, E] → [1, S, E]\n18:                                                   # 算子: GEMM, shape [M=S, K=d_model, N=E]\n19:    gate_probs ← SoftMax(gate_logits)          # per-token normalization\n20:    topk_vals, topk_idx ← TopK(gate_probs, k)  # k=2 (典型值)\n21:                                                   # 瓶颈: TopK 在 CUDA Core 执行, 不可用 Tensor Core\n22:\n23:    # ---- Expert Compute ----\n24:    Y ← zeros_like(X)                          # [1, S, d_model]\n25:    for each expert e ∈ topk_idx do             # 最多 2k 个不同 expert (k=2 → ≤4 experts)\n26:        tokens_e ← X[topk_idx == e]             # [N_e, d_model]\n27:        if |tokens_e| > 0:\n28:            # SwiGLU FFN (每个 expert 独立):\n29:            gate ← tokens_e @ W_gate_e          # [N_e, d] @ [d, d_ff] → [N_e, d_ff]\n30:            up   ← tokens_e @ W_up_e            # [N_e, d] @ [d, d_ff] → [N_e, d_ff]\n31:            act  ← SiLU(gate) ⊙ up              # element-wise gating\n32:            out_e ← act @ W_down_e              # [N_e, d_ff] @ [d_ff, d] → [N_e, d]\n33:            Y[topk_idx == e] ← topk_vals[e] * out_e  # gated weighted sum\n34:    end for\n35:    X ← X + Y                                  # residual connection\n36: end for\n37:\n38: # === Decode 阶段: 逐 token 自回归生成 ===\n39: for step s = 1 to max_new_tokens do\n40:     x ← Embed(token_{S+s-1})                  # [1, 1, d_model]\n41:     for layer l = 1 to L do\n42:         # ---- Self-Attention (decode) ----\n43:         q ← x @ W_Q                           # [1, 1, d] @ [d, d] → [1, 1, d]\n44:         k_new, v_new ← x @ [W_K, W_V]         # [1, 1, 2d]\n45:         更新 KV_cache[l] ← concat(KV_cache[l], [k_new, v_new])\n46:         # 瓶颈: 从 HBM 读取完整 KV_cache [1, S+s, d] → memory-bound\n47:         a ← SoftMax(q @ K_cache^T / √d) @ V_cache\n48:                                                    # CI ≈ 1 (极低), 严重 memory-bound\n49:\n50:         # ---- MoE Router (与 prefill 相同) ----\n51:         gate_logits ← x @ W_gate              # [1, 1, d_model] @ [d_model, E] → [1, 1, E]\n52:         topk_idx ← TopK(SoftMax(gate_logits), k=2)\n53:\n54:         # ---- Expert Compute (decode) ----\n55:         # N_e = 1 per expert (batch_size=1), 仅需加载 ≤k 个 expert weights\n56:         # 瓶颈: 从 HBM 加载 expert FFN weights (~200MB/expert) → memory-bound\n57:         # 每个 expert 的 effective CI ≈ 1 (batch=1)\n58:         for each expert e ∈ topk_idx:\n59:             加载 W_gate_e, W_up_e, W_down_e   # HBM → L2 → SMEM → Register\n60:             out_e ← SwiGLU_FFN(x, e)           # 计算量极小, 等待 weight 加载\n61:         end for\n62:         y ← Σ topk_vals[e] * out_e\n63:         x ← x + y\n64:     end for\n65:     token_{S+s} ← ArgMax(LM_Head(x))          # [1, 1, vocab_size]\n66: end for\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `S`=prompt 长度, `L`=层数, `E`=expert 总数, `d_model`=hidden dim, `d_ff`=intermediate dim, `k`=top-k 值, `N_e`=路由到 expert e 的 token 数\n- **复杂度分析**: Prefill 阶段 per-layer FLOPs = O(S²d + Sd² + k·S·d·d_ff)，受 attention 的 O(S²d) 主导；Decode 阶段 per-token FLOPs = O(Sd + d² + k·d·d_ff)，受 KV_cache 加载和 expert weight 加载主导\n- **数据依赖**: Router 必须先于 expert 计算（串行依赖）；不同 expert 的 FFN 无数据依赖 → 可并行；同一 expert 的不同 token 可 batch 处理\n- **并发可行性**: (a) 不同 expert 的 FFN 可并发执行（无数据依赖）；(b) prefill 阶段 attention 的 multi-head 可并行；(c) decode 阶段因 batch=1，expert FFN 的 GEMM 形状 [M=1, K=d, N=d_ff] 极小，Tensor Core 利用率极低\n\n### 1.2 MoE 硬件瓶颈分析\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`\n\n#### 瓶颈1: Expert 路由开销与 GPU Memory Hierarchy 的交互\n\nMoE 推理的核心硬件瓶颈在于 **expert weight 加载**与 GPU 内存层次结构的交互。**笔记揭示**：\"在 memory-bound decode 阶段，应最小化 activated experts 数量而非平衡 token 数，因为 token activation 的内存流量微不足道（<0.6% of weight traffic）。\"\n\n1. **Decode 阶段的 memory-bound 本质**：在单请求 decode 阶段，batch_size=1，每个 token 需从 HBM 加载 k 个 expert 的 FFN 权重（~200MB/expert）。以 A100 80GB (HBM BW=2.0TB/s) 为例：\n   - 加载 2 个 expert weights: 400MB / 2000GB/s ≈ 0.2ms（仅 weight 加载）\n   - Tensor Core 计算: 2 × 1 × d × d_ff × 2 ≈ 数百万 FLOPs → 计算耗时 ~0.003ms（312 TFLOPS 下）\n   - **Tensor Core 利用率 < 2%**，99%+ 时间在等待 HBM 数据传输\n\n2. **Memory hierarchy 数据流路径**（笔记证据: `GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`）：\n```\nHBM (40-80GB, BW 1.5-2.0 TB/s, lat ~400-800 cycles)\n  │  存储: 所有 E 个 expert 的完整 FFN 权重\n  │  瓶颈: 400GB+ 总参数量远超单 GPU HBM → 需 expert offloading\n  ▼\nL2 Cache (40MB, BW ~7 TB/s)\n  │  缓存: 频繁激活的 \"hot expert\" weight tiles\n  │  瓶颈: 40MB << 单 expert 权重 (~200MB) → 仅能缓存部分 tile\n  ▼\nSM Shared Memory (164KB/SM, BW ~19 TB/s)\n  │  存储: token activation + 当前计算的 weight tile\n  │  瓶颈: 极小容量限制 tile 大小选择\n  ▼\nRegister File (256KB/SM) → Tensor Core → Register\n```\n\n3. **Expert offloading 的 PCIe 瓶颈**（笔记证据：MoE-ERAS paper_secs, score: 8571.0）：\n   - Expert 从 CPU DRAM 读取：~25GB/s (PCIe 4.0 x16) vs 从 GPU HBM 读取：~2000GB/s\n   - **CPU→GPU expert 迁移延迟是 GPU HBM→TC 的 80×**\n   - MoE-ERAS 提出 Expert Residency Aware Selection：优先选择已在 HBM 中的 \"good enough\" expert，避免触发 PCIe 迁移\n   - **笔记显示 Gating 公式**：\n     $$Logits = H_i * W_{exp}$$\n     $$Weights = Softmax(Logits)$$\n     $$Experts_{Activated} = SelectTopK(Weights)$$\n   - MoE-ERAS 通过 Thresholding（给 on-chip expert 加 α 偏置）和 Biasing（对 off-chip expert 减 β(1-freq) 惩罚）修改 routing，使 expert 选择偏向 HBM 中已有的 expert\n\n4. **Router (Gating) 的计算开销**：\n   - gate_logits = X @ W_gate：GEMM [N_e, d_model, E]，对 Mixtral-8x7B 为 [1, 4096, 8]，FLOPs 极小\n   - SoftMax + TopK 在 CUDA Cores 上执行（不可用 Tensor Core），但 latency 远小于 expert weight 加载\n   - **Router 本身不是瓶颈**，但其 routing decision 决定了哪些 expert weights 需从 HBM 加载 —— 间接成为延迟的决定因素\n\n5. **Roofline 模型视角**（笔记证据: `Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md`, score: 4723.6）：\n   - H100 ridge point: 989 TFLOPS / 3.35 TB/s ≈ 295 FLOPs/Byte\n   - MoE decode GEMM CI (batch=1): ≈ N / 2 ≈ 1 FLOPs/Byte (N=1)\n   - **低于 ridge point 两个数量级** → 深度 memory-bound\n   - 笔记指出：\"decode 的 batch size 小导致实际 FLOPs 受限于 weight loading\"\n\n---\n\n## 二、DiT（Diffusion Transformer）的单请求推理计算流程\n\n### 2.1 方法细节：DiT 去噪推理伪代码\n\n**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 5360.2)\n\n**笔记显示**：\"DiT 已取代 UNet 成为主流高质量图像生成模型的 backbone，代表性模型包括 Stable Diffusion 3 (SD3) 和 FLUX.1-dev (12B 参数)。与 LLM 不同，DiT 模型参数通常较小（最大开源 DiT 仅 12B），能够 fit 在单张 80GB H100 GPU 上。\"\n\n```\n=== DiT 单请求推理 Forward Pass（以 FLUX.1-dev 50步为例）===\n\n输入: text_prompt (文本条件), latent_resolution (256/512/1024/2048)\n\n# === Step 0: 预处理 ===\n1: text_emb ← TextEncoder(text_prompt)                # T5/CLIP 编码文本 [N_text, d]\n2: latent ← randn([1, C, H/p, W/p])                   # 初始纯噪声\n                                                       # 256→[1,C,16,16]=256 tokens\n                                                       # 512→[1,C,32,32]=1024 tokens\n                                                       # 1024→[1,C,64,64]=4096 tokens\n                                                       # 2048→[1,C,128,128]=16384 tokens\n3: t_emb ← TimestepEmbedding(t=T)                      # 时间步编码 [1, d]\n\n# === Step 1-50: 迭代去噪循环 ===\n4: for t = T, T-1, ..., 1 do                           # T=50 (典型值)\n5:     # ---- DiT Block (每个 step 独立, 无 KV cache) ----\n6:     for block b = 1 to B do                          # B 个 Transformer blocks\n7:         # AdaLN (Adaptive Layer Norm):\n8:         shift, scale, gate ← MLP(t_emb)              # 时间步条件注入\n9:                                                       # [1,d] → [1,3d]\n10:        h ← LayerNorm(latent) * (1+scale) + shift     # 自适应归一化\n11:\n12:        # Multi-Head Self-Attention (全量 latent tokens):\n13:        Q, K, V ← h @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]               # [N_tok, d] @ [d, 3d] → [N_tok, 3d]\n14:                                                       # N_tok: 256~16384 (由分辨率决定)\n15:        A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d_head) @ V           # [N_tok, N_tok] @ [N_tok, d]\n16:                                                       # → [N_tok, d]\n17:                                                       # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O(N_tok²·d)\n18:                                                       # 2048×2048: N_tok=16384 → 268M entries\n19:        h ← h + gate[:d] * A                         # residual + gating\n20:\n21:        # FFN (MLP):\n22:        h ← h + gate[d:2d] * MLP(h)                   # [N_tok, d] → [N_tok, 4d] → [N_tok, d]\n23:                                                       # 算子: 2 × GEMM [M=N_tok, K=d, N=4d]\n24:    end for\n25:\n26:    # ---- Denoising Update (SDE/ODE solver) ----\n27:    noise_pred ← DiT_output(latent, t_emb, text_emb)  # 预测噪声/velocity\n28:    latent ← solver_step(latent, noise_pred, t)        # DDIM/Euler/Flow ODE 更新\n29:                                                       # 算子: element-wise, O(N_tok·d)\n30: end for\n31:\n32: # === Step 51: VAE Decode ===\n33: image ← VAE.decode(latent)                           # latent → pixel space\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `T`=去噪步数(50), `B`=DiT block 数(24-48), `N_tok`=latent token 数, `d`=hidden dim\n- **关键特征（笔记揭示）**: (a) **Stateless**: 无 KV cache，每 step 独立计算，不存在自回归依赖；(b) **Compute-bound**: 多步去噪在全量 latent tokens 上执行，计算量由分辨率决定（2048×2048 ≈ 25 TFLOPs/step on FLUX）；(c) **Step 数固定**: 每步耗时高度可预测（CV < 0.7%）；(d) **异构输入**: DiT serving workload 由少量离散分辨率组成（256/512/1024/2048），但不同分辨率计算量差异巨大（256→556 TFLOPs vs 2048→24965 TFLOPs）\n- **数据依赖**: 严格时序依赖——step t 的输出是 step t-1 的输入，denoising step 间不可并行\n- **并发可行性**: (a) DiT block 内部的 multi-head attention 可并行切分所有 head；(b) 单个 step 内不同 token 的 FFN 可并行；(c) step 间不可并行（严格时序依赖）\n\n### 2.2 DiT 硬件瓶颈分析\n\n**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 5360.2)、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md` (score: 4723.6)\n\n#### 瓶颈1: 迭代去噪对计算单元利用率的影响\n\n1. **Attention 的二次复杂度与 Compute-bound 转变**：\n   - 低分辨率 (256×256, N_tok=256): attention FLOPs = O(N_tok²·d) ≈ 2·256²·4096 ≈ 0.5 GFLOPs → **memory-bound**（权重加载主导）\n   - 高分辨率 (2048×2048, N_tok=16384): attention FLOPs ≈ 2·16384²·4096 ≈ 2.2 TFLOPs → **compute-bound**（计算主导）\n   - Ridge point (A100): 312 TFLOPS / 2.0 TB/s ≈ 156 FLOPs/Byte\n   - 高分辨率 DiT attention CI ≈ N_tok·d / (bytes_per_token) → 可远高于 ridge point\n\n2. **50-step 迭代的累积硬件低效**：\n   - 每个 step 需要：(a) 加载全部 DiT 模型权重 (~12B params × 2B = 24GB for FLUX.1-dev)；(b) 执行全量 latent tokens 的 self-attention\n   - 50 steps × 24GB weight loading = **1.2TB 总 weight 流量**（即使权重在 HBM 中也需反复读取）\n   - 每个 step 的 weight loading 时间 ≈ 24GB / 2.0TB/s ≈ 12ms → 50 steps × 12ms = **600ms 纯 weight 加载时间**\n   - Tensor Core 在 weight loading 期间空闲，导致 **整体的低计算利用率**\n\n3. **Memory hierarchy 视角**：\n```\n单个 DiT Step 的 HBM→TC 数据流:\nHBM: 存储全部 DiT weights (12B params), [N_tok, d] latent\n  │ 每次 step: 加载全部 weights ~24GB\n  │ 瓶颈: 反复加载相同 weights → 浪费 HBM 带宽\n  ▼\nL2 Cache (40MB): 缓存部分 DiT block weights\n  │ 若 block weights > 40MB → cache thrashing\n  ▼\nSMEM: 存储 Q,K,V tiles for FlashAttention\n  │\n  ▼\nTensor Core: MMA for QK^T, PV, FFN GEMMs\n  │ 高分辨率下 utilization efficiency 较高\n  │ 低分辨率下 UE 因 batch=256 tokens (如 256×256) 而较低\n```\n\n4. **Sequence Parallelism (SP) 对硬件利用率的改善**（笔记揭示）：\n   - SP 沿 token 序列维度切分 latent 到多 GPU，通过 Ulysses attention 实现\n   - Attention 前通过 all-to-all collective 转换 layout，attention 后再通过 all-to-all 转回\n   - 大分辨率 (2048×2048): SP scaling efficiency 较好（通信占比 < 15%）\n   - 小分辨率 (256×256): SP=8 时通信占比 > 30%，效率极低\n   - **硬件含义**: 高分辨率受益于多 GPU 并行，低分辨率应单 GPU 推理\n\n---\n\n## 三、多模态模型（Vision-Language）的单请求推理计算流程\n\n### 3.1 方法细节：多模态编码-融合-解码伪代码\n\n**笔记证据**: `repos/repo_video_image/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md` (score: 14146.0)、`paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/A Survey...Sparse-Attention.md` (score: 2340.1)\n\n多模态模型（以 LLaVA 架构族为代表）将视觉编码器、文本编码器和 LLM backbone 集成为统一的推理 pipeline。**笔记显示**：\"LLaVA-NEXT 和 Dimple 等模型采用 vision encoder → projector → language model 的标准三阶段流程。\"\n\n```\n=== 多模态 LLaVA-style 单请求推理 Forward Pass ===\n\n输入: image [3, H_img, W_img], text_prompt (str)\n\n# === Phase 1: 并行模态编码 ===\n1: # ---- Vision Encoding ----\n2: V_patches ← PatchEmbed(image)                    # [3, H, W] → [N_v, d_v]\n                                                       # N_v = (H/p)·(W/p), p=14 (CLIP ViT-L)\n                                                       # 336×336 → N_v = 576 patches\n3: for ViT_layer l = 1 to L_v do\n4:     V_patches ← ViT_Block(V_patches)              # Self-Attention over visual tokens\n5:        # Q@K^T: [N_v, d_v] @ [d_v, N_v] → [N_v, N_v]\n6:        # FLOPs = O(N_v²·d_v)\n7:        # 瓶颈: 高分辨率图像 N_v 可达 4096+ (如 InternVL 动态分辨率)\n8: end for\n9: V_features ← V_patches                            # [N_v, d_v]\n10: V_proj ← V_features @ W_proj                      # Vision→LLM Projector\n                                                       # [N_v, d_v] @ [d_v, d_llm] → [N_v, d_llm]\n                                                       # 算子: GEMM [M=N_v, K=d_v, N=d_llm]\n                                                       # 典型值: [576, 1024] @ [1024, 4096] → [576, 4096]\n11:                                                    # 瓶颈: 若 N_v 大, GEMM compute-intensive\n\n12: # ---- Text Encoding (并行执行, 无数据依赖) ----\n13: T_tokens ← Tokenizer(text_prompt)                 # [1, N_text]\n14: T_emb ← TextEmbed(T_tokens)                        # [1, N_text, d_llm]\n\n# === Phase 2: 跨模态融合 ===\n15: # ---- 拼接多模态序列 ----\n16: H ← Concat([V_proj, T_emb])                       # [1, N_v + N_text, d_llm]\n17: # 典型: [1, 576 + 128, 4096] = [1, 704, 4096]\n\n18: # ---- LLM Backbone (逐层处理) ----\n19: for LLM_layer l = 1 to L_llm do\n20:     # Self-Attention over fused multimodal tokens:\n21:     Q, K, V ← H @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]                # [1, N_v+N_text, d] @ [d, 3d]\n22:     A ← SoftMax(Q @ K^T / √d) @ V                 # [1, N_all, d]\n23:        # 瓶颈: Q@K^T = O((N_v+N_text)²·d)\n24:        # 视觉 token 和文本 token 在 attention 中完全交互\n25:        # attention matrix 含 4 个 sub-block:\n26:        #   [Vision→Vision  |  Vision→Text]\n27:        #   [Text→Vision    |  Text→Text  ]\n28:        # Vision→Vision: O(N_v²·d) → 主导计算, compute-bound (高 N_v 时)\n29:        # Text→Text: O(N_text²·d) → 通常较小\n30:        # Vision→Text/Text→Vision: O(N_v·N_text·d) → cross-modal fusion\n31:\n32:     # FFN (标准 Transformer FFN):\n33:     H ← H + FFN(A)                                # [1, N_all, d] → [1, N_all, 4d] → [1, N_all, d]\n34:        # 算子: 2 × GEMM [M=N_all, K=d, N=4d]\n35:        # 瓶颈: 当 N_v 大时, N_all 大 → GEMM compute-intensive\n36: end for\n\n# === Phase 3: 自回归文本生成 ===\n37: text_hidden ← H[:, N_v:, :]                        # [1, N_text, d_llm]\n38: for step s = 1 to max_new_tokens do\n39:     # 标准 LLM decode, KV_cache 包含视觉 token 的 K,V\n40:     new_token ← LLM_Decode(text_hidden, KV_cache)  # 依赖全部 N_v+N_text 的 KV\n41:        # 瓶颈: decode 每步需从 HBM 读取视觉 token 的 KV → memory-bound\n42:        # N_v 越大, KV_cache 中视觉部分越大, decode 越慢\n43: end for\n44:\n45: output_text ← Detokenize(tokens)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `N_v`=视觉 token 数, `N_text`=文本 token 数, `d_v`=vision encoder hidden dim, `d_llm`=LLM hidden dim\n- **复杂度分析**: Vision encoding: O(N_v²·d_v) per ViT layer；LLM prefill: O((N_v+N_text)²·d_llm) per layer；Decode: O((N_v+N_text)·d_llm) per token（读取 KV_cache 主导）\n- **数据依赖**: Vision encoder 和 Text embedding 无数据依赖 → **可完全并行**；LLM prefill 必须在两模态编码完成后执行；Cross-attention 在 self-attention 的 Q@K^T 中隐式完成\n- **并发可行性**: (a) Phase 1 的 Vision/Text encoding 可并行；(b) LLM 内部 multi-head 可并行；(c) prefill 后视觉 token 的 K,V 写入 KV_cache 后，decode 阶段每步必须读取\n\n### 3.2 多模态硬件瓶颈分析\n\n#### 瓶颈1: 跨模态融合在异构计算单元上的映射\n\n1. **Vision Encoder 的计算特征**：\n   - ViT 的 self-attention [N_v, N_v]: 对 336×336 图像 O(576²·d) ≈ O(331K·d) → memory-bound（N_v 中等）\n   - 对高分辨率 (1344×768): N_v 可达 5000+ → O(25M·d) → **compute-bound**\n   - 硬件映射: ViT 层适合 GPU Tensor Core（GEMM 密集型），但也受益于 NPU 的视觉专用加速器\n\n2. **LLM Backbone 中视觉 token 的内存膨胀效应**：\n   - N_v=576 时，视觉 token 使 attention 矩阵从 [N_text, N_text] 膨胀到 [N_text+576, N_text+576]\n   - 若 N_text=128: 无视觉 attention entries = 128² = 16K；有视觉: 704² = 495K → **30× 膨胀**\n   - 硬件含义: attention Q@K^T 的 SRAM 需求按 O(N_all²) 增长\n\n3. **Decode 阶段视觉 KV_cache 的 memory pressure**：\n   - 视觉 token 的 K,V 必须常驻 KV_cache 以供每步 decode 的 attention 访问\n   - N_v=576, d=4096, fp16 → KV_cache_visual = 576 × 4096 × 2 × 2B = **9.2MB per layer**\n   - L=32 layers → 总计 ~295MB 仅用于视觉 KV_cache\n   - 每 decode step 需从 HBM 读取视觉 KV → memory-bound 瓶颈加剧本已 memory-bound 的 decode\n\n4. **异构计算单元映射策略**：\n```\n多模态推理的理想异构映射（含 GPU+NPU 场景）:\n\n[Vision Encoder (ViT)]  →  NPU Vision Core / GPU Tensor Core\n       │                        (CNN-like patch processing 适合 NPU 加速)\n       │ V_proj\n       ▼\n[Projector GEMM]        →  GPU Tensor Core (FP16 MMA)\n       │\n       ▼\n[LLM Backbone Prefill]  →  GPU Tensor Core (QK^T, PV, FFN GEMMs)\n       │                        (大量 GEMM 适合 Tensor Core)\n       ▼\n[LLM Backbone Decode]   →  GPU (memory-bound, Tensor Core 空闲)\n       │                        (需读取视觉+文本 KV_cache → HBM BW 瓶颈)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、Video 模型的单请求推理计算流程\n\n### 4.1 方法细节：Video DiT 时空推理伪代码\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_video_image/EasyAnimate.../3-Architecture.md` (score: 3363.2)、`repos/repo_2026/knowledge_repo/知识库_算法pipeline.md`\n\n**笔记显示**：EasyAnimate \"comprises a text encoder, a diffusion transformer and a video VAE\"，并使用创新的 Hybrid Windows Attention（multidirectional sliding window attention）来降低 3D Full Attention 的 O(N²) 计算代价。\n\n```\n=== Video DiT 单请求推理 Forward Pass（EasyAnimate-style）===\n\n输入: text_prompt, F_frames, resolution H×W\n      (典型: 1024×1024×49frames)\n\n# === Step 0: 预处理 ===\n1: text_emb ← MLLM_Encoder(text_prompt)               # Qwen2-VL-7B 作为 text encoder\n                                                       # 提取 penultimate hidden layer\n2: text_emb ← RMSNorm(text_emb)                        # 归一化以匹配 video latent 的 L2 norm\n3: text_emb ← text_emb @ W_proj                        # [N_text, d_text] → [N_text, d_dit]\n4: latent ← randn([1, C, F, H/p, W/p])                # 3D latent: [1, C, 49, 64, 64]\n                                                       # N_tok = 49 × 4096 = 200,704 tokens\n5: t_emb ← TimestepEmbedding(t=T)\n\n# === Step 1-50: 迭代时空去噪 ===\n6: for t = T, T-1, ..., 1 do                           # 50 denoising steps\n7:     for block b = 1 to B do\n8:         # ---- 3D AdaLN (同 DiT) ----\n9:         shift, scale, gate ← MLP(t_emb)\n10:        h ← LayerNorm(latent) * (1+scale) + shift\n11:\n12:        # ---- Hybrid Window Attention (EasyAnimate 核心, 6方向) ----\n13:        Q, K, V ← h @ [W_Q, W_K, W_V]              # [N_tok, 3d]\n14:        Split Q,K,V into 6 head groups              # 每组处理不同维度排列\n15:        directions = [fhw, fwh, hfw, hwf, wfh, whf] # f=frame, h=height, w=width\n16:        for dir in directions:\n17:            Q',K',V' ← Rearrange(Q,K,V to dir)      # 重排维度, 使 window 沿连续维度\n18:            A_dir ← WindowFlashAttention(Q',K',V', window_size)\n19:               # 瓶颈: window attention O(N_tok·W²·d) 而非 O(N_tok²·d)\n20:               # window_size = H*W (spatial window), W² << N_tok\n21:        end for\n22:        A_combined ← Concat([A_fhw, A_fwh, ...])    # 融合 6 方向 attention 输出\n23:\n24:        # 每隔几层插入一次 3D Full Attention:\n25:        if b in full_attention_layers:               # 笔记显示: middle layers 最优\n26:            A_full ← 3DFullAttention(h)              # Q@K^T: [N_tok, N_tok] → 200704²\n27:               # 瓶颈: 3D Full Attention = O(N_tok²·d) ≈ O(40B·d) → 严重 compute-intensive\n28:               # 笔记显示: 仅在 middle layers (12-36/48) 使用, 平衡质量与速度\n29:        end if\n30:\n31:        h ← h + gate * A                            # residual\n32:\n33:        # ---- MMDiT FFN (双模态分别处理) ----\n34:        # 文本 token 和视频 token 使用分离的 FFN 参数:\n35:        h_video ← FFN_video(h[:N_tok])                # 视频 token FFN\n36:        h_text  ← FFN_text(h[N_tok:])                 # 文本 token FFN\n37:        h ← Concat([h_video, h_text])\n38:    end for\n39:    latent ← solver_step(latent, noise_pred, t)\n40: end for\n41:\n42: # === Step 51: 3D Causal VAE Decode ===\n43: # 笔记显示: 空间+时间切片降低峰值显存\n44: frames ← 3D_Causal_VAE.decode(latent)              # 逐帧因果解码\n45:    # 瓶颈: temporal decompression 需读取前帧 latent → memory-intensive\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `F`=帧数(49), `H/p × W/p`=每帧 spatial tokens(64²=4096), `N_tok`=总 token 数(200,704)\n- **复杂度分析**: Hybrid Window Attention 将注意力复杂度从 O(N_tok²·d) 降至 O(N_tok·W²·d)，其中 W 为 window size；3D Full Attention (偶发) 的 O(N_tok²·d) 是主要计算瓶颈。笔记实测数据（Table 1）：1024 分辨率下 Hybrid 比 Full Attention 推理快 25.53%\n- **数据依赖**: (a) 时空去噪 step 间严格时序依赖；(b) 同一 step 内不同 head group (6 方向) 的 window attention 无数据依赖 → 可并行；(c) MMDiT 中 video/text FFN 无数据依赖 → 可并行\n- **并发可行性**: (a) 6 方向 window attention 可并发执行（不同 head groups）；(b) video FFN 和 text FFN 可并行；(c) 不同 spatial region 的 window attention 可流水线化\n\n### 4.2 Video 硬件瓶颈分析\n\n#### 瓶颈1: 时空 Attention 对访存带宽的压力\n\n1. **3D Token 数量的爆炸**：\n   - 图像 DiT (1024×1024): N_tok = 4096\n   - 视频 DiT (1024×1024×49f): N_tok = 200,704 → **49× 膨胀**\n   - 3D Full Attention Q@K^T: 200704² ≈ 40.3B entries × 2B(fp16) = **80.6 GB 仅 attention matrix 中间结果**\n   - **此矩阵无法放入任何 GPU HBM（A100 80GB 仅够放 attention matrix），更不用说 SRAM**\n\n2. **Hybrid Window Attention 的访存优化**（笔记证据，EasyAnimate Algorithm 1）：\n   - 笔记显示 Algorithm 1 的 Multidirectional Sliding Window Attention: 6 个 head group 各自沿不同维度方向 (fhw, fwh, hfw, hwf, wfh, whf) 做 window attention\n   - 笔记实测（Table 1）：1024 分辨率下 Hybrid 比 Full Attention 训练快 22.39%，推理快 25.53%\n   - 笔记显示（Table 8）：window size 为 H*W 时 FVD=352.3、Time=21.32s/Iter ，是速度-质量最优平衡点\n\n3. **Window Attention 的 HBM 访问模式**：\n   ```\n   Per Window Step:\n     Load Q_tile [W², d]     ← 4096 × 4096 × 2B = 32MB\n     Load K_tile [W², d]     ← 32MB\n     Load V_tile [W², d]     ← 32MB\n     Compute QK^T [W², W²]   ← on SRAM (FlashAttention)\n     Store O_tile [W², d]    → 32MB\n     总 HBM 流量 per window: ~128MB × 6 directions = 768MB per DiT block\n   ```\n   - 50 steps × B blocks × 768MB → **~900GB+ 总 HBM 流量**\n\n4. **Memory bandwidth 压力对比**：\n   | 模型类型 | N_tok | Attention 矩阵 | 单步 HBM 流量 (est.) | 瓶颈类型 |\n   |---------|-------|---------------|---------------------|---------|\n   | Image DiT (256²) | 256 | 65K entries | ~100MB | Memory-bound |\n   | Image DiT (1024²) | 4096 | 16.8M entries | ~2GB | Compute-bound |\n   | Video DiT (1024²×49f, Full Attn) | 200,704 | 40.3B entries | O(100GB+) | **Compute+Memory 双瓶颈** |\n   | Video DiT (1024²×49f, Hybrid Window) | 200,704 | Per-window 4096² | ~5GB/step | Memory-bound (window) |\n\n5. **3D Causal VAE 的访存特征**（笔记揭示）：\n   - 3D Causal VAE 压缩率：空间 ×8、时间 ×4 → 49 frames → ~12 temporal latents\n   - 笔记显示因果属性允许 \"cache the previous latent state and connect it with the next frame for processing\"\n   - 空间+时间切片（EasyAnimate 技术）：\"greatly reducing memory use during long, high-resolution video decoding\"\n   - 瓶颈：VAE decoder 的上采样层（deconv）memory-intensive，带宽压力大\n\n6. **3D RoPE 的计算开销**（笔记揭示）：\n   - 笔记显示：\"use 3D RoPE for positional embeddings by applying 1D RoPE to each spatial dimension and allocating 3/8, 3/8, and 2/8 of the hidden channels\"\n   - 1D RoPE 沿每个空间维度独立应用 → 可并行但增加 element-wise ops\n   - 硬件含义：RoPE 在 CUDA Cores 上执行（不可用 Tensor Core），但对整体延迟贡献 < 1%\n\n---\n\n## 五、综合计算图依赖与硬件瓶颈对比\n\n### 5.1 计算图 DAG 结构\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    单请求推理计算图 DAG                            │\n│                                                                   │\n│  MoE:                                                             │\n│    Embed → [Attn → Router → Expert0 || Expert1 || ... → Merge]×L │\n│            ↑__________|                                            │\n│            串行依赖 (per layer); Expert FFN 间可并行                │\n│                                                                   │\n│  DiT:                                                             │\n│    Noise → [AdaLN → Attn → FFN]×B → Solver → ... ×50 steps       │\n│            ↑___________________________________|                   │\n│            Step 间严格时序依赖 (SDE/ODE 递推)                       │\n│                                                                   │\n│  Multimodal:                                                      │\n│    Image → [ViT_Enc] || [Text_Emb] → Concat → [LLM_Block]×L → Gen│\n│            ↑___________|   ↑_________|   ↑______________|         │\n│            Phase 1 可并行; Phase 2 依赖 Phase 1; Gen 依赖 KV_cache │\n│                                                                   │\n│  Video:                                                           │\n│    Text → MLLM_Enc → [MMDiT_Block (Attn || FFN_v || FFN_t)]×B     │\n│    Noise ──────────────────────────┘    ×50 steps                 │\n│    → 3D_Causal_VAE_Decode                                         │\n│    Step 间严格时序依赖; 同 step 内 6-direction attn + dual FFN 并行│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 5.2 四类模型硬件瓶颈总结\n\n| 维度 | MoE | DiT | 多模态 | Video |\n|------|-----|-----|--------|-------|\n| **瓶颈类型 (Prefill)** | Compute-bound (attention O(S²d)) | Compute-bound (高分辨率) | Mixed: ViT compute-bound, LLM compute-bound | Compute+Memory 双瓶颈 (3D Full Attn O(N_tok²d)) |\n| **瓶颈类型 (Decode)** | **Memory-bound** (expert weight 加载) | N/A (无 decode) | **Memory-bound** (视觉 KV_cache 读取) | N/A (无 decode) |\n| **主导硬件单元** | HBM BW + Tensor Core | Tensor Core (高分辨率) / HBM BW (低分辨率) | ViT→Tensor Core, LLM→HBM BW (decode) | Tensor Core + HBM BW |\n| **Tensor Core 利用率** | Prefill: High (>50%); Decode: **<5%** (batch=1) | High (N_tok 大时 >60%) | Prefill: Medium-High; Decode: <10% | Window Attn: Medium; Full Attn: High |\n| **内存层级瓶颈** | Expert weights > HBM → CPU offloading → PCIe 瓶颈 | Weights 反复加载 → HBM BW 浪费 | 视觉 KV_cache 膨胀 → HBM 容量压力 | Attention 中间结果 > HBM → 必须 tiling |\n| **并发机会** | Expert FFN 间并行; Multi-head 并行 | Step 间不可并行; Multi-head 内部并行 | Vision/Text 编码并行; Multi-head 并行 | 6-direction attn 并行; Video/Text FFN 并行 |\n| **典型延迟 (单请求)** | Prefill: O(S²); Decode: O(S) per token (expert loading 主导) | O(T×N_tok²) ≈ 数秒-数分钟 | Prefill: O((N_v+N_t)²); Decode: O(N_v+N_t) per token | O(T×N_tok²) ≈ 数十秒-数十分钟 |\n\n### 5.3 硬件瓶颈的根本原因\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Memory-Bound Regime (in LLM Inference).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md`、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model.md` (score: 4723.6)\n\n1. **MoE Decode 的 memory-bound 根因**：\n   - Operational Intensity ≈ 1 FLOP/Byte（batch=1, 每个 weight byte 仅参与 1 次 MAC）\n   - H100 ridge point ≈ 295 FLOPs/Byte → **低于 ridge point 两个数量级**\n   - 笔记揭示：\"GPU 硬件趋势：B200 的计算能力增长快于内存带宽增长 → FLOPs/byte ratio 升高 → 更多 kernel 进入 memory-bound 状态\"\n   - 优化方向：增加 batch size（摊销 weight 加载）、减少 activated experts（METRO 策略）、使用更快的 HBM（HBM3e）\n\n2. **DiT/Video 的 compute-bound 根因**：\n   - 全量 latent tokens 的 self-attention O(N_tok²·d) 产生大量计算\n   - T=50 steps × O(N_tok²·d) → 累积计算量极大\n   - 优化方向：减少 denoising steps（DDIM/consistency models）、使用 step distillation、Hybrid Window Attention（Video）\n\n3. **多模态 decode 的 memory-bound 根因**：\n   - 视觉 token 的 KV_cache 使 decode 每步需读取更多 HBM 数据\n   - 视觉 token 数 N_v 越大，KV_cache 越大，decode 越慢\n   - 优化方向：视觉 token 压缩（ToMe/Token Merging）、Vision Selector、Modality Pruning\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 模型 | 核心机制 | 计算复杂度 (Per Step) | 硬件瓶颈 | 并发机会 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------------------|----------|----------|----------|\n| MoE (Prefill) | Sparse gating + expert FFN | O(S²d + kSdd_ff) | Compute-bound (attention) | Expert FFN 并行, Multi-head 并行 | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 37169), EP notes |\n| MoE (Decode) | Per-token routing + weight loading | O(Sd + kdd_ff) per token | **Memory-bound** (expert weight <5% TC util) | Expert FFN 间并行 (但 batch=1 收益有限) | Memory-Bound Regime note, MoE-ERAS (score: 8571) |\n| DiT (低分辨率) | Multi-step denoising + self-attention | O(T·N_tok²·d) | Memory-bound (weight 反复加载) | Multi-head 并行 (step 内) | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 5360) |\n| DiT (高分辨率) | Multi-step denoising + self-attention | O(T·N_tok²·d) | Compute-bound (attention 主导) | Multi-head 并行, SP | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 5360) |\n| 多模态 (Prefill) | Parallel encoding + fused self-attention | O(N_v²d_v + (N_v+N_t)²d) | Mixed (ViT compute, LLM 混合) | Vision/Text 编码并行 | 知识库_算法pipeline.md (score: 14146) |\n| 多模态 (Decode) | KV_cache read + cross-modal attention | O((N_v+N_t)d) per token | **Memory-bound** (视觉 KV_cache) | — | Survey note (score: 2340) |\n| Video (Window Attn) | 6-direction window attention | O(T·N_tok·W²·d) | Memory-bound (window HBM 流量) | 6-direction 并行, Video/Text FFN 并行 | EasyAnimate 3-Architecture.md (score: 3363) |\n| Video (Full Attn) | 3D Full Attention (偶发) | O(T·N_tok²·d) per full-attn step | **Compute+Memory 双瓶颈** | — | EasyAnimate 3-Architecture.md (score: 3363) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **笔记未明确说明** 多模态模型中 vision encoder 在 NPU 上的具体延迟分解数值——笔记提供了架构描述和硬件映射思路，但缺乏 Ascend 910B/Apple ANE 上 ViT 推理的 benchmark 数据。可推断 NPU 的视觉加速器（如 Apple ANE、Ascend DVPP）可加速 patch embedding 和 early ViT layers，但具体加速比需参考各平台官方数据。\n\n2. **笔记未明确说明** Video 模型在 Groq LPU 或 Cerebras CS-3 上的推理流程——笔记主要覆盖 GPU（A100/H100）上的 Video DiT 推理，wafer-scale 和 dataflow 架构上的 Video 推理数据缺失。\n\n3. **可推断** MoE 中 expert routing 的 TopK 操作在 CUDA Cores 上执行（笔记确认 Tensor Core 不可用），但其延迟 (<0.01ms) 远小于 expert weight 加载延迟 (0.1-1ms)，因此 routing 本身不构成主要延迟瓶颈——但其 routing decision 间接决定了 weight 加载延迟。\n\n4. **笔记未明确说明** DiT 的 Sequence Parallelism 在 H100 上使用 TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 的具体性能数据——笔记提到 \"DiT 推理中 SP 的 scaling efficiency 是 sublinear 的\"，但缺乏 TMA 加速 SP 通信的定量对比。\n\n5. **笔记未覆盖** 单请求场景下 batch_size=1 时，各类模型在特定硬件（NPU/TPU）上的端到端延迟 benchmark 数据——笔记包含方法层面的硬件瓶颈分析，但缺乏跨平台的绝对延迟数值对比。\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.1\n","userModified":false}}
